для сборки лобовых окон","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: Zustand لبناء التطبيقات","en":"zustand"},"description":{"zh":"Zustand 是一个状态管理工具，简化lobe-windos-build。使用 Zustand AI 에이전트提高开发效率","ja":" Zustandは状態管理ツールで、lobe-windos-buildを簡素化。Zustand AIエージェントで開発効率を向上","ko":" Zustand는 상태 관리 도구로 lobe-windos-build를 간소화합니다. Zustand AI 에이전트로 개발 효율성을 높이세요","es":"Zustand es una biblioteca de estado de React para gestionar el estado de tus aplicaciones de manera eficiente. Se integra perfectamente con lobe-windos-build.","fr":"Zustand est une bibliothèque d''état React pour gérer l''état de vos applications de manière efficace. Elle s''intègre parfaitement à lobe-windos-build.","de":"Zustand ist eine React-Zustandsbibliothek, um den Zustand Ihrer Anwendungen effizient zu verwalten. Sie integriert sich nahtlos in lobe-windos-build.","pt":"O Zustand é uma ferramenta de AI que ajuda no desenvolvimento de aplicativos com build de lobe-windos, permitindo uma maior eficiência e produtividade","ru":"Zustand - это ИИ Агент, который помогает в разработке приложений с сборкой лобовых окон, обеспечивая большую эффективность и производительность","ar":"Zustand هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تساعد في تطوير التطبيقات مع بناء لوب-وندوز، مما يسمح بزيادة الكفاءة والإنتاجية","en":"lobe-windos-build"},"definition":{"en":"lobe-windos-build"},"features":{"zh":["简化状态管理","提高开发效率","支持lobe-windos-build","轻量级和可扩展","易于使用和集成"],"ja":["状態管理の簡素化","開発効率の向上","lobe-windos-buildのサポート","軽量化と拡張性","使いやすさと統合性"],"ko":["상태 관리 간소화","개발 효율성 향상","lobe-windos-build 지원","경량화와 확장성","사용 용이성과 통합성"],"es":["Gestión de estado de React","Integración con lobe-windos-build","Fácil de usar y configurar","Mejora del rendimiento de la aplicación","Compatibilidad con diferentes versiones de React"],"fr":["Gestion d''état React","Intégration à lobe-windos-build","Facile à utiliser et à configurer","Amélioration des performances de l''application","Compatibilité avec différentes versions de React"],"de":["React-Zustandsverwaltung","Integration in lobe-windos-build","Einfach zu bedienen und konfigurieren","Leistungsverbesserung der Anwendung","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen React-Versionen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos com build de lobe-windos","Integração com React","Melhoria da eficiência e produtividade","Fácil instalação e configuração","Suporte a CLI"],"ru":["Разработка приложений с сборкой лобовых окон","Интеграция с React","Повышение эффективности и производительности","Легкая установка и настройка","Поддержка CLI"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات مع بناء لوب-وندوز","التكامل مع React","تحسين الكفاءة والإنتاجية","تثبيت وتهيئة سهلة","دعم CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Zustand AIエージェント","状态管理工具","lobe-windos-build","JavaScript 状态管理","Zustand 安装","Zustand 教程","Zustand vs Redux","Zustand alternative"],"ja":["Zustand AIエージェント","状態管理ツール","lobe-windos-build","JavaScript 状態管理","Zustand インストール","Zustand チュートリアル","Zustand vs Redux","Zustand 代替"],"ko":["Zustand AI 에이전트","상태 관리 도구","lobe-windos-build","JavaScript 상태 관리","Zustand 설치","Zustand 튜토리얼","Zustand vs Redux","Zustand 대안"],"es":["cómo usar Zustand","qué es Zustand","Zustand vs Redux","instalación de Zustand","guía de configuración de Zustand","herramientas de estado de React","lobe-windos-build alternativa","Zustand para principiantes"],"fr":["comment utiliser Zustand","quoi est Zustand","Zustand vs Redux","installation de Zustand","guide de configuration de Zustand","outils d''état React","lobe-windos-build alternative","Zustand pour débutants"],"de":["wie man Zustand verwendet","was ist Zustand","Zustand vs Redux","Installation von Zustand","Konfigurationsanleitung für Zustand","React-Zustandstools","lobe-windos-build Alternative","Zustand für Anfänger"],"pt":["como usar zustand","o que é zustand","zustand vs react","zustand alternative","zustand install","zustand setup guide","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com ai","ferramentas de ai para desenvolvimento"],"ru":["как использовать zustand","что такое zustand","zustand vs react","zustand alternative","zustand установка","zustand руководство по настройке","разработка приложений с ии","инструменты ии для разработки"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام zustand","ما هو zustand","zustand vs react","zustand alternative","تثبيت zustand","دليل إعداد zustand","تطوير التطبيقات مع ذكاء اصطناعي","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي لتطوير البرامج"]}},"owner":"Staysr","repo":"lobe-windos-build","repoPath":"Staysr/lobe-windos-build","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T01:34:35Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"zustand","description":"Zustand state management guide. Use when working with store code (src/store/**), implementing actions, managing state, or creating slices. Triggers on Zustand store development, state management questions, or action implementation.","bodyPreview":"# LobeHub Zustand State Management\n\n## Action Type Hierarchy\n\n### 1. Public Actions\n\nMain interfaces for UI components:\n\n- Naming: Verb form (`createTopic`, `sendMessage`)\n- Responsibilities: Parameter validation, flow orchestration\n\n### 2. Internal Actions (`internal_*`)\n\nCore business logic implementation:\n\n- Naming: `internal_` prefix (`internal_createTopic`)\n- Responsibilities: Optimistic updates, service calls, error handling\n- Should not be called directly by UI\n\n### 3. Dispatch Methods (`","body":"# LobeHub Zustand State Management\n\n## Action Type Hierarchy\n\n### 1. Public Actions\n\nMain interfaces for UI components:\n\n- Naming: Verb form (`createTopic`, `sendMessage`)\n- Responsibilities: Parameter validation, flow orchestration\n\n### 2. Internal Actions (`internal_*`)\n\nCore business logic implementation:\n\n- Naming: `internal_` prefix (`internal_createTopic`)\n- Responsibilities: Optimistic updates, service calls, error handling\n- Should not be called directly by UI\n\n### 3. Dispatch Methods (`internal_dispatch*`)\n\nState update handlers:\n\n- Naming: `internal_dispatch` + entity (`internal_dispatchTopic`)\n- Responsibilities: Calling reducers, updating store\n\n## When to Use Reducer vs Simple `set`\n\n**Use Reducer Pattern:**\n\n- Managing object lists/maps (`messagesMap`, `topicMaps`)\n- Optimistic updates\n- Complex state transitions\n\n**Use Simple `set`:**\n\n- Toggling booleans\n- Updating simple values\n- Setting single state fields\n\n## Optimistic Update Pattern\n\n```typescript\ninternal_createTopic: async (params) => {\n  const tmpId = Date.now().toString();\n\n  // 1. Immediately update frontend (optimistic)\n  get().internal_dispatchTopic(\n    { type: ''addTopic'', value: { ...params, id: tmpId } },\n    ''internal_createTopic''\n  );\n\n  // 2. Call backend service\n  const topicId = await topicService.createTopic(params);\n\n  // 3. Refresh for consistency\n  await get().refreshTopic();\n  return topicId;\n},\n```\n\n**Delete operations**: Don''t use optimistic updates (destructive, complex recovery)\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n**Actions:**\n\n- Public: `createTopic`, `sendMessage`\n- Internal: `internal_createTopic`, `internal_updateMessageContent`\n- Dispatch: `internal_dispatchTopic`\n- Toggle: `internal_toggleMessageLoading`\n\n**State:**\n\n- ID arrays: `messageLoadingIds`, `topicEditingIds`\n- Maps: `topicMaps`, `messagesMap`\n- Active: `activeTopicId`\n- Init flags: `topicsInit`\n\n## Detailed Guides\n\n- Action patterns: `references/action-patterns.md`\n- Slice organization: `references/slice-organization.md`\n\n## Class-Based Action Implementation\n\nWe are migrating slices from plain `StateCreator` objects to **class-based actions**.\n\n### Pattern\n\n- Define a class that encapsulates actions and receives `(set, get, api)` in the constructor.\n- Use `#private` fields (e.g., `#set`, `#get`) to avoid leaking internals.\n- Prefer shared typing helpers:\n  - `StoreSetter<T>` from `@/store/types` for `set`.\n  - `Pick<ActionImpl, keyof ActionImpl>` to expose only public methods.\n- Export a `create*Slice` helper that returns a class instance.\n\n```ts\ntype Setter = StoreSetter<HomeStore>;\nexport const createRecentSlice = (set: Setter, get: () => HomeStore, _api?: unknown) =>\n  new RecentActionImpl(set, get, _api);\n\nexport class RecentActionImpl {\n  readonly #get: () => HomeStore;\n  readonly #set: Setter;\n\n  constructor(set: Setter, get: () => HomeStore, _api?: unknown) {\n    void _api;\n    this.#set = set;\n    this.#get = get;\n  }\n\n  useFetchRecentTopics = () => {\n    // ...\n  };\n}\n\nexport type RecentAction = Pick<RecentActionImpl, keyof RecentActionImpl>;\n```\n\n### Composition\n\n- In store files, merge class instances with `flattenActions` (do not spread class instances).\n- `flattenActions` binds methods to the original class instance and supports prototype methods and class fields.\n\n```ts\nconst createStore: StateCreator<HomeStore, [[''zustand/devtools'', never]]> = (...params) => ({\n  ...initialState,\n  ...flattenActions<HomeStoreAction>([\n    createRecentSlice(...params),\n    createHomeInputSlice(...params),\n  ]),\n});\n```\n\n### Multi-Class Slices\n\n- For large slices that need multiple action classes, compose them in the slice entry using `flattenActions`.\n- Use a local `PublicActions<T>` helper if you need to combine multiple classes and hide private fields.\n\n```ts\ntype PublicActions<T> = { [K in keyof T]: T[K] };\n\nexport type ChatGroupAction = PublicActions<\n  ChatGroupInternalAction & ChatGroupLifecycleAction & ChatGroupMemberAction & ChatGroupCurdAction\n>;\n\nexport const chatGroupAction: StateCreator<\n  ChatGroupStore,\n  [[''zustand/devtools'', never]],\n  [],\n  ChatGroupAction\n> = (...params) =>\n  flattenActions<ChatGroupAction>([\n    new ChatGroupInternalAction(...params),\n    new ChatGroupLifecycleAction(...params),\n    new ChatGroupMemberAction(...params),\n    new ChatGroupCurdAction(...params),\n  ]);\n```\n\n### Store-Access Types\n\n- For class methods that depend on actions in other classes, define explicit store augmentations:\n  - `ChatGroupStoreWithSwitchTopic` for lifecycle `switchTopic`\n  - `ChatGroupStoreWithRefresh` for member refresh\n  - `ChatGroupStoreWithInternal` for curd `internal_dispatchChatGroup`\n\n### Do / Don''t\n\n- **Do**: keep constructor signature aligned with `StateCreator` params `(set, get, api)`.\n- **Do**: use `#private` to avoid `set/get` being exposed.\n- **Do**: use `flattenActions` instead of spreading class instances.\n- **Don''t**: keep both old slice objects and class actions active at the same time.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-03T04:10:09.494Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing scalable state management solutions with Zustand.","zh":"非常适合需要可扩展状态管理解决方案的前端代理，特别是使用Zustand。","ja":"Zustandを使用するフロントエンドエージェントに適した、スケーラブルなステート管理ソリューションです。","ko":"Zustand를 사용하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합한 확장 가능한 상태 관리 솔루션입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan soluciones de gestión de estado escalables con Zustand.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de solutions de gestion d''état évolutives avec Zustand.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die skalierbare State-Management-Lösungen mit Zustand benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de soluções de gerenciamento de estado escaláveis com Zustand.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы масштабируемые решения управления состоянием с помощью Zustand.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامي الذين يحتاجون إلى حلول إدارة الحالة القابلة للتحجيم مع Zustand."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage complex state hierarchies using Zustand''s action type hierarchy, including public actions for UI components and internal actions for core business logic implementation, leveraging optimistic updates and service calls with error handling via protocols like API calls.","zh":"赋予代理管理复杂状态层次结构的能力，使用Zustand的动作类型层次结构，包括用于UI组件的公共动作和用于核心业务逻辑实现的内部动作，利用乐观更新和通过API调用等协议进行服务调用和错误处理。","ja":"Zustandのアクションタイプ階層構造を使用して、複雑なステート階層構造を管理するエージェントを可能にします。UIコンポーネント用のパブリックアクションとコアビジネスロジックの実装用の内部アクションを含み、楽観的な更新とAPIコールなどのプロトコルを介したサービス呼び出しとエラーハンドリングを利用します。","ko":"Zustand의 액션 유형 계층 구조를 사용하여 복잡한 상태 계층 구조를 관리할 수 있는 에이전트를 제공합니다. UI 구성 요소용 공개 액션과 핵심 비즈니스 로직 구현용 내부 액션을 포함하며, 낙관적 업데이트와 API 호출 등의 프로토콜을 통해 서비스 호출 및 오류 처리를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar jerarquías de estado complejas utilizando la jerarquía de tipos de acción de Zustand, incluyendo acciones públicas para componentes de UI y acciones internas para la implementación de la lógica de negocio principal, aprovechando actualizaciones optimistas y llamadas de servicio con control de errores a través de protocolos como llamadas a la API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des hiérarchies d''état complexes en utilisant la hiérarchie de types d''action de Zustand, y compris des actions publiques pour les composants d''interface utilisateur et des actions internes pour la mise en œuvre de la logique commerciale principale, en exploitant les mises à jour optimistes et les appels de service avec gestion des erreurs via des protocoles tels que les appels d''API.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, komplexe Statushierarchien mithilfe von Zustands Aktionstyp-Hierarchie zu verwalten, einschließlich öffentlicher Aktionen für Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten und interner Aktionen für die Implementierung der Kerngeschäftslogik, unter Nutzung von optimistischen Updates und Serviceaufrufen mit Fehlerbehandlung über Protokolle wie API-Aufrufe.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar hierarquias de estado complexas usando a hierarquia de tipo de ação do Zustand, incluindo ações públicas para componentes de UI e ações internas para implementação de lógica de negócios core, aproveitando atualizações otimistas e chamadas de serviço com tratamento de erros via protocolos como chamadas de API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять сложными иерархиями состояния с помощью иерархии типов действий Zustand, включая общие действия для компонентов пользовательского интерфейса и внутренние действия для реализации основной бизнес-логики, используя оптимистические обновления и вызовы служб с обработкой ошибок через протоколы, такие как вызовы API.","ar":"يعزز الوكلاء لإدارة التسلسلات الهرمية الحالة المعقدة باستخدام هرمية نوع الإجراء من Zustand، بما في ذلك الإجراءات العامة للمكونات واجهة المستخدم والإجراءات الداخلية لتنفيذ المنطق التجاري الأساسي، واستغلال التحديثات المتفائلة والمكالمات الخدمية مع معالجة الأخطاء عبر بروتوكولات مثل مكالمات API."},"useCases":{"en":["Orchestrating UI component interactions with public actions like createTopic and sendMessage","Implementing core business logic with internal actions like internal_createTopic","Handling errors and service calls with optimistic updates"],"zh":["使用公共动作如createTopic和sendMessage编排UI组件交互","使用内部动作如internal_createTopic实现核心业务逻辑","使用乐观更新处理错误和服务调用"],"ja":["createTopicやsendMessageなどのパブリックアクションを使用してUIコンポーネントの相互作用をオーケストレーションする","internal_createTopicなどの内部アクションを使用してコアビジネスロジックを実装する","楽観的な更新を使用してエラーとサービス呼び出しをハンドリングする"],"ko":["createTopic과 sendMessage 등의 공개 액션을 사용하여 UI 구성 요소 상호 작용을 오케스트레이션하는 것","internal_createTopic 등의 내부 액션을 사용하여 핵심 비즈니스 로직을 구현하는 것","낙관적 업데이트를 사용하여 오류와 서비스 호출을 처리하는 것"],"es":["Orquestar interacciones de componentes de UI con acciones públicas como createTopic y sendMessage","Implementar lógica de negocio principal con acciones internas como internal_createTopic","Controlar errores y llamadas de servicio con actualizaciones optimistas"],"fr":["Orchestrer les interactions de composants d''interface utilisateur avec des actions publiques comme createTopic et sendMessage","Mettre en œuvre la logique commerciale principale avec des actions internes comme internal_createTopic","Gérer les erreurs et les appels de service avec des mises à jour optimistes"],"de":["Orchestrieren von UI-Komponenten-Interaktionen mit öffentlichen Aktionen wie createTopic und sendMessage","Implementieren der Kerngeschäftslogik mit internen Aktionen wie internal_createTopic","Fehler und Serviceaufrufe mit optimistischen Updates handhaben"],"pt":["Orquestrando interações de componentes de UI com ações públicas como createTopic e sendMessage","Implementando lógica de negócios core com ações internas como internal_createTopic","Tratando erros e chamadas de serviço com atualizações otimistas"],"ru":["Оркестрирование взаимодействий компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с общими действиями, такими как createTopic и sendMessage","Реализация основной бизнес-логики с помощью внутренних действий, таких как internal_createTopic","Обработка ошибок и вызовов служб с оптимистическими обновлениями"],"ar":["أوركسترا التفاعلات المكونات واجهة المستخدم مع الإجراءات العامة مثل createTopic و sendMessage","تنفيذ المنطق التجاري الأساسي مع الإجراءات الداخلية مثل internal_createTopic","معالجة الأخطاء والمكالمات الخدمية مع التحديثات المتفائلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires JavaScript environment","Zustand library dependency","Should not call internal actions directly from UI components"],"zh":["需要JavaScript环境","依赖Zustand库","不应直接从UI组件调用内部动作"],"ja":["JavaScript環境が必要","Zustandライブラリに依存する","UIコンポーネントから直接内部アクションを呼び出してはならない"],"ko":["JavaScript 환경이 필요함","Zustand 라이브러리에 의존함","UI 구성 요소에서 내부 액션을 직접 호출해서는 안 됨"],"es":["Requiere entorno de JavaScript","Dependencia de la biblioteca Zustand","No debe llamar a acciones internas directamente desde componentes de UI"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement JavaScript","Dépendance de la bibliothèque Zustand","Ne doit pas appeler d''actions internes directement à partir de composants d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt eine JavaScript-Umgebung","Zustand-Bibliotheksabhängigkeit","Sollte interne Aktionen nicht direkt von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten aufrufen"],"pt":["Requer ambiente JavaScript","Dependência da biblioteca Zustand","Não deve chamar ações internas diretamente de componentes de UI"],"ru":["Требует среды JavaScript","Зависимость от библиотеки Zustand","Не следует вызывать внутренние действия напрямую из компонентов пользовательского интерфейса"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة جافا سكريبت","اعتماد على مكتبة Zustand","لا ينبغي استدعاء الإجراءات الداخلية مباشرة من مكونات واجهة المستخدم"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f14495ff461cc8bf3c69e46edf63fda621f71b8bdaaebcada97c595c4561a2a4","qualityScore":52}');
