iguração fácil do projeto Angular","Integração com serviços de API","Suporte a desenvolvedores","Documentação detalhada"],"ru":["Копировать и вставлять папку и файл AGENTS.md","Легкая настройка проекта Angular","Интеграция с сервисами API","Поддержка разработчиков","Дetailed документация"],"ar":["نسخ ولصق المجلد والملف AGENTS.md","إعداد سهل لمشروع أنجولار","تكامل مع خدمات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","دعم المطورين","توثيق مفصل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular API服务","AI智能代理","代码复制和粘贴","开发效率","Angular开发","AI工具","代码自动化","开发流程简化"],"ja":["Angular APIサービス","AIエージェント","コードのコピーとペースト","開発効率","Angular開発","AIツール","コード自動化","開発プロセス簡素化"],"ko":["Angular API 서비스","AI 에이전트","코드 복사와貼付","개발 효율성","Angular 개발","AI 툴","코드 자동화","개발 프로세스 단순화"],"es":["cómo usar angular-api-service","qué es angular-api-service","angular-api-service alternativa","angular-api-service vs competidores","instalar angular-api-service","guía de configuración de angular-api-service","desarrollo de aplicaciones con angular-api-service"],"fr":["comment utiliser angular-api-service","qu''est-ce que angular-api-service","alternative à angular-api-service","angular-api-service vs concurrents","installer angular-api-service","guide de configuration de angular-api-service","développement d''applications avec angular-api-service"],"de":["wie man angular-api-service verwendet","was ist angular-api-service","alternative zu angular-api-service","angular-api-service vs konkurrierende","installieren von angular-api-service","einrichtungsanleitung für angular-api-service","entwicklung von anwendungen mit angular-api-service"],"pt":["como usar o serviço de API Angular","o que é o serviço de API Angular","serviço de API Angular alternativa","serviço de API Angular vs outros","instalar serviço de API Angular","guia de configuração do serviço de API Angular","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com serviço de API Angular","serviço de API Angular para iniciantes"],"ru":["как использовать сервис Angular API","что такое сервис Angular API","сервис Angular API альтернатива","сервис Angular API vs другие","установить сервис Angular API","руководство по настройке сервиса Angular API","разработка приложений с сервисом Angular API","сервис Angular API для начинающих"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام خدمة واجهة برمجة تطبيقات أنجولار","ما هي خدمة واجهة برمجة تطبيقات أنجولار","خدمة واجهة برمجة تطبيقات أنجولار بديلة","خدمة واجهة برمجة تطبيقات أنجولار مقابل الأخرى","تثبيت خدمة واجهة برمجة تطبيقات أنجولار","دليل إعداد خدمة واجهة برمجة تطبيقات أنجولار","تطوير التطبيقات مع خدمة واجهة برمجة تطبيقات أنجولار","خدمة واجهة برمجة تطبيقات أنجولار للمبتدئين"]}},"owner":"CongDon1207","repo":"AGENTS.md","repoPath":"CongDon1207/AGENTS.md","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.686Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"angular-api-service","description":"Use when creating API services for backend communication with proper patterns for caching, error handling, and type safety.","bodyPreview":"# Angular API Service Development Workflow\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating new API service for backend communication\n- Adding caching to API calls\n- Implementing file upload/download\n- Adding custom headers or interceptors\n\n## Pre-Flight Checklist\n\n- [ ] Identify backend API base URL\n- [ ] **Read the design system docs** for the target application (see below)\n- [ ] List all endpoints to implement\n- [ ] Determine caching requirements\n- [ ] Search existing services: `grep \"{Feature}ApiServi","body":"# Angular API Service Development Workflow\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating new API service for backend communication\n- Adding caching to API calls\n- Implementing file upload/download\n- Adding custom headers or interceptors\n\n## Pre-Flight Checklist\n\n- [ ] Identify backend API base URL\n- [ ] **Read the design system docs** for the target application (see below)\n- [ ] List all endpoints to implement\n- [ ] Determine caching requirements\n- [ ] Search existing services: `grep \"{Feature}ApiService\" --include=\"*.ts\"`\n\n## 🎨 Design System Documentation (MANDATORY)\n\n**Before creating any API service, read the design system documentation for your target application:**\n\n| Application                       | Design System Location                           |\n| --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **WebV2 Apps**                    | `docs/design-system/`                            |\n| **TextSnippetClient**             | `src/PlatformExampleAppWeb/apps/playground-text-snippet/docs/design-system/` |\n\n**Key docs to read:**\n\n- `README.md` - Component overview, base classes, library summary\n- `07-technical-guide.md` - Implementation checklist, best practices\n- `06-state-management.md` - State management and API integration patterns\n\n## File Location\n\n```\nsrc/PlatformExampleAppWeb/libs/apps-domains/src/lib/\n└── {domain}/\n    └── services/\n        └── {feature}-api.service.ts\n```\n\n## Pattern 1: Basic CRUD API Service\n\n```typescript\n// {feature}-api.service.ts\nimport { Injectable } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { Observable } from ''rxjs'';\nimport { PlatformApiService } from ''@libs/platform-core'';\nimport { environment } from ''@env/environment'';\n\n// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n// DTOs (can be in separate file)\n// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nexport interface FeatureDto {\n    id: string;\n    name: string;\n    code: string;\n    status: FeatureStatus;\n    createdDate: Date;\n}\n\nexport interface FeatureListQuery {\n    searchText?: string;\n    statuses?: FeatureStatus[];\n    skipCount?: number;\n    maxResultCount?: number;\n}\n\nexport interface PagedResult<T> {\n    items: T[];\n    totalCount: number;\n}\n\nexport interface SaveFeatureCommand {\n    id?: string;\n    name: string;\n    code: string;\n    status: FeatureStatus;\n}\n\n// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n// API SERVICE\n// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class FeatureApiService extends PlatformApiService {\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // CONFIGURATION\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    protected get apiUrl(): string {\n        return environment.apiUrl + ''/api/Feature'';\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // QUERY METHODS\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    getList(query?: FeatureListQuery): Observable<PagedResult<FeatureDto>> {\n        return this.get<PagedResult<FeatureDto>>('''', query);\n    }\n\n    getById(id: string): Observable<FeatureDto> {\n        return this.get<FeatureDto>(`/${id}`);\n    }\n\n    getByCode(code: string): Observable<FeatureDto> {\n        return this.get<FeatureDto>(''/by-code'', { code });\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // COMMAND METHODS\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    save(command: SaveFeatureCommand): Observable<FeatureDto> {\n        return this.post<FeatureDto>('''', command);\n    }\n\n    update(id: string, command: Partial<SaveFeatureCommand>): Observable<FeatureDto> {\n        return this.put<FeatureDto>(`/${id}`, command);\n    }\n\n    delete(id: string): Observable<void> {\n        return this.deleteRequest<void>(`/${id}`);\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // VALIDATION METHODS\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    checkCodeExists(code: string, excludeId?: string): Observable<boolean> {\n        return this.get<boolean>(''/check-code-exists'', { code, excludeId });\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Pattern 2: API Service with Caching\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class LookupApiService extends PlatformApiService {\n    protected get apiUrl(): string {\n        return environment.apiUrl + ''/api/Lookup'';\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // CACHED METHODS\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    getCountries(): Observable<CountryDto[]> {\n        return this.get<CountryDto[]>(''/countries'', null, {\n            enableCache: true,\n            cacheKey: ''countries'',\n            cacheDurationMs: 60 * 60 * 1000 // 1 hour\n        });\n    }\n\n    getCurrencies(): Observable<CurrencyDto[]> {\n        return this.get<CurrencyDto[]>(''/currencies'', null, {\n            enableCache: true,\n            cacheKey: ''currencies''\n        });\n    }\n\n    getTimezones(): Observable<TimezoneDto[]> {\n        return this.get<TimezoneDto[]>(''/timezones'', null, {\n            enableCache: true\n        });\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // CACHE INVALIDATION\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    invalidateCountriesCache(): void {\n        this.clearCache(''countries'');\n    }\n\n    invalidateAllCache(): void {\n        this.clearAllCache();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Pattern 3: File Upload/Download\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class DocumentApiService extends PlatformApiService {\n    protected get apiUrl(): string {\n        return environment.apiUrl + ''/api/Document'';\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // FILE UPLOAD\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    upload(file: File, metadata?: DocumentMetadata): Observable<DocumentDto> {\n        const formData = new FormData();\n        formData.append(''file'', file, file.name);\n\n        if (metadata) {\n            formData.append(''metadata'', JSON.stringify(metadata));\n        }\n\n        return this.postFormData<DocumentDto>(''/upload'', formData);\n    }\n\n    uploadMultiple(files: File[]): Observable<DocumentDto[]> {\n        const formData = new FormData();\n        files.forEach((file, index) => {\n            formData.append(`files[${index}]`, file, file.name);\n        });\n\n        return this.postFormData<DocumentDto[]>(''/upload-multiple'', formData);\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // FILE DOWNLOAD\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    download(id: string): Observable<Blob> {\n        return this.getBlob(`/${id}/download`);\n    }\n\n    downloadAsBase64(id: string): Observable<string> {\n        return this.get<string>(`/${id}/base64`);\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // HELPER: Trigger browser download\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    downloadAndSave(id: string, fileName: string): Observable<void> {\n        return this.download(id).pipe(\n            tap(blob => {\n                const url = window.URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n                const link = document.createElement(''a'');\n                link.href = url;\n                link.download = fileName;\n                link.click();\n                window.URL.revokeObjectURL(url);\n            }),\n            map(() => void 0)\n        );\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Pattern 4: API Service with Custom Headers\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class ExternalApiService extends PlatformApiService {\n    protected get apiUrl(): string {\n        return environment.externalApiUrl;\n    }\n\n    // Override to add custom headers\n    protected override getDefaultHeaders(): HttpHeaders {\n        return super.getDefaultHeaders().set(''X-Api-Key'', environment.externalApiKey).set(''X-Request-Id'', this.generateRequestId());\n    }\n\n    // Method with custom headers\n    getWithCustomHeaders(endpoint: string): Observable<any> {\n        return this.get(endpoint, null, {\n            headers: {\n                ''X-Custom-Header'': ''custom-value''\n            }\n        });\n    }\n\n    private generateRequestId(): string {\n        return `${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9)}`;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Pattern 5: Search/Autocomplete API\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class EmployeeApiService extends PlatformApiService {\n\n  protected get apiUrl(): string {\n    return environment.apiUrl + ''/api/Employee'';\n  }\n\n  // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  // SEARCH WITH DEBOUNCE (use in component)\n  // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  search(term: string): Observable<EmployeeDto[]> {\n    if (!term || term.length < 2) {\n      return of([]);\n    }\n\n    return this.get<EmployeeDto[]>(''/search'', {\n      searchText: term,\n      maxResultCount: 10\n    });\n  }\n\n  // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  // AUTOCOMPLETE WITH CACHING\n  // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  autocomplete(prefix: string): Observable<AutocompleteItem[]> {\n    return this.get<AutocompleteItem[]>(''/autocomplete'', { prefix }, {\n      enableCache: true,\n      cacheKey: `autocomplete-${prefix}`,\n      cacheDurationMs: 30 * 1000  // 30 seconds\n    });\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage in component with debounce:\n@Component({...})\nexport class EmployeeSearchComponent {\n  private searchSubject = new Subject<string>();\n\n  search$ = this.searchSubject.pipe(\n    debounceTime(300),\n    distinctUntilChanged(),\n    switchMap(term => this.employeeApi.search(term))\n  );\n\n  onSearchInput(term: string): void {\n    this.searchSubject.next(term);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Base PlatformApiService Methods\n\n| Method               | Purpose              | Example                                  |\n| -------------------- | -------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `get<T>()`           | GET request          | `this.get<User>(''/users/1'')`             |\n| `post<T>()`          | POST request         | `this.post<User>(''/users'', data)`        |\n| `put<T>()`           | PUT request          | `this.put<User>(''/users/1'', data)`       |\n| `patch<T>()`         | PATCH request        | `this.patch<User>(''/users/1'', partial)`  |\n| `deleteRequest<T>()` | DELETE request       | `this.deleteRequest(''/users/1'')`         |\n| `postFormData<T>()`  | POST with FormData   | `this.postFormData(''/upload'', formData)` |\n| `getBlob()`          | GET binary data      | `this.getBlob(''/file/download'')`         |\n| `clearCache()`       | Clear specific cache | `this.clearCache(''cacheKey'')`            |\n| `clearAllCache()`    | Clear all cache      | `this.clearAllCache()`                   |\n\n## Request Options\n\n```typescript\ninterface RequestOptions {\n    // Caching\n    enableCache?: boolean;\n    cacheKey?: string;\n    cacheDurationMs?: number;\n\n    // Headers\n    headers?: { [key: string]: string };\n\n    // Response handling\n    responseType?: ''json'' | ''text'' | ''blob'' | ''arraybuffer'';\n\n    // Progress tracking\n    reportProgress?: boolean;\n    observe?: ''body'' | ''events'' | ''response'';\n}\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns to AVOID\n\n:x: **Using HttpClient directly**\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG - bypasses platform features\nconstructor(private http: HttpClient) { }\n\n// CORRECT - extend PlatformApiService\nexport class MyApiService extends PlatformApiService { }\n```\n\n:x: **Hardcoding URLs**\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG\nreturn this.get(''https://api.example.com/users'');\n\n// CORRECT - use environment\nprotected get apiUrl() { return environment.apiUrl + ''/api/User''; }\n```\n\n:x: **Not handling errors in service**\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG - let errors propagate unhandled\nreturn this.get(''/users'');\n\n// CORRECT - component handles via tapResponse\nthis.userApi.getUsers().pipe(\n    this.tapResponse(\n        users => {\n            /* success */\n        },\n        error => {\n            /* handle error */\n        }\n    )\n);\n```\n\n:x: **Missing type safety**\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG - returns any\ngetUser(id: string) {\n  return this.get(`/users/${id}`);\n}\n\n// CORRECT - typed response\ngetUser(id: string): Observable<UserDto> {\n  return this.get<UserDto>(`/users/${id}`);\n}\n```\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\n- [ ] Extends `PlatformApiService`\n- [ ] `apiUrl` getter returns correct base URL\n- [ ] All methods have return type annotations\n- [ ] DTOs defined for request/response\n- [ ] Caching configured for appropriate endpoints\n- [ ] File operations use `postFormData`/`getBlob`\n- [ ] Validation endpoints return `boolean`\n- [ ] `@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })` for singleton\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:25:40.619Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing streamlined Angular API service development for backend communication","zh":"非常适合需要简化Angular API服务开发以进行后端通信的前端代理","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがバックエンドとの通信のためのAngular APIサービス開発を効率化する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 백엔드와의 통신을 위한 Angular API 서비스 개발을 간소화해야 하는 경우에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un desarrollo de servicios de API de Angular optimizado para la comunicación con el backend","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''un développement de services d''API Angular rationalisé pour la communication avec le backend","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine optimierte Angular-API-Service-Entwicklung für die Kommunikation mit dem Backend benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desenvolvimento de serviço de API Angular simplificado para comunicação de backend","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходим упрощенный разработка сервиса API Angular для коммуникации с бэкендом","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى تطوير خدمة API Angular مبسطة للاتصال بالخادم الخلفي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create new API services with caching, file upload/download capabilities, and custom headers or interceptors using Angular, enhancing backend communication with protocols like HTTP and HTTPS","zh":"赋予代理创建新的API服务的能力，包括缓存、文件上传/下载能力以及使用Angular自定义头或拦截器，增强HTTP和HTTPS等协议的后端通信","ja":"Angularを使用してキャッシング、ファイルのアップロード/ダウンロード機能、およびカスタムヘッダーまたはインターセプターを使用して新しいAPIサービスを作成するエージェントの能力を付与し、HTTPおよびHTTPSなどのプロトコルを使用したバックエンド通信を強化","ko":"에이전트가 Angular를 사용하여 캐싱, 파일 업로드/다운로드 기능 및 사용자 지정 헤더 또는 인터셉터를 사용하여 새로운 API 서비스를 만들 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 HTTP 및 HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜을 사용한 백엔드 통신을 강화","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear nuevos servicios de API con caché, capacidades de carga y descarga de archivos, y encabezados personalizados o interceptores utilizando Angular, lo que mejora la comunicación con el backend con protocolos como HTTP y HTTPS","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer de nouveaux services d''API avec mise en cache, capacités de téléchargement et de téléchargement de fichiers, et en-têtes personnalisés ou intercepteurs en utilisant Angular, améliorant ainsi la communication avec le backend avec des protocoles tels que HTTP et HTTPS","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, neue API-Dienste mit Caching, Datei-Upload-/Download-Funktionen und benutzerdefinierten Headern oder Interzeptoren unter Verwendung von Angular zu erstellen, wodurch die Kommunikation mit dem Backend mit Protokollen wie HTTP und HTTPS verbessert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar novos serviços de API com cache, capacidades de upload/download de arquivos e cabeçalhos personalizados ou interceptores usando Angular, melhorando a comunicação de backend com protocolos como HTTP e HTTPS","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать новые сервисы API с кэшированием, возможностями загрузки/выгрузки файлов и настраиваемыми заголовками или интерцепторами, используя Angular, улучшая коммуникацию с бэкендом по протоколам seperti HTTP и HTTPS","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء خدمات API جديدة مع التخزين المؤقت وقدرات تحميل/تنزيل الملفات والرؤوس المخصصة أو المحاصرة باستخدام Angular، مما يعزز الاتصال بالخادم الخلفي ببروتوكولات مثل HTTP و HTTPS"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing caching for API calls","Adding custom headers or interceptors for secure data transfer","Developing file upload/download functionality for media-rich applications"],"zh":["为API调用实现缓存","为安全数据传输添加自定义头或拦截器","为媒体丰富的应用程序开发文件上传/下载功能"],"ja":["API呼び出しにキャッシングを実装する","セキュアなデータ転送のためにカスタムヘッダーまたはインターセプターを追加する","メディアリッチなアプリケーションのためファイルのアップロード/ダウンロード機能を開発する"],"ko":["API 호출에 캐싱을 구현","보안 데이터 전송을 위해 사용자 지정 헤더 또는 인터셉터를 추가","미디어 리치 애플리케이션을 위한 파일 업로드/다운로드 기능 개발"],"es":["Implementar la caché para llamadas a la API","Agregar encabezados personalizados o interceptores para el transferencia de datos segura","Desarrollar la funcionalidad de carga y descarga de archivos para aplicaciones ricas en medios"],"fr":["Mettre en cache les appels d''API","Ajouter des en-têtes personnalisés ou des intercepteurs pour le transfert de données sécurisé","Développer la fonctionnalité de téléchargement et de téléchargement de fichiers pour les applications riches en médias"],"de":["Caching für API-Aufrufe implementieren","Benutzerdefinierte Header oder Interzeptoren für den sicheren Datentransfer hinzufügen","Datei-Upload-/Download-Funktionalität für medienreiche Anwendungen entwickeln"],"pt":["Implementar cache para chamadas de API","Adicionar cabeçalhos personalizados ou interceptores para transferência de dados segura","Desenvolver funcionalidade de upload/download de arquivos para aplicações ricas em mídia"],"ru":["Реализовать кэширование для вызовов API","Добавить настраиваемые заголовки или интерцепторы для безопасной передачи данных","Разработать функциональность загрузки/выгрузки файлов для приложений, богатых на медиа"],"ar":["تنفيذ التخزين المؤقت للمكالمات API","إضافة رؤوس مخصصة أو محاصرة لنقل البيانات الآمن","تطوير وظيفة تحميل/تنزيل الملفات للتطبيقات الغنية بالوسائط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Angular framework","Dependent on backend API base URL and design system docs"],"zh":["需要Angular框架的知识","依赖于后端API基URL和设计系统文档"],"ja":["Angularフレームワークの知識が必要","バックエンドAPIのベースURLおよびデザインシステムドキュメントに依存"],"ko":["Angular 프레임워크에 대한 지식이 필요","백엔드 API 기본 URL 및 디자인 시스템 문서에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del framework de Angular","Dependiente de la URL base de la API de backend y de los documentos del sistema de diseño"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance du framework Angular","Dépend de l''URL de base de l''API de backend et des documents du système de conception"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des Angular-Frameworks","Abhängig von der Basis-URL der Backend-API und den Design-System-Dokumenten"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento do framework Angular","Dependente da URL de base da API de backend e dos documentos do sistema de design"],"ru":["Требует знания фреймворка Angular","Зависит от базового URL API бэкенда и документации системы дизайна"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة إطار Angular","يعتمد على عنوان URL القاعدة للخادم الخلفي ووثائق نظام التصميم"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ceb624085444aceecc0680392171713e60ccc3647c7c6c11f6d684a0486b0c7e","qualityScore":52}');
