ésultats","Intégration avec des outils d''intelligence artificielle","Interface utilisateur intuitive et facile à utiliser"],"de":["Spielstrategie-Analyse","Empfehlungen für Aufstellungen und Taktiken","Spiele-Simulation und Ergebnis-Analyse","Integration mit KI-Tools","Benutzerfreundliche und intuitive Oberfläche"],"pt":["Análise de desempenho da equipe","Plano de treinamento personalizado","Estatísticas de jogo em tempo real","Integração com outras ferramentas de treinamento","Suporte para jogadores e treinadores"],"ru":["Анализ результатов команды","Индивидуальный план тренировки","Статистика игры в реальном времени","Интеграция с другими инструментами тренировки","Поддержка игроков и тренеров"],"ar":["تحليل أداء الفريق","خطة تدريب مخصصة","إحصائيات اللعبة في الوقت الفعلي","التكامل مع أدوات التدريب الأخرى","دعم اللاعبين والمدربين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","5v5足球教练助手","足球教练水平","战略和团队管理","AI工具怎么用"],"ja":["AIエージェント","5v5サッカーコーチヘルパー","サッカーコーチのレベル","戦略とチーム管理","AIエージェントの使い方"],"ko":["AI 도구","5v5 축구 코치 헬퍼","您的 축구 코치 레벨","전략과 팀 관리","AI 도구의 사용법"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial para fútbol","asistente de entrenador de fútbol 5v5","cómo usar el sport-wizard-translator","qué es el sport-wizard-translator","alternativas al sport-wizard-translator","instalación del sport-wizard-translator","guía de configuración del sport-wizard-translator"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle pour le football","assistant d''entraîneur de football 5v5","comment utiliser le sport-wizard-translator","qu''est-ce que le sport-wizard-translator","alternatives au sport-wizard-translator","installation du sport-wizard-translator","guide de configuration du sport-wizard-translator"],"de":["KI-Tools für Fußball","Fußball-Trainer-Assistent 5v5","wie man den sport-wizard-translator verwendet","was ist der sport-wizard-translator","alternativen zum sport-wizard-translator","installation des sport-wizard-translator","konfigurationsanleitung für den sport-wizard-translator"],"pt":["ferramenta de treinador de futebol","treinamento de futebol 5v5","Sport Wizard Translator","como usar Sport Wizard Translator","o que é Sport Wizard Translator","melhor ferramenta de treinamento de futebol","treinamento de futebol online","ferramenta de análise de desempenho"],"ru":["ИИ Агент для футбола","тренировка футбола 5v5","Sport Wizard Translator","как использовать Sport Wizard Translator","что такое Sport Wizard Translator","лучший инструмент тренировки футбола","онлайн-тренировка футбола","инструмент для анализа результатов"],"ar":["أداة مدرب كرة قدم","تدريب كرة قدم 5v5","Sport Wizard Translator","كيفية استخدام Sport Wizard Translator","ما هي Sport Wizard Translator","أفضل أداة تدريب كرة قدم","تدريب كرة قدم عبر الإنترنت","أداة تحليل الأداء"]}},"owner":"beggan78","repo":"f2016-6-dif","repoPath":"beggan78/f2016-6-dif","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.690Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sport-wizard-translator","description":"Context-aware Swedish translation for Sport Wizard youth soccer coaching application. Use when the user explicitly requests translation of components, screens, features, or user-facing text to Swedish (e.g., Translate ConfigurationScreen to Swedish, Add Swedish translations for the game screen, Translate the new player rotation UI). This skill provides domain-specific soccer terminology, natural Swedish phrasing patterns, and automated translation workflow that updates both JSON translation files and component code.","bodyPreview":"# Sport Wizard Swedish Translator\n\nTranslate Sport Wizard application text to natural, context-aware Swedish with proper soccer terminology.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Deep context analysis** - Read and understand the component before translating\n2. **Domain-appropriate terminology** - Use Swedish soccer terms, not literal translations\n3. **Natural phrasing** - Prioritize natural Swedish word order over literal translation\n4. **Consistency** - Follow existing translation patterns in the codebase","body":"# Sport Wizard Swedish Translator\n\nTranslate Sport Wizard application text to natural, context-aware Swedish with proper soccer terminology.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Deep context analysis** - Read and understand the component before translating\n2. **Domain-appropriate terminology** - Use Swedish soccer terms, not literal translations\n3. **Natural phrasing** - Prioritize natural Swedish word order over literal translation\n4. **Consistency** - Follow existing translation patterns in the codebase\n5. **Preserve names** - Never translate app name, player names, or team names\n\n## Translation Workflow\n\nWhen the user requests translation (e.g., \"Translate GameScreen to Swedish\"):\n\n### Step 1: Analyze the Component\n\nRead the target component file to understand:\n- **Purpose**: What does this component do?\n- **User flow**: How does the user interact with it?\n- **Context**: Where does it appear in the app?\n- **Relationships**: What other components/features does it connect to?\n- **Existing translations**: Are any parts already translated?\n\n**Critical**: Do not just extract strings. Understand the domain context to choose appropriate terminology.\n\n### Step 2: Identify Translatable Text\n\nFind all user-facing text:\n- UI labels and headers\n- Button text\n- Placeholder text\n- Error/warning messages\n- Success messages\n- Helper text and tooltips\n- Modal content\n- Dropdown options\n\n**Exclude**:\n- Variable names and code identifiers\n- Comments (unless they become user-facing)\n- App name \"Sport Wizard\"\n- Player names\n- Team names\n- Log messages (unless user-visible)\n\n### Step 3: Determine Translation Strategy\n\nBefore translating, consult these references:\n\n1. **Soccer terminology** - Read `references/soccer-terminology.md`\n   - Check if text contains soccer-specific terms (defender, midfielder, formation, etc.)\n   - Use domain-appropriate Swedish terms (e.g., \"Back\" not \"Försvarare\")\n\n2. **Natural phrasing** - Read `references/translation-patterns.md`\n   - Check for common UI patterns (buttons, labels, errors)\n   - Apply natural Swedish word order and compound rules\n\n3. **Existing translations** - Read `references/existing-translations.md`\n   - Check if similar text is already translated\n   - Maintain consistent terminology across the app\n\n### Step 4: Create Translation Keys\n\nOrganize translations by namespace:\n\n**Namespace selection:**\n- Use `common` for generic/shared UI (buttons like \"Save\", \"Cancel\", \"Delete\")\n- Use component-specific namespace for component-unique text (e.g., `configuration`, `game`, `profile`)\n- Create new namespace if needed (e.g., `game.json`, `profile.json`)\n\n**Key structure:**\n- Use nested keys for logical grouping: `\"header.title\"`, `\"buttons.save\"`, `\"errors.validation\"`\n- Use descriptive names: `\"squad.selectTitle\"` not `\"label1\"`\n- Group related items: `\"goalies.header\"`, `\"goalies.periodLabel\"`, `\"goalies.placeholder\"`\n\n**Example structure:**\n```json\n{\n  \"header\": {\n    \"title\": \"Screen Title\"\n  },\n  \"buttons\": {\n    \"primary\": \"Primary Action\",\n    \"secondary\": \"Secondary Action\"\n  },\n  \"messages\": {\n    \"success\": \"Success message\",\n    \"error\": \"Error message\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 5: Generate Swedish Translations\n\nFor each translatable string:\n\n1. **Understand the context** - What is this text doing? What action/state does it represent?\n2. **Check references** - Is there domain terminology or existing pattern?\n3. **Choose natural Swedish** - Prioritize natural phrasing over literal translation\n4. **Maintain interpolation** - Preserve `{{variables}}` for dynamic content\n5. **Apply grammar** - Ensure proper Swedish grammar (gender, plural, word order)\n\n**Example process:**\n\nEnglish: \"Add Player to Team\"\n1. Context: Button action to add a player\n2. Check: \"Add\" → \"Lägg till\" (from existing-translations.md)\n3. Natural: \"Lägg till Spelare i Laget\"\n4. No interpolation needed\n5. Grammar: ✅ Natural Swedish word order\n\nEnglish: \"You have selected {{count}} players\"\n1. Context: Feedback message showing selection count\n2. Check: \"Select\" → \"Välj\" → \"Vald/Valda\"\n3. Natural: \"Du har valt {{count}} spelare\"\n4. Keep: `{{count}}` variable\n5. Grammar: ✅ \"Valda\" plural form matches \"spelare\"\n\n### Step 6: Update Translation Files\n\nUpdate or create JSON files in `src/locales/sv/{namespace}.json`:\n\n**If file exists:**\n- Read current content\n- Merge new translations (preserve existing keys)\n- Maintain nested structure\n- Keep consistent formatting\n\n**If creating new file:**\n- Create both `src/locales/en/{namespace}.json` (English) and `src/locales/sv/{namespace}.json` (Swedish)\n- Update `src/locales/i18n.js` to import new namespace files\n- Add namespace to i18n.init resources configuration\n\n**Example update to existing file:**\n\nBefore:\n```json\n{\n  \"header\": {\n    \"title\": \"Spel- och Lagkonfiguration\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nAfter (adding new section):\n```json\n{\n  \"header\": {\n    \"title\": \"Spel- och Lagkonfiguration\"\n  },\n  \"buttons\": {\n    \"save\": \"Spara\",\n    \"cancel\": \"Avbryt\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 7: Update Component Code\n\nModify the component to use translations:\n\n1. **Add import** (if not present):\n```javascript\nimport { useTranslation } from ''react-i18next'';\n```\n\n2. **Add hook** (if not present):\n```javascript\nconst { t } = useTranslation(''namespace'');\n```\n\n3. **Replace hardcoded strings** with `t()` calls:\n\nBefore:\n```javascript\n<h1>Game & Squad Configuration</h1>\n<button>Save Configuration</button>\n<p>You have selected {count} players</p>\n```\n\nAfter:\n```javascript\n<h1>{t(''configuration:header.title'')}</h1>\n<button>{t(''common:buttons.save'')}</button>\n<p>{t(''configuration:squad.selectTitle'', { count })}</p>\n```\n\n**Translation key format:**\n- Same namespace: `t(''key.path'')`\n- Different namespace: `t(''namespace:key.path'')`\n- With variables: `t(''key.path'', { variable: value })`\n\n4. **Handle multi-namespace usage**:\n\nIf component uses multiple namespaces:\n```javascript\n// Option 1: Multiple useTranslation calls\nconst { t } = useTranslation(''configuration'');\nconst { t: tCommon } = useTranslation(''common'');\n\n// Option 2: Single call with array\nconst { t } = useTranslation([''configuration'', ''common'']);\n// Then use: t(''configuration:key'') or t(''common:key'')\n```\n\n### Step 8: Verify Implementation\n\nAfter updates:\n\n1. **Check JSON validity** - Ensure valid JSON syntax (no trailing commas, proper quotes)\n2. **Check i18n.js** - Verify new namespaces are imported and registered\n3. **Check imports** - Ensure component has correct useTranslation import\n4. **Check keys** - Verify all translation keys exist in JSON files\n5. **Check variables** - Ensure interpolation variables match between English and Swedish\n\n## Domain-Specific Guidelines\n\n### Soccer Terminology\n\n**Always use soccer-specific Swedish terms:**\n- Defender → \"Back\" (NOT \"Försvarare\")\n- Midfielder → \"Mittfält\"\n- Forward/Attacker → \"Forward\"\n- Goalkeeper → \"Målvakt\"\n- Substitute → \"Avbytare\"\n\n**For positions, use natural Swedish compounds:**\n- Left Back → \"Vänsterback\"\n- Right Midfielder → \"Höger mittfält\"\n- Left Forward → \"Vänsterforward\"\n\nSee `references/soccer-terminology.md` for complete glossary.\n\n### Natural Swedish Phrasing\n\n**Prioritize natural word order:**\n- ❌ \"Application Language\" → \"Applikationsspråk\" (too literal)\n- ✅ \"Application Language\" → \"Språk i appen\" (natural)\n\n**Use appropriate compounds:**\n- ✅ \"matchformat\" (one word)\n- ✅ \"lagkapten\" (one word)\n- ❌ \"motståndarlagsnamn\" (too long, use \"motståndarlags namn\")\n\n**Use natural actions:**\n- ❌ \"Addera Spelare\" (too formal)\n- ✅ \"Lägg till Spelare\" (natural)\n\nSee `references/translation-patterns.md` for patterns and examples.\n\n### Consistency with Codebase\n\n**Always check existing translations first:**\n- Read `references/existing-translations.md` for established patterns\n- Use same terms for same concepts across the app\n- Maintain consistent namespace organization\n\n**Common established terms:**\n- Squad → \"Trupp\"\n- Team → \"Lag\"\n- Game/Match → \"Match\" (always)\n- Period → \"Period\"\n- Rotation → \"Byte\"\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n❌ **Literal translation without context**\n- \"Defender\" → \"Försvarare\" (wrong - should be \"Back\")\n\n❌ **Ignoring natural Swedish word order**\n- \"Application Language\" → \"Applikationsspråk\" (wrong - should be \"Språk i appen\")\n\n❌ **Translating names**\n- \"Sport Wizard\" → \"Sport Trollkarl\" (wrong - keep original)\n\n❌ **Inconsistent terminology**\n- Using both \"Trupp\" and \"Lag\" for \"squad\" (wrong - use \"Trupp\" consistently)\n\n❌ **Breaking interpolation**\n- Original: \"Selected: {{count}}\"\n- Wrong: \"Valda: {antal}\" (changed variable name)\n- Correct: \"Valda: {{count}}\" (kept variable name)\n\n❌ **Not updating component code**\n- Only creating JSON files without updating components to use t() calls\n\n## Output Format\n\nAfter completing translation, provide:\n\n1. **Summary** of what was translated\n2. **Translation files** created/updated (show file paths and new content)\n3. **Component changes** made (show the diff or updated code sections)\n4. **Namespace info** if new namespace was created (show i18n.js updates)\n\nExample output:\n\n```\nTranslated ConfigurationScreen to Swedish:\n\nUpdated files:\n- src/locales/sv/configuration.json (added 15 new keys)\n- src/locales/en/configuration.json (added 15 new keys)\n- src/components/setup/ConfigurationScreen.js (replaced hardcoded strings with t() calls)\n\nNew translation keys added:\n- squad.selectTitle\n- squad.addPlayerTitle\n- buttons.saveConfig\n- goalies.header\n...\n\nComponent now uses useTranslation(''configuration'') hook with proper t() calls.\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- **Always read the component first** - Don''t translate blindly\n- **Context is king** - Same English word may have different Swedish translations based on context\n- **Natural over literal** - Swedish should sound natural to native speakers\n- **Consistency matters** - Check existing translations to maintain app-wide consistency\n- **Test interpolation** - Ensure {{variables}} work correctly in Swedish sentences\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:32:37.210Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing specialized Swedish translation capabilities for soccer terminology.","zh":"非常适合需要专门的瑞典语翻译能力的语言代理，特别是对于足球术语的翻译。","ja":"サッカー用語の翻訳に特化したスウェーデン語翻訳機能を必要とする言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"축구 용어에 대한 전문적인 스웨덴어 번역 기능이 필요한 언어 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan capacidades de traducción especializadas en sueco para terminología de fútbol.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langue ayant besoin de capacités de traduction spécialisées en suédois pour la terminologie du football.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die spezialisierte Übersetzungsfähigkeiten für schwedische Fußballterminologie benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que precisam de capacidades de tradução especializadas em sueco para terminologia de futebol.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, которым необходимы специализированные возможности перевода на шведский язык для терминологии футбола.","ar":"مثالي لعميل اللغة الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات ترجمة مخصصة باللغة السويدية لمصطلحات كرة القدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to translate Sport Wizard application text into natural, context-aware Swedish using domain-appropriate terminology and prioritizing natural phrasing, while maintaining consistency with existing translation patterns and following deep context analysis principles.","zh":"赋予代理将 Sport Wizard 应用程序文本翻译成自然的、上下文感知的瑞典语，使用领域相关的术语，并优先考虑自然的表达方式，同时保持与现有翻译模式的一致性，并遵循深度上下文分析原则。","ja":"エージェントがSport Wizardアプリケーションのテキストを自然でコンテキストに応じたスウェーデン語に翻訳できるようにし、ドメイン固有の用語を使用し、自然なフレージングを優先し、既存の翻訳パターンと一貫性を維持し、深いコンテキスト分析の原則に従う。","ko":"에이전트가 스포츠 위자드 애플리케이션 텍스트를 자연스럽고 문맥에 맞는 스웨덴어로 번역할 수 있도록 해주며, 도메인 관련 용어를 사용하고 자연스러운 문구를 우선하며 기존 번역 패턴과 일관성을 유지하고 심층적인 문맥 분석 원칙을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a traducir texto de la aplicación Sport Wizard a sueco natural, consciente del contexto, utilizando terminología adecuada para el dominio y priorizando la fraseología natural, al mismo tiempo que mantiene la consistencia con los patrones de traducción existentes y sigue los principios de análisis de contexto profundo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traduire le texte de l''application Sport Wizard en suédois naturel, conscient du contexte, en utilisant une terminologie appropriée pour le domaine et en donnant la priorité à une phraseologie naturelle, tout en maintenant la cohérence avec les modèles de traduction existants et en suivant les principes d''analyse de contexte approfondie.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Text der Sport Wizard-Anwendung in natürliches, kontextbewusstes Schwedisch zu übersetzen, unter Verwendung von domänenangemessener Terminologie und Priorisierung natürlicher Formulierungen, während die Konsistenz mit bestehenden Übersetzungsmustern beibehalten und die Grundsätze der tiefen Kontextanalyse eingehalten werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a traduzir o texto do aplicativo Sport Wizard para sueco natural, ciente do contexto, usando terminologia apropriada ao domínio e priorizando a fraseologia natural, mantendo a consistência com os padrões de tradução existentes e seguindo os princípios de análise de contexto profunda.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью переводить текст приложения Sport Wizard на естественный, контекстно-зависимый шведский язык, используя терминологию, соответствующую предметной области, и отдающую приоритет естественному словообразованию, сохраняя при этом согласованность с существующими шаблонами перевода и следуя принципам глубокого контекстного анализа.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من ترجمة نص تطبيق Sport Wizard إلى سويدية طبيعية وواعية للسياق، باستخدام مصطلحات مناسبة لملاءمة المجال وتأثير العبارات الطبيعية، مع الحفاظ على الاتساق مع أنماط الترجمة القائمة وتطبيق مبادئ تحليل السياق العميق."},"useCases":{"en":["Translating soccer coach helper texts for 5v5 games","Converting Sport Wizard application content into Swedish","Localizing soccer terminology for Swedish-speaking audiences"],"zh":["将足球教练助手文本翻译为5v5游戏用瑞典语","将Sport Wizard应用程序内容转换为瑞典语","为瑞典语使用者本地化足球术语"],"ja":["5v5ゲーム用のサッカーコーチヘルパーテキストをスウェーデン語に翻訳する","Sport Wizardアプリケーションのコンテンツをスウェーデン語に変換する","スウェーデン語を話す人のためのサッカー用語のローカライズ"],"ko":["5v5 게임용 축구 코치 헬퍼 텍스트를 스웨덴어로 번역하는 것","스포츠 위자드 애플리케이션 내용을 스웨덴어로 변환하는 것","스웨덴어 사용자를 위한 축구 용어의 로컬라이제이션"],"es":["Traducir textos de ayuda de entrenadores de fútbol para partidos de 5v5","Convertir contenido de la aplicación Sport Wizard al sueco","Localizar terminología de fútbol para audiencias de habla sueca"],"fr":["Traduire les textes d''aide d''entraîneurs de football pour les matchs 5v5","Convertir le contenu de l''application Sport Wizard en suédois","Localiser la terminologie de football pour les audiences de langue suédoise"],"de":["Übersetzen von Fußballtrainer-Hilfetexten für 5v5-Spiele","Umwandeln von Sport Wizard-Anwendungsinhalten ins Schwedische","Lokalisieren von Fußballterminologie für schwedischsprachige Zielgruppen"],"pt":["Traduzir textos de ajuda de treinador de futebol para jogos 5v5","Converter o conteúdo do aplicativo Sport Wizard para sueco","Localizar terminologia de futebol para públicos de língua sueca"],"ru":["Переводить тексты помощников тренера по футболу для игр 5х5","Преобразовывать содержимое приложения Sport Wizard на шведский язык","Локализовать терминологию футбола для шведскоязычной аудитории"],"ar":["ترجمة نصوص مساعد مدرب كرة القدم لعب 5 ضد 5","تحويل محتوى تطبيق Sport Wizard إلى اللغة السويدية","تحويل مصطلحات كرة القدم لجماهير الناطقين بالسويدية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Swedish soccer terminology","Limited to translation of Sport Wizard application text","Dependent on existing translation patterns in the codebase"],"zh":["需要瑞典语足球术语的知识","仅限于Sport Wizard应用程序文本的翻译","依赖于代码库中现有的翻译模式"],"ja":["スウェーデン語のサッカー用語の知識が必要","Sport Wizardアプリケーションのテキストの翻訳のみ","コードベースに既存の翻訳パターンに依存"],"ko":["스웨덴어 축구 용어에 대한 지식이 필요함","스포츠 위자드 애플리케이션 텍스트의 번역에만 제한됨","코드베이스에 존재하는 번역 패턴에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la terminología de fútbol en sueco","Limitado a la traducción de texto de la aplicación Sport Wizard","Dependiente de los patrones de traducción existentes en el código base"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en terminologie de football en suédois","Limité à la traduction du texte de l''application Sport Wizard","Dépendant des modèles de traduction existants dans le code base"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der schwedischen Fußballterminologie","Begrenzt auf die Übersetzung von Text der Sport Wizard-Anwendung","Abhängig von bestehenden Übersetzungsmustern im Codebase"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de terminologia de futebol sueca","Limitado à tradução do texto do aplicativo Sport Wizard","Dependente dos padrões de tradução existentes no código"],"ru":["Требует знания шведской футбольной терминологии","Ограничен переводом текста приложения Sport Wizard","Зависит от существующих шаблонов перевода в кодовой базе"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة مصطلحات كرة القدم بالسويدية","محدود بترجمة نص تطبيق Sport Wizard","يعتمد على أنماط الترجمة القائمة في قاعدة الشفرة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e28e4b4085fc20da49a534e18d0022f6474280ec93f208d3b813142139adba62","qualityScore":52}');
