es","Flexibilidad y personalización en proyectos","Integración con tecnologías como React y Node.js","Compatibilidad con CLI para una mayor eficiencia"],"fr":["Structure de blog sur mesure","Outils d''IA pour les développeurs","Flexibilité et personnalisation dans les projets","Intégration avec des technologies comme React et Node.js","Compatibilité avec CLI pour une plus grande efficacité"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Blog-Struktur","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Flexibilität und Anpassungsfähigkeit in Projekten","Integration mit Technologien wie React und Node.js","Kompatibilität mit CLI für eine höhere Effizienz"],"pt":["Estrutura de blog personalizada","Desenvolvimento de soluções de IA","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Flexibilidade e personalização","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de conteúdo","Otimização para experiências de usuário"],"ru":["Пользовательская блог-структура","Разработка решений ИИ","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Гибкость и персонализация","Поддержка нескольких форматов контента","Оптимизация для пользовательских trải nghiệm"],"ar":["هيكل مدونة مخصص","تطوير حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","المرونة والتخصيص","دعم عدة صيغ للمحتوى","تحسين لتحقيق تجارب المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI智能代理","bellog-structure教程","AI智能代理工具","定制博客结构","bellog-structure安装","bellog-structure设置指南","React和AI智能代理","Python和AI智能代理"],"ja":["AIエージェントの使用方法","bellog-structureのチュートリアル","AIエージェントツール","カスタムブログ構造","bellog-structureのインストール","bellog-structureの設定ガイド","ReactとAIエージェント","PythonとAIエージェント"],"ko":["AI 에이전트의 사용 방법","bellog-structure 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 도구","맞춤형 블로그 구조","bellog-structure 설치","bellog-structure 설정 가이드","React와 AI 에이전트","Python과 AI 에이전트"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","estructura de blog personalizado","cómo utilizar herramientas de AI","alternativas a Castle Bell","Castle Bell vs competidores","instalación de Castle Bell","guía de configuración de Castle Bell"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","structure de blog sur mesure","comment utiliser les outils d''IA","alternatives à Castle Bell","Castle Bell vs concurrents","installation de Castle Bell","guide de configuration de Castle Bell"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","benutzerdefinierte Blog-Struktur","wie man KI-Tools verwendet","Alternativen zu Castle Bell","Castle Bell vs Wettbewerber","Installation von Castle Bell","Konfigurationsanleitung für Castle Bell"],"pt":["como usar bellog-structure","o que é bellog-structure","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","bellog-structure vs outras ferramentas","instalar bellog-structure","guia de configuração do bellog-structure","desenvolvimento de soluções de IA com bellog-structure","bellog-structure alternative"],"ru":["как использовать bellog-structure","что такое bellog-structure","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","bellog-structure vs другие инструменты","установить bellog-structure","руководство по настройке bellog-structure","разработка решений ИИ с bellog-structure","аналог bellog-structure"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام bellog-structure","ما هو bellog-structure","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","bellog-structure مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت bellog-structure","دليل إعداد bellog-structure","تطوير حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي مع bellog-structure","بديل bellog-structure"]}},"owner":"whddltjdwhd","repo":"bellog","repoPath":"whddltjdwhd/bellog","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.696Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bellog-structure","description":"Provides file organization and naming conventions for the Bellog project. Triggers when creating new files or reorganizing code.","bodyPreview":"# Bellog File Organization\n\nThis skill defines the file structure, naming conventions, and organization patterns for the Bellog blog project.\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\n/Users/castle_bell/Projects/bellog/\n├── src/\n│   ├── app/                    # Next.js App Router\n│   │   ├── layout.tsx          # Root layout with fonts & metadata\n│   │   ├── page.tsx            # Home page\n│   │   ├── template.tsx        # Page transition wrapper\n│   │   ├── providers.tsx       # Client-side providers\n│   │","body":"# Bellog File Organization\n\nThis skill defines the file structure, naming conventions, and organization patterns for the Bellog blog project.\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\n/Users/castle_bell/Projects/bellog/\n├── src/\n│   ├── app/                    # Next.js App Router\n│   │   ├── layout.tsx          # Root layout with fonts & metadata\n│   │   ├── page.tsx            # Home page\n│   │   ├── template.tsx        # Page transition wrapper\n│   │   ├── providers.tsx       # Client-side providers\n│   │   ├── posts/\n│   │   │   ├── page.tsx        # All posts page\n│   │   │   └── [slug]/\n│   │   │       └── page.tsx    # Individual post\n│   │   ├── api/\n│   │   │   └── revalidate/\n│   │   │       └── route.ts    # Cache revalidation endpoint\n│   │   ├── robots.ts           # SEO robots.txt\n│   │   └── sitemap.ts          # Dynamic sitemap\n│   │\n│   ├── components/\n│   │   ├── common/             # App-wide shared components\n│   │   │   ├── Navbar.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── Footer.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── Intro.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── Header.tsx\n│   │   │   └── ...\n│   │   ├── posts/              # Post-specific components\n│   │   │   ├── PostCard.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── PostList.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── PostRenderer.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── NotionToc.tsx\n│   │   │   └── ...\n│   │   └── ui/                 # Low-level UI primitives\n│   │       ├── Tag.tsx\n│   │       ├── ThemeToggle.tsx\n│   │       ├── switch.tsx\n│   │       └── ...\n│   │\n│   ├── hooks/                  # Custom React hooks\n│   │   ├── useScrollSpy.ts\n│   │   ├── useTocObserver.ts\n│   │   └── useHeadings.ts\n│   │\n│   ├── lib/                    # Business logic & utilities\n│   │   ├── notion.ts           # Notion API client\n│   │   ├── posts.ts            # Post data fetching\n│   │   ├── tags.ts             # Tag utilities\n│   │   └── utils.ts            # General utilities\n│   │\n│   ├── constants/              # Shared constants\n│   │   └── ui.ts               # UI-related constants\n│   │\n│   ├── types/                  # TypeScript types\n│   │   └── index.d.ts          # Global type definitions\n│   │\n│   └── styles/                 # Global styles\n│       └── global.css          # Theme variables + Tailwind\n│\n├── public/                     # Static assets\n├── .claude/                    # Claude Code configuration\n│   ├── agents/                 # Custom sub-agents\n│   └── skills/                 # Custom skills\n├── .github/                    # GitHub configuration\n│   └── PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md\n├── .husky/                     # Git hooks\n├── tailwind.config.ts          # Tailwind configuration\n├── tsconfig.json               # TypeScript configuration\n├── next.config.ts              # Next.js configuration\n├── package.json                # Dependencies & scripts\n├── commitlint.config.ts        # Commit message linting\n├── CLAUDE.md                   # Project guide\n└── README.md                   # Project documentation\n```\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n### Components\n\n**Rule:** PascalCase\n\n```\n✅ Correct:\nPostCard.tsx\nNotionToc.tsx\nScrollToTop.tsx\nThemeToggle.tsx\n\n❌ Wrong:\npostCard.tsx\nnotion-toc.tsx\nscroll_to_top.tsx\n```\n\n### Hooks\n\n**Rule:** camelCase with `use` prefix\n\n```\n✅ Correct:\nuseScrollSpy.ts\nuseTocObserver.ts\nuseHeadings.ts\nuseScrollPosition.ts\n\n❌ Wrong:\nUseScrollSpy.ts\nscroll-spy-hook.ts\nscrollSpy.ts (missing use prefix)\n```\n\n### Utilities & Libraries\n\n**Rule:** camelCase\n\n```\n✅ Correct:\nnotion.ts\nposts.ts\ntags.ts\nutils.ts\n\n❌ Wrong:\nNotion.ts\nPosts.ts\ntag-utils.ts\n```\n\n### Types\n\n**Rule:** camelCase file, PascalCase exports\n\n```\n✅ Correct:\nFile: index.d.ts\nExport: interface Post { }\nExport: type PostStatus = ''published'' | ''draft'';\n\n❌ Wrong:\nFile: Post.d.ts\nExport: interface post { }\n```\n\n### Constants\n\n**Rule:** SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE for values, camelCase for file\n\n```\n✅ Correct:\nFile: ui.ts\nExports:\n  export const HEADER_OFFSET = 80;\n  export const SCROLL_SPY_OFFSET = 100;\n\n❌ Wrong:\nexport const headerOffset = 80;\nexport const header-offset = 80;\n```\n\n### API Routes\n\n**Rule:** camelCase folder, route.ts file\n\n```\n✅ Correct:\napp/api/revalidate/route.ts\n\n❌ Wrong:\napp/api/Revalidate/route.ts\napp/api/revalidate/revalidate.ts\n```\n\n## Where to Place Files\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n**Q: Is it a React component?**\n- Yes → `/src/components/`\n  - App-wide (Navbar, Footer) → `/src/components/common/`\n  - Post-specific (PostCard, NotionToc) → `/src/components/posts/`\n  - Reusable UI primitive (Tag, Button) → `/src/components/ui/`\n\n**Q: Is it a custom hook?**\n- Yes → `/src/hooks/use[Name].ts`\n\n**Q: Is it business logic or data fetching?**\n- Yes → `/src/lib/`\n  - Notion API → `/src/lib/notion.ts`\n  - Post data → `/src/lib/posts.ts`\n  - Utility functions → `/src/lib/utils.ts`\n\n**Q: Is it a constant value?**\n- Yes → `/src/constants/`\n  - UI-related → `/src/constants/ui.ts`\n  - API-related → `/src/constants/api.ts`\n\n**Q: Is it a TypeScript type?**\n- Yes → `/src/types/index.d.ts`\n\n**Q: Is it a page or route?**\n- Yes → `/src/app/[route]/page.tsx`\n\n**Q: Is it an API endpoint?**\n- Yes → `/src/app/api/[endpoint]/route.ts`\n\n## Component Organization\n\n### Common Components (`/src/components/common/`)\n\nComponents used across multiple pages:\n- Layout components (Navbar, Footer)\n- Page sections (Intro, Header)\n- Shared widgets (ProgressBar)\n\n**Examples:**\n- `Navbar.tsx` - Site navigation\n- `Footer.tsx` - Site footer\n- `Intro.tsx` - Hero section with animations\n- `ProgressBar.tsx` - Scroll progress indicator\n- `Header.tsx` - Page headers\n\n### Post Components (`/src/components/posts/`)\n\nComponents specific to blog posts:\n- Post rendering (PostRenderer)\n- Post navigation (NotionToc, PostNavigation)\n- Post lists (PostList, PostCard)\n\n**Examples:**\n- `PostCard.tsx` - Individual post preview\n- `PostList.tsx` - Grid of post cards\n- `PostRenderer.tsx` - Notion content renderer\n- `NotionToc.tsx` - Table of contents\n- `PostNavigation.tsx` - Previous/Next navigation\n- `GiscusComments.tsx` - Comment system\n\n### UI Components (`/src/components/ui/`)\n\nLow-level, reusable UI primitives:\n- Buttons, inputs, switches\n- Tags, badges\n- Shadcn/ui components\n\n**Examples:**\n- `Tag.tsx` - Tag display\n- `TagList.tsx` - Tag filtering\n- `ThemeToggle.tsx` - Dark/light mode toggle\n- `switch.tsx` - Radix UI switch (shadcn/ui)\n\n## File Templates\n\n### Component Template\n\n```typescript\n// For interactive components\n\"use client\";\n\nimport { useState } from ''react'';\nimport { motion } from ''framer-motion'';\n\ninterface ComponentNameProps {\n  // Props\n}\n\nexport function ComponentName({ }: ComponentNameProps) {\n  // Logic\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {/* JSX */}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Hook Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { useState, useEffect } from ''react'';\n\n/**\n * Brief description of what this hook does\n *\n * @example\n * const value = useHookName();\n */\nexport function useHookName() {\n  // Hook logic\n\n  return value;\n}\n```\n\n### Utility Template\n\n```typescript\n/**\n * Brief description of utility function\n *\n * @param paramName - Description\n * @returns Description\n */\nexport function utilityName(paramName: Type): ReturnType {\n  // Implementation\n}\n```\n\n### Type Definition Template\n\n```typescript\n// /src/types/index.d.ts\n\nexport interface Post {\n  id: string;\n  title: string;\n  slug: string;\n  date: string;\n  description: string;\n  tags: string[];\n  status: PostStatus;\n}\n\nexport type PostStatus = ''published'' | ''draft'' | ''archived'';\n```\n\n## Import Organization\n\n### Order\n\n```typescript\n// 1. React & Next.js\nimport { useState } from ''react'';\nimport Link from ''next/link'';\n\n// 2. Third-party libraries\nimport { motion } from ''framer-motion'';\nimport { Search } from ''lucide-react'';\n\n// 3. Internal imports (@/...)\nimport { Button } from ''@/components/ui/button'';\nimport { getAllPosts } from ''@/lib/posts'';\nimport { HEADER_OFFSET } from ''@/constants/ui'';\n\n// 4. Relative imports\nimport { helperFunction } from ''../utils'';\n\n// 5. Type imports (separate)\nimport type { Post } from ''@/types'';\n```\n\n### Path Aliases\n\nBellog uses `@/` for root imports:\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Correct\nimport { PostCard } from ''@/components/posts/PostCard'';\nimport { getAllPosts } from ''@/lib/posts'';\nimport { HEADER_OFFSET } from ''@/constants/ui'';\n\n// ❌ Wrong (no relative paths from root)\nimport { PostCard } from ''../../components/posts/PostCard'';\n```\n\n## Code Organization Patterns\n\n### Single Responsibility\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Good - Each file has one clear purpose\n// /src/lib/notion.ts - Notion API calls\n// /src/lib/posts.ts - Post data transformation\n// /src/lib/tags.ts - Tag utilities\n\n// ❌ Bad - Everything in one file\n// /src/lib/everything.ts\n```\n\n### Group Related Code\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Good - Related components together\n/src/components/posts/\n  PostCard.tsx\n  PostList.tsx\n  PostNavigation.tsx\n\n// ❌ Bad - All components flat\n/src/components/\n  PostCard.tsx\n  Navbar.tsx\n  PostList.tsx\n  Footer.tsx\n```\n\n### Constants Extraction\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Good - Constants in separate file\n// /src/constants/ui.ts\nexport const HEADER_OFFSET = 80;\nexport const SCROLL_SPY_OFFSET = 100;\n\n// Component uses constants\nimport { HEADER_OFFSET } from ''@/constants/ui'';\n\n// ❌ Bad - Magic numbers in component\nconst offset = 80; // What is this?\n```\n\n## File Size Guidelines\n\n**Components:** < 200 lines\n- If larger, consider splitting into smaller components\n\n**Hooks:** < 100 lines\n- If larger, consider extracting helper functions\n\n**Utils:** < 50 lines per function\n- If larger, break into smaller functions\n\n**Types:** No limit\n- Types can be long, that''s okay\n\n## Barrel Exports (Avoid)\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Avoid barrel exports (index.ts files)\n// /src/components/index.ts\nexport { PostCard } from ''./PostCard'';\nexport { PostList } from ''./PostList'';\n\n// ✅ Prefer direct imports\nimport { PostCard } from ''@/components/posts/PostCard'';\nimport { PostList } from ''@/components/posts/PostList'';\n```\n\n**Why:** Barrel exports slow down builds and complicate tree-shaking.\n\n## Environment Files\n\n```\n.env.local          # Local development secrets (gitignored)\n.env.example        # Template (committed to git)\n```\n\n**Never commit:**\n- `.env.local`\n- `.env`\n- Any file with actual secrets\n\n## Git Ignore Patterns\n\nEnsure these are in `.gitignore`:\n\n```\n# Dependencies\nnode_modules/\n.pnp\n.pnp.js\n\n# Next.js\n.next/\nout/\n\n# Environment\n.env.local\n.env\n\n# IDE\n.vscode/\n.idea/\n\n# OS\n.DS_Store\n```\n\n## Documentation Structure\n\n```\n/                           # Root\n├── README.md              # Project overview & setup\n├── CLAUDE.md              # Development guide (for AI)\n└── docs/                  # Detailed documentation (if needed)\n    ├── architecture.md\n    └── deployment.md\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```\nComponents:     PascalCase.tsx      /src/components/{common,posts,ui}/\nHooks:          useName.ts          /src/hooks/\nUtilities:      name.ts             /src/lib/\nConstants:      NAME                /src/constants/\nTypes:          name.d.ts           /src/types/\nPages:          page.tsx            /src/app/[route]/\nAPI:            route.ts            /src/app/api/[endpoint]/\n```\n\n## Checklist for New Files\n\n- [ ] File in correct directory\n- [ ] Naming convention followed (PascalCase / camelCase)\n- [ ] Imports organized by category\n- [ ] Using @ alias for imports (not relative from root)\n- [ ] TypeScript types defined\n- [ ] No magic numbers (use constants)\n- [ ] Single responsibility (one clear purpose)\n- [ ] File size reasonable (< 200 lines for components)\n\nRemember: Organization is about findability. When someone looks for a file, it should be obvious where it is.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:36:37.123Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced Next.js App Router organization.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Next.js App Router 组织的前端代理。","ja":"Next.js App Router の高度な組織が必要なフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Next.js App Router 조직이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan una organización avanzada de Next.js App Router.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''une organisation avancée de Next.js App Router.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte Next.js App Router-Organisation benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de organização avançada do Next.js App Router.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходима продвинутая организация Next.js App Router.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى تنظيم متقدم ل Next.js App Router."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate deterministic file structures using Next.js, enabling efficient app routing and metadata management.","zh":"使代理能够使用 Next.js 生成确定性的文件结构，从而实现高效的应用路由和元数据管理。","ja":"エージェントが Next.js を使用して決定的なファイル構造を生成できるようにし、効率的なアプリ ルーティングとメタデータ管理を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Next.js를 사용하여 결정적인 파일 구조를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 효율적인 애플리케이션 라우팅 및 메타데이터 관리를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar estructuras de archivos deterministas utilizando Next.js, lo que permite una ruta de aplicaciones y gestión de metadatos eficientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des structures de fichiers déterministes en utilisant Next.js, permettant ainsi une routage d''applications et une gestion de métadonnées efficaces.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, deterministische Dateistrukturen mit Next.js zu generieren, wodurch eine effiziente App-Weiterleitung und Metadatenverwaltung ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar estruturas de arquivos determinísticas usando Next.js, permitindo o roteamento de aplicativos eficiente e gerenciamento de metadados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать детерминированные структуры файлов с помощью Next.js, обеспечивая эффективное маршрутизация приложений и управление метаданными.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد هياكل ملفات محددة باستخدام Next.js، مما يتيح التنقل الفعال للتطبيقات وإدارة البيانات الوصفية."},"useCases":{"en":["Organizing Next.js App Router files","Generating layout and page components","Debugging file structure inconsistencies"],"zh":["组织 Next.js App Router 文件","生成布局和页面组件","调试文件结构不一致"],"ja":["Next.js App Router ファイルを整理する","レイアウトとページコンポーネントを生成する","ファイル構造の不一致をデバッグする"],"ko":["Next.js App Router 파일을 조직화하는 것","레이아웃 및 페이지 구성 요소를 생성하는 것","파일 구조 불일치를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Organizar archivos de Next.js App Router","Generar componentes de diseño y página","Depurar inconsistencias en la estructura de archivos"],"fr":["Organiser les fichiers de Next.js App Router","Générer des composants de mise en page et de page","Déboguer les incohérences de structure de fichiers"],"de":["Next.js App Router-Dateien organisieren","Layout- und Seitenkomponenten generieren","Dateistrukturen inkonsistenzen debuggen"],"pt":["Organizar arquivos do Next.js App Router","Gerar componentes de layout e página","Depurar inconsistências na estrutura de arquivos"],"ru":["Организация файлов Next.js App Router","Генерация компонентов макета и страницы","Отладка несоответствий в структуре файлов"],"ar":["تنظيم ملفات Next.js App Router","توليد مكونات التصميم والصفحة","تصحيح أخطاء في بنية الملفات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Next.js project setup","Only compatible with Next.js App Router"],"zh":["需要 Next.js 项目设置","仅与 Next.js App Router 兼容"],"ja":["Next.js プロジェクト設定が必要","Next.js App Router との互換性のみ"],"ko":["Next.js 프로젝트 설정이 필요","Next.js App Router와의 호환성만"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto Next.js","Solo compatible con Next.js App Router"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Next.js","N''est compatible qu''avec Next.js App Router"],"de":["Benötigt Next.js-Projektsetup","Nur kompatibel mit Next.js App Router"],"pt":["Exige configuração do projeto Next.js","Somente compatível com Next.js App Router"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта Next.js","Только совместим с Next.js App Router"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع Next.js","متوافق فقط مع Next.js App Router"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6f81045fee9c6740c5d67e788399e84afe2a5cd282f60c799c5928c4bd22811c","qualityScore":52}');
