na creación más eficiente","Compatibilidad con la última versión de WordPress"],"fr":["Création de thèmes WordPress personnalisés","Intégration avec Figma pour des conceptions personnalisées","Textes configurables pour une personnalisation accrue","Utilisation de l''IA pour une création plus efficace","Compatibilité avec la dernière version de WordPress"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter WordPress-Themes","Integration mit Figma für benutzerdefinierte Designs","Konfigurierbare Texte für eine größere Anpassung","Verwendung von KI für eine effizientere Erstellung","Kompatibilität mit der neuesten WordPress-Version"],"pt":["Criação de temas WordPress personalizados","Integração com Figma","Textos configuráveis","Landing pages personalizadas","Otimização para SEO"],"ru":["Создание персонализированных тем WordPress","Интеграция с Figma","Настраиваемые тексты","Персонализированные лендинги","Оптимизация для SEO"],"ar":["إنشاء قوالب ووردبريس مخصصة","التكامل مع فيجما","نصوص قابلة للتعديل","صفحات هبوط مخصصة","تحسين لتحسين محركات البحث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["wordpress-pro","AI智能工具","WordPress主题创建","Figma设计","可配置主题","wordpress-pro教程","wordpress-pro安装","wordpress-pro设置","wordpress-pro vs 其他工具"],"ja":["wordpress-pro","AIエージェント","WordPressテーマ作成","Figmaデザイン","カスタマイズ可能なテーマ","wordpress-proの使い方","wordpress-proのインストール","wordpress-proの設定","wordpress-proと他のツールの比較"],"ko":["wordpress-pro","AI 에이전트","워드프레스 테마 생성","피그마 디자인","맞춤형 테마","wordpress-pro 사용법","wordpress-pro 설치","wordpress-pro 설정","wordpress-pro와 다른 도구의 비교"],"es":["herramientas de ia para wordpress","como crear un tema de wordpress personalizado","wordpress pro vs elementor","guias de instalacion de wordpress pro","mejores plugins de ia para wordpress","wordpress pro tutorial","como usar wordpress pro","wordpress pro alternativa","wordpress pro precio"],"fr":["outils d''ia pour wordpress","comment créer un thème wordpress personnalisé","wordpress pro vs elementor","guides d''installation de wordpress pro","meilleurs plugins d''ia pour wordpress","tutoriel wordpress pro","comment utiliser wordpress pro","alternative à wordpress pro","prix de wordpress pro"],"de":["ki-tools für wordpress","wie man ein benutzerdefiniertes wordpress-theme erstellt","wordpress pro vs elementor","anleitungen zur installation von wordpress pro","beste ki-plugins für wordpress","wordpress pro tutorial","wie man wordpress pro verwendet","alternative zu wordpress pro","preis von wordpress pro"],"pt":["como usar wordpress-pro","o que é wordpress-pro","ferramentas de ia para wordpress","wordpress-pro vs elementor","instalar wordpress-pro","guia de configuração do wordpress-pro"],"ru":["как использовать wordpress-pro","что такое wordpress-pro","инструменты ИИ для wordpress","wordpress-pro vs elementor","установить wordpress-pro","руководство по настройке wordpress-pro"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ووردبريس برو","ما هو ووردبريس برو","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لوردبريس","ووردبريس برو مقابل إلمينتور","تثبيت ووردبريس برو","دليل إعداد ووردبريس برو"]}},"owner":"ErickAguilar95","repo":"full_wordpress_figma_creator","repoPath":"ErickAguilar95/full_wordpress_figma_creator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.714Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wordpress-pro","description":"Use when developing WordPress themes, plugins, customizing Gutenberg blocks, implementing WooCommerce features, or optimizing WordPress performance and security.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# WordPress Pro\n\nExpert WordPress developer specializing in custom themes, plugins, Gutenberg blocks, WooCommerce, and WordPress performance optimization.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior WordPress developer with deep experience building custom themes, plugins, and WordPress solutions. You specialize in modern WordPress development with PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, WooCommerce customization, REST API integration, and performance optimization. You build secure, scalable WordPress s","body":"# WordPress Pro\n\nExpert WordPress developer specializing in custom themes, plugins, Gutenberg blocks, WooCommerce, and WordPress performance optimization.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior WordPress developer with deep experience building custom themes, plugins, and WordPress solutions. You specialize in modern WordPress development with PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, WooCommerce customization, REST API integration, and performance optimization. You build secure, scalable WordPress sites following WordPress coding standards and best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building custom WordPress themes with template hierarchy\n- Developing WordPress plugins with proper architecture\n- Creating custom Gutenberg blocks and block patterns\n- Customizing WooCommerce functionality\n- Implementing WordPress REST API endpoints\n- Optimizing WordPress performance and security\n- Working with Advanced Custom Fields (ACF)\n- Full Site Editing (FSE) and block themes\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Understand WordPress context, existing setup, goals\n2. **Design architecture** - Plan theme/plugin structure, hooks, data flow\n3. **Implement** - Build using WordPress standards, security best practices\n4. **Optimize** - Cache, query optimization, asset optimization\n5. **Test & secure** - Security audit, performance testing, compatibility checks\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Theme Development | `references/theme-development.md` | Templates, hierarchy, child themes, FSE |\n| Plugin Architecture | `references/plugin-architecture.md` | Structure, activation, settings API, updates |\n| Gutenberg Blocks | `references/gutenberg-blocks.md` | Block dev, patterns, FSE, dynamic blocks |\n| Hooks & Filters | `references/hooks-filters.md` | Actions, filters, custom hooks, priorities |\n| Performance & Security | `references/performance-security.md` | Caching, optimization, hardening, backups |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Follow WordPress Coding Standards (WPCS)\n- Use nonces for form submissions\n- Sanitize all user inputs with appropriate functions\n- Escape all outputs (esc_html, esc_url, esc_attr)\n- Use prepared statements for database queries\n- Implement proper capability checks\n- Enqueue scripts/styles properly (wp_enqueue_*)\n- Use WordPress hooks instead of modifying core\n- Write translatable strings with text domains\n- Test across multiple WordPress versions\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Modify WordPress core files\n- Use PHP short tags or deprecated functions\n- Trust user input without sanitization\n- Output data without escaping\n- Hardcode database table names (use $wpdb->prefix)\n- Skip capability checks in admin functions\n- Ignore SQL injection vulnerabilities\n- Bundle unnecessary libraries (use WordPress APIs)\n- Create security vulnerabilities through file uploads\n- Skip internationalization (i18n)\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing WordPress features, provide:\n1. Main plugin/theme file with proper headers\n2. Relevant template files or block code\n3. Functions with proper WordPress hooks\n4. Security implementations (nonces, sanitization, escaping)\n5. Brief explanation of WordPress-specific patterns used\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nWordPress 6.4+, PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg, WooCommerce, ACF, REST API, WP-CLI, block development, theme customizer, widget API, shortcode API, transients, object caching, query optimization, security hardening, WPCS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:47:44.724Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing advanced WordPress theme customization and performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级WordPress主题自定义和性能优化功能的Web开发代理。","ja":"WordPressテーマの高度なカスタマイズとパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とするWeb開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 워드프레스 테마 사용자 정의 및 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan personalización avanzada de temas de WordPress y capacidades de optimización de rendimiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web nécessitant une personnalisation de thème WordPress avancée et des capacités d''optimisation des performances.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte Anpassungsmöglichkeiten für WordPress-Themes und Leistungsoptimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que necessitam de personalização avançada de temas do WordPress e capacidades de otimização de desempenho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым требуются расширенные возможности настройки тем WordPress и оптимизации производительности.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطوير الويب الذين يحتاجون إلى تخصيص متقدم لأشكال الويبورد البريس ومزايا تحسين الأداء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop custom WordPress themes with Gutenberg block development, integrate WooCommerce for e-commerce solutions, and optimize performance using PHP 8.1+ and REST API integration.","zh":"赋予代理开发具有Gutenberg块开发的自定义WordPress主题的能力，集成WooCommerce进行电子商务解决方案，并使用PHP 8.1+和REST API集成优化性能。","ja":"Gutenbergブロック開発を備えたカスタムWordPressテーマを開発し、WooCommerceを統合して電子商取引ソリューションを実現し、PHP 8.1+とREST API統合を使用してパフォーマンスを最適化するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"구텐버그 블록 개발을 갖춘 사용자 정의 워드프레스 테마를 개발하고 WooCommerce를 통합하여 전자 상거래 솔루션을 제공하며 PHP 8.1+와 REST API 통합을 사용하여 성능을 최적화하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes desarrollar temas personalizados de WordPress con el desarrollo de bloques de Gutenberg, integrar WooCommerce para soluciones de comercio electrónico y optimizar el rendimiento utilizando PHP 8.1+ y la integración de REST API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des thèmes WordPress personnalisés avec le développement de blocs Gutenberg, d''intégrer WooCommerce pour des solutions de commerce électronique et d''optimiser les performances en utilisant PHP 8.1+ et l''intégration de l''API REST.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, benutzerdefinierte WordPress-Themes mit Gutenberg-Blockentwicklung zu erstellen, WooCommerce für E-Commerce-Lösungen zu integrieren und die Leistung mit PHP 8.1+ und REST-API-Integration zu optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver temas personalizados do WordPress com desenvolvimento de blocos Gutenberg, integrar o WooCommerce para soluções de comércio eletrônico e otimizar o desempenho usando PHP 8.1+ e integração da REST API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разрабатывать пользовательские темы WordPress с разработкой блоков Gutenberg, интегрировать WooCommerce для решений электронной коммерции и оптимизировать производительность с помощью PHP 8.1+ и интеграции REST API.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تطوير أشكال ويبورد بريس مخصصة مع تطوير كتلة جوتنبرج، وتكامل ووكوميرس لحلول التجارة الإلكترونية، و تحسين الأداء باستخدام PHP 8.1+ ودمج REST API."},"useCases":{"en":["Building custom WordPress themes with configurable text boxes","Developing Gutenberg blocks for enhanced content creation","Optimizing WordPress performance for scalable and secure solutions"],"zh":["使用可配置文本框构建自定义WordPress主题","开发Gutenberg块以增强内容创建","使用PHP 8.1+和REST API集成优化WordPress性能以实现可扩展和安全的解决方案"],"ja":["構成可能なテキストボックスを使用してカスタムWordPressテーマを構築する","Gutenbergブロックを開発してコンテンツ作成を強化する","PHP 8.1+とREST API統合を使用してWordPressのパフォーマンスを最適化し、スケーラブルでセキュアなソリューションを実現する"],"ko":["구성 가능한 텍스트 상자를 사용하여 사용자 정의 워드프레스 테마를 구축하는 것","콘텐츠 생성을 강화하기 위한 구텐버그 블록 개발","PHP 8.1+와 REST API 통합을 사용하여 워드프레스 성능을 최적화하여 확장 가능하고 보안이 강화된 솔루션을 제공하는 것"],"es":["Crear temas personalizados de WordPress con cuadros de texto configurables","Desarrollar bloques de Gutenberg para una creación de contenido mejorada","Optimizar el rendimiento de WordPress para soluciones escalables y seguras"],"fr":["Créer des thèmes WordPress personnalisés avec des boîtes de texte configurables","Développer des blocs Gutenberg pour une création de contenu améliorée","Optimiser les performances de WordPress pour des solutions évolutives et sécurisées"],"de":["Erstellen benutzerdefinierter WordPress-Themes mit konfigurierbaren Textfeldern","Entwickeln von Gutenberg-Blöcken für eine verbesserte Inhaltsbildung","Optimieren der WordPress-Leistung für skalierbare und sichere Lösungen"],"pt":["Construção de temas personalizados do WordPress com caixas de texto configuráveis","Desenvolvimento de blocos Gutenberg para criação de conteúdo aprimorada","Otimização do desempenho do WordPress para soluções escaláveis e seguras"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских тем WordPress с настраиваемыми текстовыми полями","Разработка блоков Gutenberg для улучшения создания контента","Оптимизация производительности WordPress для масштабируемых и безопасных решений"],"ar":["بناء أشكال ويبورد بريس مخصصة مع مربعات نص قابل للتهيئة","تطوير كتل جوتنبرج لتحسين إنشاء المحتوى","تحسين أداء ويبورد بريس للحلول القابلة للتوسيع والأمن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PHP 8.1+ compatibility","WordPress-specific development only"],"zh":["需要PHP 8.1+兼容性","仅限WordPress开发"],"ja":["PHP 8.1+の互換性が必要","WordPress専用開発のみ"],"ko":["PHP 8.1+ 호환성이 필요","워드프레스 전용 개발만"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con PHP 8.1+","Desarrollo específico de WordPress solo"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec PHP 8.1+","Développement spécifique de WordPress uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt PHP 8.1+-Kompatibilität","Nur WordPress-spezifische Entwicklung"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com PHP 8.1+","Desenvolvimento específico do WordPress apenas"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с PHP 8.1+","Только разработка специфичная для WordPress"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع PHP 8.1+","التطوير الخاص بالويبورد بريس فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"161e8ea72a5640682907e80c2eec76f5e588d9a6c07125db79f4c9e067e33018","qualityScore":52}');
