e backend pour les tâches d''IA","Intégration avec des technologies comme React, Python et Node.js","CLI pour une plus grande efficacité","Agents d''IA pour une automatisation optimale"],"de":["Erstellung von KI-Teams in Sekundenschnelle","Sofortiger Arbeitsbeginn","Backend-Tool für KI-Aufgaben","Integration mit Technologien wie React, Python und Node.js","CLI für eine höhere Effizienz","KI-Agents für eine optimale Automatisierung"],"pt":["Criação de equipe de AI em segundos","Trabalho imediato com tarefas de AI","Ferramenta de backend para tarefas de AI","Integração com React, Python, Node.js","CLI para controle de tarefas","Agente de AI para automação de tarefas"],"ru":["Создание команды ИИ за секунды","Немедленная работа с задачами ИИ","Инструмент для задач ИИ на стороне сервера","Интеграция с React, Python, Node.js","CLI для управления задачами","Агент ИИ для автоматизации задач"],"ar":["إنشاء فريق الذكاء الاصطناعي في ثوان","العمل الفوري مع مهام الذكاء الاصطناعي","أداة خلفية لمهام الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع React, Python, Node.js","CLI للتحكم في المهام","عميل الذكاء الاصطناعي للتحكم الآلي في المهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","后端任务拆解","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理的优势","AI智能代理与传统开发的区别","AI智能代理的应用场景","如何安装AI智能代理","AI智能代理的设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","バックエンドタスク分解","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントの利点","AIエージェントと従来の開発の違い","AIエージェントの適用场景","AIエージェントのインストール方法","AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","백엔드 태스크 분해","AI 에이전트의 사용법","AI 에이전트의 장점","AI 에이전트와 전통적인 개발의 차이","AI 에이전트의 적용场景","AI 에이전트의 설치 방법","AI 에이전트의 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de ia","creación de equipos de ia","trabajo de ia","aico-backend-task-breakdown alternativa","aico-backend-task-breakdown vs otros","instalación de aico-backend-task-breakdown","guía de configuración de aico-backend-task-breakdown","uso de react con aico-backend-task-breakdown","uso de python con aico-backend-task-breakdown"],"fr":["outils d''ia","création d''équipes d''ia","travail d''ia","aico-backend-task-breakdown alternative","aico-backend-task-breakdown vs autres","installation de aico-backend-task-breakdown","guide de configuration de aico-backend-task-breakdown","utilisation de react avec aico-backend-task-breakdown","utilisation de python avec aico-backend-task-breakdown"],"de":["ki-tools","erstellung von ki-teams","ki-arbeit","aico-backend-task-breakdown alternative","aico-backend-task-breakdown vs andere","installation von aico-backend-task-breakdown","konfigurationsanleitung für aico-backend-task-breakdown","verwendung von react mit aico-backend-task-breakdown","verwendung von python mit aico-backend-task-breakdown"],"pt":["como usar aico-backend-task-breakdown","o que é aico-backend-task-breakdown","aico-backend-task-breakdown alternative","aico-backend-task-breakdown vs outros","instalar aico-backend-task-breakdown","guia de configuração do aico-backend-task-breakdown","desenvolvedores de AI","ferramentas de AI para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать aico-backend-task-breakdown","что такое aico-backend-task-breakdown","альтернативы aico-backend-task-breakdown","aico-backend-task-breakdown vs другие","установка aico-backend-task-breakdown","руководство по настройке aico-backend-task-breakdown","разработчики ИИ","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام aico-backend-task-breakdown","ما هو aico-backend-task-breakdown","بديل aico-backend-task-breakdown","aico-backend-task-breakdown مقابل الآخرين","تثبيت aico-backend-task-breakdown","دليل إعداد aico-backend-task-breakdown","مطورو الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"yellinzero","repo":"aico","repoPath":"yellinzero/aico","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.756Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"aico-backend-task-breakdown","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Task Breakdown\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL RULES - READ FIRST\n\n**BEFORE doing anything, you MUST:**\n\n1. **CHECK EXISTING TASK FILE FIRST**:\n   - ALWAYS check if `story-{story-name}.md` already exists in `docs/reference/backend/tasks/`\n   - If exists: READ it and continue from current progress (add new tasks or update existing ones)\n   - If not exists: Create new task breakdown file\n   - **NEVER re-break down existing tasks**\n\n2. **FILE NAMING**:\n   - Pattern: `story-{story-name}.md` (single file per story","body":"# Task Breakdown\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL RULES - READ FIRST\n\n**BEFORE doing anything, you MUST:**\n\n1. **CHECK EXISTING TASK FILE FIRST**:\n   - ALWAYS check if `story-{story-name}.md` already exists in `docs/reference/backend/tasks/`\n   - If exists: READ it and continue from current progress (add new tasks or update existing ones)\n   - If not exists: Create new task breakdown file\n   - **NEVER re-break down existing tasks**\n\n2. **FILE NAMING**:\n   - Pattern: `story-{story-name}.md` (single file per story)\n   - Example: `story-user-profile.md`\n   - All tasks for this story go into this ONE file\n   - Tasks are separated by `---` dividers\n\n3. **MULTIPLE TASKS IN ONE FILE**:\n   - One file contains ALL tasks for the story\n   - Each task = independently testable section\n   - Clear scope and acceptance criteria per task\n   - Tasks numbered sequentially (Task 1, Task 2, etc.)\n\n4. **ALWAYS SAVE TO CORRECT PATH**:\n   - Path: `docs/reference/backend/tasks/story-{story-name}.md`\n   - NO exceptions, NO other locations\n\n5. **READ CONTEXT FIRST**:\n   - Read story from `docs/reference/pm/stories/`\n   - Read constraints from `docs/reference/backend/constraints.md`\n\n## Language Configuration\n\nBefore generating any content, check `aico.json` in project root for `language` field to determine the output language. If not set, default to English.\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Read story/PRD**: Load from `docs/reference/pm/stories/` or `docs/reference/pm/versions/`\n2. **Read constraints**: Load technical constraints\n3. **Identify components**: What backend layers are needed\n4. **Identify interactions**: What APIs and data flows are needed\n5. **Break into tasks**: Independently testable, single responsibility, by architecture layer\n6. **Order by dependencies**: Types → DB → Repository → Service → API → Tests\n7. **Generate single file**: Create `story-{story-name}.md` with all tasks in sections\n8. **Update Story file**: Add \"Related Tasks\" section to story file with link to task file\n9. **Summary**: Show created file and next steps\n\n## Task File Format\n\nSee [Task File Template](references/task-file-template.md) for complete structure.\n\n**Key points:**\n\n- Single file contains all tasks for the story\n- Tasks numbered sequentially (Task 1, Task 2, etc.)\n- Each task has: Description, Context, Acceptance Criteria, Scope, Implementation Steps\n- Progress section at the end tracks completion\n- Both story-based and standalone use the same format (only filename differs)\n- Backend tasks ordered by architecture layers: Types → DB → Repository → Service → API → Tests\n\n## Updating Story File\n\nAfter generating the task file, **ALWAYS** update the story file to add the \"Related Tasks\" section:\n\n```markdown\n## Related Tasks\n\n### Backend Tasks\n\nTask breakdown: [docs/reference/backend/tasks/story-user-profile.md](../backend/tasks/story-user-profile.md)\n\n**Progress**: 0/6 tasks completed\n\n- [ ] Task 1: Define Types\n- [ ] Task 2: Database Schema\n- [ ] Task 3: Repository Layer\n- [ ] Task 4: Service Layer\n- [ ] Task 5: API Endpoints\n- [ ] Task 6: Add Tests\n```\n\n**Key points:**\n\n- Add this section at the end of the story file (before any existing notes)\n- Include link to the task file\n- Use `- [ ]` checkboxes for each task (will be checked when task completes)\n- List tasks in execution order (Types → DB → Repository → Service → API → Tests)\n- Keep the section organized by frontend/backend if both exist\n- Include progress counter (X/Y tasks completed)\n\n## Output Example\n\nAfter breaking down \"user-profile\" story:\n\n```\nCreated task file for story ''user-profile'':\n\n✓ docs/reference/backend/tasks/story-user-profile.md\n\nTask breakdown includes:\n- Task 1: Define Types (setup)\n- Task 2: Database Schema (feature)\n- Task 3: Repository Layer (feature)\n- Task 4: Service Layer (feature)\n- Task 5: API Endpoints (feature)\n- Task 6: Add Tests (testing)\n\nTotal: 6 tasks\n\nNext steps:\n1. Review task breakdown in story-user-profile.md\n2. Use /backend.plan to add detailed steps to specific tasks\n3. Use /backend.implement to start executing tasks\n```\n\n## Key Rules\n\n- ALWAYS create a single file containing all tasks for the story\n- MUST use `story-{story-name}.md` naming (NOT multiple files)\n- ALWAYS include test tasks at the end\n- MUST note dependencies between tasks (in each task''s metadata)\n- Keep tasks focused - not too big, not too small\n- Each task section is self-contained with clear acceptance criteria\n- Separate tasks with `---` dividers\n- Include Story Progress section at the end of file\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n- ❌ Tasks too large (full feature) → ✅ Break into layers\n- ❌ Tasks too small (add one field) → ✅ Group related work\n- ❌ Skip dependencies → ✅ Note which tasks depend on others\n- ❌ Forget testing → ✅ Always include test tasks\n- ❌ Create multiple files → ✅ Use single file with multiple task sections\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:14:17.401Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Team Management Agents needing standardized task breakdown capabilities in Markdown format.","zh":"非常适合需要在Markdown格式中标准化任务分解能力的AI团队管理代理。","ja":"Markdown形式のタスク分解機能を標準化する必要があるAIチーム管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"마크다운 형식에서 태스크 분할 기능을 표준화해야 하는 AI 팀 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de equipos de IA que necesitan capacidades de desglose de tareas estandarizadas en formato Markdown.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion d''équipe d''IA nécessitant des capacités de décomposition de tâches standardisées au format Markdown.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Team-Management-Agents, die standardisierte Aufgabenzerlegungsfunktionen im Markdown-Format benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Equipe de IA que necessitam de capacidades de quebra de tarefas padronizadas no formato Markdown.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению командой ИИ, которым необходимы стандартизированные возможности разбиения задач в формате Markdown.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة فريق الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات تقسيم المهام الموحدة في تنسيق Markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage tasks efficiently by checking existing task files, creating new task breakdown files, and updating existing ones, all while following a strict file naming pattern of story-{story-name}.md.","zh":"通过检查现有的任务文件、创建新的任务分解文件和更新现有的文件（同时遵循严格的story-{story-name}.md文件命名模式），使得代理能够高效地管理任务。","ja":"既存のタスクファイルを確認し、新しいタスク分解ファイルを作成し、既存のファイルを更新する（同時に厳密なstory-{story-name}.mdファイル命名パターンに従う）ことで、エージェントがタスクを効率的に管理できるようにします。","ko":"기존의 태스크 파일을 확인하고 새로운 태스크 분할 파일을 만들고 기존의 파일을 업데이트함으로써 (동시에 엄격한 story-{story-name}.md 파일명 패턴을 따름), 에이전트가 태스크를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar tareas de manera eficiente comprobando los archivos de tareas existentes, creando nuevos archivos de desglose de tareas y actualizando los existentes, todo mientras sigue un patrón de nomenclatura de archivo estricto de story-{story-name}.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les tâches de manière efficace en vérifiant les fichiers de tâches existants, en créant de nouveaux fichiers de décomposition de tâches et en mettant à jour les existants, tout en suivant un modèle de nom de fichier strict de story-{story-name}.md.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Aufgaben effizient zu verwalten, indem sie bestehende Aufgabendateien überprüfen, neue Aufgabenzerlegungsdateien erstellen und bestehende aktualisieren, während sie einem strengen Dateinamensmuster von story-{story-name}.md folgen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar tarefas de forma eficiente, verificando arquivos de tarefas existentes, criando novos arquivos de quebra de tarefas e atualizando os existentes, seguindo um padrão de nomenclatura de arquivo estrito de story-{story-name}.md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять задачами, проверяя существующие файлы задач, создавая новые файлы разбиения задач и обновляя существующие, при этом соблюдая строгий шаблон названия файла story-{story-name}.md.","ar":"يُمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة المهام بفعالية من خلال التحقق من ملفات المهام الحالية وإنشاء ملفات جديدة لتقسيم المهام وتحديث الملفات الحالية، مع اتباع نمط تسمية ملف صارم هو story-{story-name}.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task breakdown file creation","Updating existing task progress in Markdown files","Ensuring consistency in task file naming and organization"],"zh":["自动化任务分解文件的创建","在Markdown文件中更新现有的任务进度","确保任务文件命名和组织的一致性"],"ja":["タスク分解ファイルの作成を自動化する","Markdownファイル内の既存のタスク進度を更新する","タスクファイルの命名と組織の一貫性を確保する"],"ko":["태스크 분할 파일의 생성을 자동화하는 것","마크다운 파일 내의 기존 태스크 진행 상황을 업데이트하는 것","태스크 파일명의 일관성과 조직을 보장하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de archivos de desglose de tareas","Actualización del progreso de tareas existentes en archivos Markdown","Garantía de la coherencia en la nomenclatura y organización de archivos de tareas"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de fichiers de décomposition de tâches","Mise à jour du progrès des tâches existantes dans les fichiers Markdown","Assurance de la cohérence dans la nomination et l''organisation des fichiers de tâches"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Aufgabenzerlegungsdateien","Aktualisierung des Fortschritts bestehender Aufgaben in Markdown-Dateien","Sicherstellung der Konsistenz in der Namensgebung und Organisation von Aufgabendateien"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de arquivos de quebra de tarefas","Atualizar o progresso das tarefas existentes em arquivos Markdown","Garantir a consistência na nomenclatura e organização de arquivos de tarefas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание файлов разбиения задач","Обновлять прогресс существующих задач в файлах Markdown","Обеспечивать согласованность в именовании и организации файлов задач"],"ar":["توفير автомاتيزيرون لإنشاء ملفات تقسيم المهام","تحديث التقدم المحرز في المهام الحالية في ملفات Markdown","ضمان الاتساق في تسمية وتنظيم ملفات المهام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the docs/reference/backend/tasks/ directory","Must adhere to the story-{story-name}.md file naming pattern"],"zh":["需要访问docs/reference/backend/tasks/目录","必须遵循story-{story-name}.md文件命名模式"],"ja":["docs/reference/backend/tasks/ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","story-{story-name}.mdファイル命名パターンに従わなければならない"],"ko":["docs/reference/backend/tasks/ 디렉토리에 접근해야 함","story-{story-name}.md 파일명 패턴을 따라야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio docs/reference/backend/tasks/","Debe adherirse al patrón de nomenclatura de archivo story-{story-name}.md"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire docs/reference/backend/tasks/","Doit suivre le modèle de nom de fichier story-{story-name}.md"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis docs/reference/backend/tasks/","Muss dem Dateinamensmuster story-{story-name}.md folgen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório docs/reference/backend/tasks/","Deve aderir ao padrão de nomenclatura de arquivo story-{story-name}.md"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к каталогу docs/reference/backend/tasks/","Должно следовать шаблону названия файла story-{story-name}.md"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل docs/reference/backend/tasks/","يجب اتباع نمط تسمية الملف story-{story-name}.md"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1b05c916a71fdb86ca40c35955273cb174e54d0f237185a51e8512737a580877","qualityScore":52}');
