d AI Audio TTSは、深層学習ベースの音声合成技術で、テキストを自然な流暢な音声に変換する","ko":"알리바바 클라우드 AI 오디오 TTS 스킬은 깊은 학습 기반의 음성 합성 기술로, 텍스트를 자연스럽고流暢한 음성으로 변환합니다","es":"La habilidad alicloud-ai-audio-tts es una herramienta de AI de Alibaba Cloud que ofrece funcionalidades de texto a voz.","fr":"La compétence alicloud-ai-audio-tts est un outil d''IA d''Alibaba Cloud qui offre des fonctionnalités de texte à voix.","de":"Die Fähigkeit alicloud-ai-audio-tts ist ein KI-Tool von Alibaba Cloud, das Text-to-Speech-Funktionen bietet.","pt":"O alicloud-ai-audio-tts é um agente de IA para áudio TTS da Alibaba Cloud, permitindo a criação de aplicações de áudio realistas","ru":"ИИ Агент alicloud-ai-audio-tts от Alibaba Cloud позволяет создавать реалистичные аудио-приложения","ar":"وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي alicloud-ai-audio-tts من Alibaba Cloud يسمح بإنشاء تطبيقات صوتية واقعية","en":"alibaba cloud skills，qwen ，wan and all skills"},"definition":{"en":"alibaba cloud skills，qwen ，wan and all skills"},"features":{"zh":["基于深度学习的语音合成技术","支持多种语音和语言","可以将文本转换为自然流畅的语音","适用于各种应用场景，如客服、播音等"],"ja":["深層学習ベースの音声合成技術","複数の音声と言語をサポート","テキストを自然な流暢な音声に変換する","カスタマーサポート、放送など様々なアプリケーションシーンに適応"],"ko":["깊은 학습 기반의 음성 합성 기술","여러 가지 음성과 언어를 지원","텍스트를 자연스럽고流暢한 음성으로 변환","고객 지원, 방송 등 다양한 응용 프로그램에 적합"],"es":["Conversión de texto a voz","Compatibilidad con varios idiomas","Integración con Alibaba Cloud","Funcionalidades de personalización","Soporte para aplicaciones de desarrollo"],"fr":["Conversion de texte en voix","Compatibilité avec plusieurs langues","Intégration avec Alibaba Cloud","Fonctionnalités de personnalisation","Support pour les applications de développement"],"de":["Text-to-Speech-Umwandlung","Unterstützung für mehrere Sprachen","Integration mit Alibaba Cloud","Funktionen zur Anpassung","Unterstützung für Entwicklungsanwendungen"],"pt":["Síntese de áudio realista","Integração com a plataforma Alibaba Cloud","Suporte a múltiplos idiomas","Fácil implementação com APIs","Personalização de vozes e estilos"],"ru":["Реалистичный синтез аудио","Интеграция с платформой Alibaba Cloud","Поддержка нескольких языков","Легкая реализация с помощью API","Настройка голосов и стилей"],"ar":["合成 صوت واقعي","التكامل مع منصة Alibaba Cloud","دعم لعدة لغات","تنفيذ سهل مع واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","تخصيص الأصوات والأسلوب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["阿里云AI音频TTS技能","AI音频处理","语音合成技术","如何使用阿里云AI音频TTS技能","阿里云AI音频TTS技能安装","阿里云AI音频TTS技能设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント：Alibaba Cloud AI Audio TTS","AI音声処理","音声合成技術","Alibaba Cloud AI Audio TTSの使い方","Alibaba Cloud AI Audio TTSのインストール","Alibaba Cloud AI Audio TTSの設定ガイド"],"ko":["알리바바 클라우드 AI 오디오 TTS 스킬","AI 오디오 처리","음성 합성 기술","알리바바 클라우드 AI 오디오 TTS 스킬 사용법","알리바바 클라우드 AI 오디오 TTS 스킬 설치","알리바바 클라우드 AI 오디오 TTS 스킬 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo utilizar alicloud-ai-audio-tts","qué es la herramienta de AI","alternativas a alicloud-ai-audio-tts","alicloud-ai-audio-tts vs Google Cloud","instalación de alicloud-ai-audio-tts","guía de configuración de alicloud-ai-audio-tts","desarrollo de aplicaciones con alicloud-ai-audio-tts"],"fr":["comment utiliser alicloud-ai-audio-tts","qu''est-ce que l''outil d''IA","alternatives à alicloud-ai-audio-tts","alicloud-ai-audio-tts vs Google Cloud","installation de alicloud-ai-audio-tts","guide de configuration de alicloud-ai-audio-tts","développement d''applications avec alicloud-ai-audio-tts"],"de":["wie man alicloud-ai-audio-tts verwendet","was ist das KI-Tool","alternativen zu alicloud-ai-audio-tts","alicloud-ai-audio-tts vs Google Cloud","installation von alicloud-ai-audio-tts","konfigurationsanleitung für alicloud-ai-audio-tts","entwicklung von anwendungen mit alicloud-ai-audio-tts"],"pt":["como usar alicloud-ai-audio-tts","o que é agente de ia","alicloud-ai-audio-tts vs google cloud text-to-speech","instalar alicloud-ai-audio-tts","guia de configuração do alicloud-ai-audio-tts","alternativas ao alicloud-ai-audio-tts"],"ru":["как использовать alicloud-ai-audio-tts","что такое ИИ Агент","alicloud-ai-audio-tts vs google cloud text-to-speech","установить alicloud-ai-audio-tts","руководство по настройке alicloud-ai-audio-tts","альтернативы alicloud-ai-audio-tts"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام alicloud-ai-audio-tts","ما هو وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","alicloud-ai-audio-tts vs google cloud text-to-speech","تثبيت alicloud-ai-audio-tts","دليل إعداد alicloud-ai-audio-tts","بديل alicloud-ai-audio-tts"]}},"owner":"cinience","repo":"alicloud-skills","repoPath":"cinience/alicloud-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.762Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"alicloud-ai-audio-tts","description":"Generate human-like speech audio with Model Studio DashScope Qwen TTS models (qwen3-tts-flash, qwen3-tts-instruct-flash). Use when converting text to speech, producing voice lines for short drama/news videos, or documenting TTS request/response fields for DashScope.","bodyPreview":"Category: provider\n\n# Model Studio Qwen TTS\n\n## Validation\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts\npython -m py_compile skills/ai/audio/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/scripts/generate_tts.py && echo \"py_compile_ok\" > output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/validate.txt\n```\n\nPass criteria: command exits 0 and `output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/validate.txt` is generated.\n\n## Output And Evidence\n\n- Save generated audio links, sample audio files, and request payloads to `output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/`.\n- Keep one va","body":"Category: provider\n\n# Model Studio Qwen TTS\n\n## Validation\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts\npython -m py_compile skills/ai/audio/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/scripts/generate_tts.py && echo \"py_compile_ok\" > output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/validate.txt\n```\n\nPass criteria: command exits 0 and `output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/validate.txt` is generated.\n\n## Output And Evidence\n\n- Save generated audio links, sample audio files, and request payloads to `output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/`.\n- Keep one validation log per execution.\n\n## Critical model names\n\nUse one of the recommended models:\n- `qwen3-tts-flash`\n- `qwen3-tts-instruct-flash`\n- `qwen3-tts-instruct-flash-2026-01-26`\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Install SDK (recommended in a venv to avoid PEP 668 limits):\n\n```bash\npython3 -m venv .venv\n. .venv/bin/activate\npython -m pip install dashscope\n```\n- Set `DASHSCOPE_API_KEY` in your environment, or add `dashscope_api_key` to `~/.alibabacloud/credentials` (env takes precedence).\n\n## Normalized interface (tts.generate)\n\n### Request\n- `text` (string, required)\n- `voice` (string, required)\n- `language_type` (string, optional; default `Auto`)\n- `instruction` (string, optional; recommended for instruct models)\n- `stream` (bool, optional; default false)\n\n### Response\n- `audio_url` (string, when stream=false)\n- `audio_base64_pcm` (string, when stream=true)\n- `sample_rate` (int, 24000)\n- `format` (string, wav or pcm depending on mode)\n\n## Quick start (Python + DashScope SDK)\n\n```python\nimport os\nimport dashscope\n\n# Prefer env var for auth: export DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=...\n# Or use ~/.alibabacloud/credentials with dashscope_api_key under [default].\n# Beijing region; for Singapore use: https://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/api/v1\ndashscope.base_http_api_url = \"https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/api/v1\"\n\ntext = \"Hello, this is a short voice line.\"\nresponse = dashscope.MultiModalConversation.call(\n    model=\"qwen3-tts-instruct-flash\",\n    api_key=os.getenv(\"DASHSCOPE_API_KEY\"),\n    text=text,\n    voice=\"Cherry\",\n    language_type=\"English\",\n    instruction=\"Warm and calm tone, slightly slower pace.\",\n    stream=False,\n)\n\naudio_url = response.output.audio.url\nprint(audio_url)\n```\n\n## Streaming notes\n\n- `stream=True` returns Base64-encoded PCM chunks at 24kHz.\n- Decode chunks and play or concatenate to a pcm buffer.\n- The response contains `finish_reason == \"stop\"` when the stream ends.\n\n## Operational guidance\n\n- Keep requests concise; split long text into multiple calls if you hit size or timeout errors.\n- Use `language_type` consistent with the text to improve pronunciation.\n- Use `instruction` only when you need explicit style/tone control.\n- Cache by `(text, voice, language_type)` to avoid repeat costs.\n\n## Output location\n\n- Default output: `output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/audio/`\n- Override base dir with `OUTPUT_DIR`.\n\n## References\n\n- `references/api_reference.md` for parameter mapping and streaming example.\n- Realtime mode is provided by `skills/ai/audio/alicloud-ai-audio-tts-realtime/`.\n- Voice cloning/design are provided by `skills/ai/audio/alicloud-ai-audio-tts-voice-clone/` and `skills/ai/audio/alicloud-ai-audio-tts-voice-design/`.\n\n- Source list: `references/sources.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:15:42.199Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents needing advanced text-to-speech capabilities, particularly those leveraging Alibaba Cloud services.","zh":"适用于需要高级文本转语音功能的AI代理，特别是那些使用阿里云服务的代理。","ja":"Alibaba Cloud サービスを利用する高度なテキスト対話音声機能を必要とする AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 텍스트 음성 변환 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 특히 阿里云 서비스를 사용하는 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de texto a voz, particularmente aquellos que utilizan servicios de Alibaba Cloud.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA nécessitant des capacités avancées de texte à parole, en particulier ceux qui utilisent des services Alibaba Cloud.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Text-to-Speech-Funktionen benötigen, insbesondere solche, die Dienste von Alibaba Cloud nutzen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de texto-para-fala, particularmente aqueles que utilizam os serviços da Alibaba Cloud.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуются продвинутые возможности текст-в-речь, особенно тех, кто использует услуги Alibaba Cloud.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الإي آي الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة من نص إلى كلام، ولا سيما أولئك الذين يستفيدون من خدمات Alibaba Cloud."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality audio files using Alibaba Cloud''s AI audio TTS, leveraging Python scripts and the py_compile module for seamless integration, while supporting various audio formats and request payloads.","zh":"使代理能够使用阿里云的AI音频TTS生成高质量的音频文件，利用Python脚本和py_compile模块实现无缝集成，同时支持各种音频格式和请求有效载荷。","ja":"Alibaba Cloud の AI オーディオ TTS を使用して、高品質のオーディオ ファイルを生成できるようにエージェントをEmpowerします。Python スクリプトと py_compile モジュールを使用してシームレスに統合し、様々なオーディオ形式やリクエストペイロードをサポートします。","ko":"阿里云의 AI 오디오 TTS를 사용하여 고품질의 오디오 파일을 생성할 수 있도록 에이전트를 Empower합니다. Python 스크립트와 py_compile 모듈을 사용하여 무縫 통합을 제공하며, 다양한 오디오 형식과 요청 페이로드를 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar archivos de audio de alta calidad utilizando el audio AI TTS de Alibaba Cloud, aprovechando scripts de Python y el módulo py_compile para una integración perfecta, mientras que admite varios formatos de audio y cargas de solicitud.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des fichiers audio de haute qualité en utilisant l''audio AI TTS d''Alibaba Cloud, en exploitant des scripts Python et le module py_compile pour une intégration transparente, tout en prenant en charge divers formats audio et charges de requête.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochwertige Audio-Dateien zu generieren, indem sie den AI-Audio-TTS von Alibaba Cloud verwenden, wobei Python-Skripte und das py_compile-Modul für eine nahtlose Integration genutzt werden, während verschiedene Audioformate und Anfrage-Payloads unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar arquivos de áudio de alta qualidade usando o áudio AI TTS da Alibaba Cloud, aproveitando scripts Python e o módulo py_compile para integração sem problemas, ao mesmo tempo em que suporta vários formatos de áudio e cargas de solicitação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать аудиофайлы высокого качества с помощью аудио ИИ TTS от Alibaba Cloud, используя скрипты Python и модуль py_compile для бесшовной интеграции, а также поддержку различных аудиоформатов и полезных нагрузок запросов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على生成 ملفات صوتية عالية الجودة باستخدام صوت الاصطناع الاِي آي تي تي اس من Alibaba Cloud، باستخدام سكريبتات بايثون ووحدة py_compile من أجل دمج بدون مشاكل، مع دعم مختلف صيغ الصوت واضافات الطلبات."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating audio links for e-learning platforms","Creating sample audio files for marketing campaigns","Validating TTS requests using Python scripts"],"zh":["为在线学习平台生成音频链接","为营销活动创建示例音频文件","使用Python脚本验证TTS请求"],"ja":["オンライン学習プラットフォーム向けのオーディオリンクの生成","マーケティングキャンペーン向けのサンプルオーディオファイルの作成","Pythonスクリプトを使用したTTSリクエストの検証"],"ko":["온라인 학습 플랫폼을 위한 오디오 링크 생성","마케팅 캠페인을 위한 샘플 오디오 파일 생성","Python 스크립트를 사용한 TTS 요청 검증"],"es":["Generar enlaces de audio para plataformas de aprendizaje electrónico","Crear archivos de audio de ejemplo para campañas de marketing","Validar solicitudes de TTS utilizando scripts de Python"],"fr":["Générer des liens audio pour les plateformes d''apprentissage électronique","Créer des fichiers audio d''exemple pour les campagnes de marketing","Valider les demandes de TTS en utilisant des scripts Python"],"de":["Generieren von Audio-Links für E-Learning-Plattformen","Erstellen von Beispiel-Audio-Dateien für Marketing-Kampagnen","Validieren von TTS-Anfragen unter Verwendung von Python-Skripten"],"pt":["Gerar links de áudio para plataformas de e-learning","Criar arquivos de áudio de amostra para campanhas de marketing","Validar solicitações TTS usando scripts Python"],"ru":["Генерировать ссылки на аудиофайлы для платформ электронного обучения","Создавать образцы аудиофайлов для маркетинговых кампаний","Проверять запросы TTS с помощью скриптов Python"],"ar":["_generating روابط الصوت لمنصات التعلم الإلكتروني","إنشاء ملفات صوتية نموذجية لحملات التسويق","التحقق من طلبات التTS باستخدام سكريبتات بايثون"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Alibaba Cloud credentials","Python 3.x compatibility needed","Dependent on py_compile module"],"zh":["需要阿里云凭证","需要Python 3.x兼容性","依赖于py_compile模块"],"ja":["Alibaba Cloud の資格情報が必要","Python 3.x との互換性が必要","py_compile モジュールに依存"],"ko":["阿里云 자격 증명이 필요합니다","Python 3.x와의 호환성이 필요합니다","py_compile 모듈에 의존"],"es":["Requiere credenciales de Alibaba Cloud","Se necesita compatibilidad con Python 3.x","Dependiente del módulo py_compile"],"fr":["Nécessite des informations d''identification Alibaba Cloud","Compatibilité Python 3.x requise","Dépendant du module py_compile"],"de":["Benötigt Alibaba Cloud-Anmeldedaten","Python 3.x-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Abhängig vom py_compile-Modul"],"pt":["Exige credenciais da Alibaba Cloud","Compatibilidade com Python 3.x necessária","Dependente do módulo py_compile"],"ru":["Требует учетных данных Alibaba Cloud","Необходима совместимость с Python 3.x","Зависит от модуля py_compile"],"ar":["يتطلب أوراق اعتماد Alibaba Cloud","مطلوبة توافقية بايثون 3.x","يعتمد على وحدة py_compile"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f3973222447d39c34e856fbd5dc6d2c1572ab6b14b56e0b359a4515b520e976b","qualityScore":52}');
