 para el juego Deadlock de Valve, diseñado para mejorar la experiencia de juego con herramientas de AI","fr":"opensrc est un gestionnaire de mods pour le jeu Deadlock de Valve, conçu pour améliorer l''expérience de jeu avec des outils d''IA","de":"opensrc ist ein Mod-Manager für das Spiel Deadlock von Valve, entwickelt um die Spiel-Erfahrung mit KI-Tools zu verbessern","pt":"opensrc é um gerenciador de mods para o jogo Deadlock da Valve. Ele permite que os jogadores gerenciem e instalem mods facilmente.","ru":"opensrc — менеджер модов для игры Deadlock от Valve. Он позволяет игрокам легко управлять и устанавливать моды.","ar":"opensrc هو مدير تعديلات لألعاب Deadlock من Valve. يسمح للاعبين بإدارة وتثبيت التعديلات بسهولة.","en":"A mod manager for the Valve game Deadlock."},"definition":{"en":"A mod manager for the Valve game Deadlock."},"features":{"zh":["opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI"],"ja":["opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI"],"ko":["opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI"],"es":["Gestión de mods para Deadlock","Herramientas de AI para mejorar la experiencia de juego","Instalación y configuración sencilla","Compatibilidad con diferentes versiones de Deadlock","Soporte para mods personalizados"],"fr":["Gestion de mods pour Deadlock","Outils d''IA pour améliorer l''expérience de jeu","Installation et configuration simples","Compatibilité avec différentes versions de Deadlock","Prise en charge de mods personnalisés"],"de":["Mod-Verwaltung für Deadlock","KI-Tools zur Verbesserung der Spiel-Erfahrung","Einfache Installation und Konfiguration","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Deadlock-Versionen","Unterstützung für benutzerdefinierte Mods"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de mods fácil","Instalação de mods simplificada","Compatibilidade com mods personalizados","Interface de usuário intuitiva","Suporte a mods de terceiros"],"ru":["Легкое управление модами","Упрощенная установка модов","Совместимость с пользовательскими модами","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс","Поддержка модов третьих лиц"],"ar":["إدارة تعديلات سهلة","تثبيت تعديلات مبسط","توافق مع التعديلات المخصصة","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام","دعم التعديلات من جهات خارجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI"],"ja":["opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI"],"ko":["opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI","opensrc - AI"],"es":["herramientas de AI","gestor de mods","Deadlock","cómo instalar opensrc","guias de configuración de opensrc","alternativas a opensrc","opensrc vs otros gestores de mods","instalación de opensrc","configuración de opensrc"],"fr":["outils d''IA","gestionnaire de mods","Deadlock","comment installer opensrc","guides de configuration d''opensrc","alternatives à opensrc","opensrc vs autres gestionnaires de mods","installation d''opensrc","configuration d''opensrc"],"de":["KI-Tools","Mod-Manager","Deadlock","wie man opensrc installiert","Konfigurationsanleitungen für opensrc","Alternativen zu opensrc","opensrc vs andere Mod-Manager","Installation von opensrc","Konfiguration von opensrc"],"pt":["como usar opensrc","o que é opensrc","opensrc vs mod manager","instalar opensrc","guias de configuração opensrc","alternativas para opensrc","opensrc para deadlock","ferramentas de ia para jogos"],"ru":["как использовать opensrc","что такое opensrc","opensrc vs менеджер модов","установить opensrc","руководства по настройке opensrc","альтернативы opensrc","opensrc для deadlock","инструменты ии для игр"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام opensrc","ما هو opensrc","opensrc مقابل مدير التعديلات","تثبيت opensrc","دليل إعداد opensrc","بديل ل opensrc","opensrc ل deadlock","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للألعاب"]}},"owner":"deadlock-mod-manager","repo":"deadlock-mod-manager","repoPath":"deadlock-mod-manager/deadlock-mod-manager","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.851Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"opensrc","description":"Fetch source code for npm, PyPI, or crates.io packages and GitHub/GitLab repos to provide AI agents with implementation context beyond types and docs. Use when needing to understand how a library works internally, debug dependency issues, or explore package implementations.","bodyPreview":"# opensrc\n\nCLI tool to fetch source code for packages/repos, giving AI coding agents deeper implementation context.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Need to understand how a library/package works internally (not just its interface)\n- Debugging issues where types alone are insufficient\n- Exploring implementation patterns in dependencies\n- Agent needs to reference actual source code of a package\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Install globally or use npx\nnpm install -g opensrc\n\n# Fetch npm package (auto-detects inst","body":"# opensrc\n\nCLI tool to fetch source code for packages/repos, giving AI coding agents deeper implementation context.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Need to understand how a library/package works internally (not just its interface)\n- Debugging issues where types alone are insufficient\n- Exploring implementation patterns in dependencies\n- Agent needs to reference actual source code of a package\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Install globally or use npx\nnpm install -g opensrc\n\n# Fetch npm package (auto-detects installed version from lockfile)\nnpx opensrc zod\n\n# Fetch from other registries\nnpx opensrc pypi:requests       # Python/PyPI\nnpx opensrc crates:serde        # Rust/crates.io\n\n# Fetch GitHub repo directly\nnpx opensrc vercel/ai           # owner/repo shorthand\nnpx opensrc github:owner/repo   # explicit prefix\nnpx opensrc https://github.com/colinhacks/zod  # full URL\n\n# Fetch specific version/ref\nnpx opensrc zod@3.22.0\nnpx opensrc owner/repo@v1.0.0\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n| Command                 | Description                     |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `opensrc <packages...>` | Fetch source for packages/repos |\n| `opensrc list`          | List all fetched sources        |\n| `opensrc remove <name>` | Remove specific source          |\n| `opensrc clean`         | Remove all sources              |\n\n## Output Structure\n\nAfter fetching, sources stored in `opensrc/` directory:\n\n```\nopensrc/\n├── settings.json           # User preferences\n├── sources.json            # Index of fetched packages/repos\n└── repos/\n    └── github.com/\n        └── owner/\n            └── repo/       # Cloned source code\n```\n\n## File Modifications\n\nOn first run, opensrc prompts to modify:\n\n- `.gitignore` - adds `opensrc/` to ignore list\n- `tsconfig.json` - excludes `opensrc/` from compilation\n- `AGENTS.md` - adds section pointing agents to source code\n\nUse `--modify` or `--modify=false` to skip prompt.\n\n## Key Behaviors\n\n1. **Version Detection** - For npm, auto-detects installed version from `node_modules`, `package-lock.json`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`, or `yarn.lock`\n2. **Repository Resolution** - Resolves package to its git repo via registry API, clones at matching tag\n3. **Monorepo Support** - Handles packages in monorepos via `repository.directory` field\n4. **Shallow Clone** - Uses `--depth 1` for efficient cloning, removes `.git` after clone\n5. **Tag Fallback** - Tries `v{version}`, `{version}`, then default branch if tag not found\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Fetching a Package\n\n```bash\n# Agent needs to understand zod''s implementation\nnpx opensrc zod\n# → Detects version from lockfile\n# → Finds repo URL from npm registry\n# → Clones at matching git tag\n# → Source available at opensrc/repos/github.com/colinhacks/zod/\n```\n\n### Updating Sources\n\n```bash\n# Re-run same command to update to currently installed version\nnpx opensrc zod\n# → Checks if version changed\n# → Re-clones if needed\n```\n\n### Multiple Sources\n\n```bash\n# Fetch multiple at once\nnpx opensrc react react-dom next\nnpx opensrc zod pypi:pydantic vercel/ai\n```\n\n## References\n\nFor detailed information:\n\n- [CLI Usage & Options](references/cli-usage.md) - Full command reference\n- [Architecture](references/architecture.md) - Code structure and extension\n- [Registry Support](references/registry-support.md) - npm, PyPI, crates.io details\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:50:24.405Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Coding Agents needing deeper implementation context of libraries and packages.","zh":"适合需要对库和包有更深入实现上下文的编码代理。","ja":"ライブラリやパッケージの実装に関するより深いコンテキストが必要なコーディングエージェントに適しています。","ko":"라이브러리 및 패키지에 대한 더 깊은 구현 컨텍스트가 필요한 코딩 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Codificación que necesitan un contexto de implementación más profundo de bibliotecas y paquetes.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Codage qui ont besoin d''un contexte d''implémentation plus approfondi de bibliothèques et de packages.","de":"Perfekt für Coding-Agenten, die einen tieferen Implementierungskontext von Bibliotheken und Paketen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Codificação que necessitam de um contexto de implementação mais profundo de bibliotecas e pacotes.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Кодирования, которым требуется более глубокий контекст реализации библиотек и пакетов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التشفير الذي يحتاج إلى سياق تنفيذ أعمق للمكتبات والحزم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch source code for packages and repositories, providing a deeper understanding of internal implementations, debugging capabilities, and exploration of implementation patterns using npm packages and CLI tools.","zh":"赋予代理获取包和仓库的源代码的能力，提供对内部实现、调试能力和使用npm包和CLI工具的实现模式的更深入的理解。","ja":"エージェントにパッケージやリポジトリのソースコードを取得する能力を与え、内部実装、デバッグ機能、およびnpmパッケージやCLIツールを使用した実装パターンの調査に関するより深い理解を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 패키지 및 저장소의 소스 코드를 가져오는 기능을 부여하여 내부 구현, 디버깅 기능 및 npm 패키지 및 CLI 도구를 사용한 구현 패턴에 대한 더 깊은 이해를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recuperar el código fuente de paquetes y repositorios, proporcionando una comprensión más profunda de las implementaciones internas, capacidades de depuración y exploración de patrones de implementación utilizando paquetes npm y herramientas CLI.","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer le code source des packages et des référentiels, fournissant une compréhension plus approfondie des implémentations internes, des capacités de débogage et de l''exploration des modèles d''implémentation en utilisant des packages npm et des outils CLI.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, den Quellcode für Pakete und Repositories abzurufen, und bietet so ein tieferes Verständnis von internen Implementierungen, Debugging-Funktionen und der Erkundung von Implementierungsmustern unter Verwendung von npm-Paketen und CLI-Tools.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar o código-fonte de pacotes e repositórios, fornecendo uma compreensão mais profunda das implementações internas, capacidades de depuração e exploração de padrões de implementação usando pacotes npm e ferramentas CLI.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью получать исходный код пакетов и репозиториев, обеспечивая более глубокое понимание внутренних реализаций, возможностей отладки и изучения шаблонов реализации с помощью пакетов npm и инструментов CLI.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استرجاع код المصدر للحزم والمستودعات، مما يوفر فهمًا أعمق للتنفيذات الداخلية وقدرات التصحيح واكتشاف أنماط التنفيذ باستخدام حزم npm وأدوات CLI."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging issues where types alone are insufficient","Exploring implementation patterns in dependencies","Fetching source code for npm packages"],"zh":["调试仅使用类型不足的问题","探索依赖项中的实现模式","获取npm包的源代码"],"ja":["タイプだけでは不十分な問題のデバッグ","依存関係内の実装パターンの探索","npmパッケージのソースコードの取得"],"ko":["유형만으로는 불충분한 문제의 디버깅","의존성 내의 구현 패턴 탐색","npm 패키지의 소스 코드 가져오기"],"es":["Depuración de problemas donde los tipos solos son insuficientes","Exploración de patrones de implementación en dependencias","Recuperación del código fuente para paquetes npm"],"fr":["Débogage de problèmes où les types seuls sont insuffisants","Exploration de modèles d''implémentation dans les dépendances","Récupération du code source pour les packages npm"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Problemen, bei denen Typen allein unzureichend sind","Erkundung von Implementierungsmustern in Abhängigkeiten","Abruf des Quellcodes für npm-Pakete"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas onde os tipos sozinhos são insuficientes","Exploração de padrões de implementação em dependências","Obtenção do código-fonte para pacotes npm"],"ru":["Отладка проблем, где типы alone являются недостаточными","Изучение шаблонов реализации в зависимостях","Получение исходного кода для пакетов npm"],"ar":["تصحيح المشكلات حيث النوع وحده غير كاف","استكشاف أنماط التنفيذ في الاعتماديات","استرجاع код المصدر للحزم npm"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm installation or npx usage","Limited to npm packages and repositories"],"zh":["需要npm安装或npx使用","仅限npm包和仓库"],"ja":["npmのインストールまたはnpxの使用が必要","npmパッケージやリポジトリに限定"],"ko":["npm 설치 또는 npx 사용이 필요","npm 패키지 및 저장소에 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de npm o el uso de npx","Limitado a paquetes y repositorios npm"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de npm ou l''utilisation de npx","Limité aux packages et référentiels npm"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von npm oder die Verwendung von npx","Eingeschränkt auf npm-Pakete und -Repositories"],"pt":["Requer instalação do npm ou uso do npx","Limitado a pacotes e repositórios npm"],"ru":["Требует установки npm или использования npx","Ограничен пакетами и репозиториями npm"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت npm أو استخدام npx","محدود بالحزم والمستودعات npm"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ceb02950c4a30434297d257c8bb9ab6bb3322ca9461b5020988fcb6b43dfbd65","qualityScore":52}');
