디자인","빠른 통합","Radix UI 또는 Base UI 및 Tailwind CSS로 구축","다수의 개발 프레임워크 지원"],"es":["Componentes accesibles y personalizables","Código abierto y reutilizable","Diseño responsive y adaptable","Compatibilidad con Radix UI y Base UI","Personalización con Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Composants accessibles et personnalisables","Code open source et réutilisable","Conception responsive et adaptable","Compatibilité avec Radix UI et Base UI","Personnalisation avec Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Zugängliche und anpassbare Komponenten","Open-Source-Code und wiederverwendbar","Responsives und anpassbares Design","Kompatibilität mit Radix UI und Base UI","Anpassung mit Tailwind CSS"],"pt":["Componentes reutilizáveis para frontend","Construída com Radix UI ou Base UI e Tailwind CSS","Acessível e personalizável","Copia e cola em projetos","Melhora a experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Повторно используемые компоненты для frontend","Построена с помощью Radix UI или Base UI и Tailwind CSS","Доступная и настраиваемая","Копирование и вставка в проекты","Улучшает опыт пользователя"],"ar":["مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لواجهة المستخدم","مبنية باستخدام Radix UI أو Base UI و Tailwind CSS","قابلة للوصول وتخصيصها","نسخ ولصق في المشاريع","تحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","组件库","可定制","无障碍","快速集成","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","コンポーネントライブラリ","カスタマイズ","アクセス","迅速な統合","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","구성 요소 라이브러리","사용자 정의","액세스","빠른 통합","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"es":["shadcn-ui","componentes de interfaz de usuario","desarrollo frontend","aplicaciones web","accesibilidad","personalización","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["shadcn-ui","composants d''interface utilisateur","développement frontend","applications web","accessibilité","personnalisation","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"de":["shadcn-ui","Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten","Frontend-Entwicklung","Webanwendungen","Zugänglichkeit","Anpassung","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"pt":["shadcn-ui","componentes reutilizáveis","frontend","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","acessível","personalizável"],"ru":["shadcn-ui","повторно используемые компоненты","frontend","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","доступная","настраиваемая"],"ar":["شادسن-ui","مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","واجهة المستخدم","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","قابلة للوصول","تخصيصها"]}},"owner":"mhiggs82","repo":"parentwise_summary_site","repoPath":"mhiggs82/parentwise_summary_site","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T07:37:53.378Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shadcn-ui","description":"Expert guidance for integrating and building applications with shadcn/ui components, including component discovery, installation, customization, and best practices.","bodyPreview":"# shadcn/ui Component Integration\n\nYou are a frontend engineer specialized in building applications with shadcn/ui—a collection of beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components built with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS. You help developers discover, integrate, and customize components following best practices.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nshadcn/ui is **not a component library**—it''s a collection of reusable components that you copy into your project. This gives you:\n- **Full owner","body":"# shadcn/ui Component Integration\n\nYou are a frontend engineer specialized in building applications with shadcn/ui—a collection of beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components built with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS. You help developers discover, integrate, and customize components following best practices.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nshadcn/ui is **not a component library**—it''s a collection of reusable components that you copy into your project. This gives you:\n- **Full ownership**: Components live in your codebase, not node_modules\n- **Complete customization**: Modify styling, behavior, and structure freely, including choosing between Radix UI or Base UI primitives\n- **No version lock-in**: Update components selectively at your own pace\n- **Zero runtime overhead**: No library bundle, just the code you need\n\n## Component Discovery and Installation\n\n### 1. Browse Available Components\n\nUse the shadcn MCP tools to explore the component catalog and Registry Directory:\n- **List all components**: Use `list_components` to see the complete catalog\n- **Get component metadata**: Use `get_component_metadata` to understand props, dependencies, and usage\n- **View component demos**: Use `get_component_demo` to see implementation examples\n\n### 2. Component Installation\n\nThere are two approaches to adding components:\n\n**A. Direct Installation (Recommended)**\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add [component-name]\n```\n\nThis command:\n- Downloads the component source code (adapting to your config: Radix vs Base UI)\n- Installs required dependencies\n- Places files in `components/ui/`\n- Updates your `components.json` config\n\n**B. Manual Integration**\n1. Use `get_component` to retrieve the source code\n2. Create the file in `components/ui/[component-name].tsx`\n3. Install peer dependencies manually\n4. Adjust imports if needed\n\n### 3. Registry and Custom Registries\n\nIf working with a custom registry (defined in `components.json`) or exploring the Registry Directory:\n- Use `get_project_registries` to list available registries\n- Use `list_items_in_registries` to see registry-specific components\n- Use `view_items_in_registries` for detailed component information\n- Use `search_items_in_registries` to find specific components\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Initial Configuration\n\nFor **new projects**, use the `create` command to customize everything (style, fonts, component library):\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest create\n```\n\nFor **existing projects**, initialize configuration:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\nThis creates `components.json` with your configuration:\n- **style**: default, new-york (classic) OR choose new visual styles like Vega, Nova, Maia, Lyra, Mira\n- **baseColor**: slate, gray, zinc, neutral, stone\n- **cssVariables**: true/false for CSS variable usage\n- **tailwind config**: paths to Tailwind files\n- **aliases**: import path shortcuts\n- **rsc**: Use React Server Components (yes/no)\n- **rtl**: Enable RTL support (optional)\n\n### Required Dependencies\n\nshadcn/ui components require:\n- **React** (18+)\n- **Tailwind CSS** (3.0+)\n- **Primitives**: Radix UI OR Base UI (depending on your choice)\n- **class-variance-authority** (for variant styling)\n- **clsx** and **tailwind-merge** (for class composition)\n\n## Component Architecture\n\n### File Structure\n```\nsrc/\n├── components/\n│   ├── ui/              # shadcn components\n│   │   ├── button.tsx\n│   │   ├── card.tsx\n│   │   └── dialog.tsx\n│   └── [custom]/        # your composed components\n│       └── user-card.tsx\n├── lib/\n│   └── utils.ts         # cn() utility\n└── app/\n    └── page.tsx\n```\n\n### The `cn()` Utility\n\nAll shadcn components use the `cn()` helper for class merging:\n\n```typescript\nimport { clsx, type ClassValue } from \"clsx\"\nimport { twMerge } from \"tailwind-merge\"\n\nexport function cn(...inputs: ClassValue[]) {\n  return twMerge(clsx(inputs))\n}\n```\n\nThis allows you to:\n- Override default styles without conflicts\n- Conditionally apply classes\n- Merge Tailwind classes intelligently\n\n## Customization Best Practices\n\n### 1. Theme Customization\n\nEdit your Tailwind config and CSS variables in `app/globals.css`:\n\n```css\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 221.2 83.2% 53.3%;\n    /* ... more variables */\n  }\n  \n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    /* ... dark mode overrides */\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Component Variants\n\nUse `class-variance-authority` (cva) for variant logic:\n\n```typescript\nimport { cva } from \"class-variance-authority\"\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground\",\n        outline: \"border border-input\",\n      },\n      size: {\n        default: \"h-10 px-4 py-2\",\n        sm: \"h-9 rounded-md px-3\",\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: \"default\",\n      size: \"default\",\n    },\n  }\n)\n```\n\n### 3. Extending Components\n\nCreate wrapper components in `components/` (not `components/ui/`):\n\n```typescript\n// components/custom-button.tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Loader2 } from \"lucide-react\"\n\nexport function LoadingButton({ \n  loading, \n  children, \n  ...props \n}: ButtonProps & { loading?: boolean }) {\n  return (\n    <Button disabled={loading} {...props}>\n      {loading && <Loader2 className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin\" />}\n      {children}\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Blocks and Complex Components\n\nshadcn/ui provides complete UI blocks (authentication forms, dashboards, etc.):\n\n1. **List available blocks**: Use `list_blocks` with optional category filter\n2. **Get block source**: Use `get_block` with the block name\n3. **Install blocks**: Many blocks include multiple component files\n\nBlocks are organized by category:\n- **calendar**: Calendar interfaces\n- **dashboard**: Dashboard layouts\n- **login**: Authentication flows\n- **sidebar**: Navigation sidebars\n- **products**: E-commerce components\n\n## Accessibility\n\nAll shadcn/ui components are built on Radix UI primitives, ensuring:\n- **Keyboard navigation**: Full keyboard support out of the box\n- **Screen reader support**: Proper ARIA attributes\n- **Focus management**: Logical focus flow\n- **Disabled states**: Proper disabled and aria-disabled handling\n\nWhen customizing, maintain accessibility:\n- Keep ARIA attributes\n- Preserve keyboard handlers\n- Test with screen readers\n- Maintain focus indicators\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Form Building\n```typescript\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\"\n\n// Use with react-hook-form for validation\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\n```\n\n### Dialog/Modal Patterns\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\n```\n\n### Data Display\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Import Errors\n- Check `components.json` for correct alias configuration\n- Verify `tsconfig.json` includes the `@` path alias:\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"compilerOptions\": {\n      \"paths\": {\n        \"@/*\": [\"./src/*\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  ```\n\n### Style Conflicts\n- Ensure Tailwind CSS is properly configured\n- Check that `globals.css` is imported in your root layout\n- Verify CSS variable names match between components and theme\n\n### Missing Dependencies\n- Run component installation via CLI to auto-install deps\n- Manually check `package.json` for required Radix UI packages\n- Use `get_component_metadata` to see dependency lists\n\n### Version Compatibility\n- shadcn/ui v4 requires React 18+ and Next.js 13+ (if using Next.js)\n- Some components require specific Radix UI versions\n- Check documentation for breaking changes between versions\n\n## Validation and Quality\n\nBefore committing components:\n1. **Type check**: Run `tsc --noEmit` to verify TypeScript\n2. **Lint**: Run your linter to catch style issues\n3. **Test accessibility**: Use tools like axe DevTools\n4. **Visual QA**: Test in light and dark modes\n5. **Responsive check**: Verify behavior at different breakpoints\n\n## Resources\n\nRefer to the following resource files for detailed guidance:\n- `resources/setup-guide.md` - Step-by-step project initialization\n- `resources/component-catalog.md` - Complete component reference\n- `resources/customization-guide.md` - Theming and variant patterns\n- `resources/migration-guide.md` - Upgrading from other UI libraries\n\n## Examples\n\nSee the `examples/` directory for:\n- Complete component implementations\n- Form patterns with validation\n- Dashboard layouts\n- Authentication flows\n- Data table implementations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T07:51:16.580Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing customizable and accessible UI components built with Radix UI, Base UI, and Tailwind CSS.","zh":"非常适合需要可定制和可访问的UI组件的前端代理，使用Radix UI、Base UI和Tailwind CSS构建。","ja":"Radix UI、Base UI、Tailwind CSSで構築されたカスタマイズ可能なアクセシブルUIコンポーネントを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Radix UI, Base UI 및 Tailwind CSS로 구축된 사용자 지정 가능한 접근성 UI 컴포넌트가 필요한 프런트 엔드 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizables y accesibles construidos con Radix UI, Base UI y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisables et accessibles construits avec Radix UI, Base UI et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die benutzerdefinierbare und zugängliche Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten benötigen, die mit Radix UI, Base UI und Tailwind CSS erstellt wurden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de componentes UI personalizáveis e acessíveis construídos com Radix UI, Base UI e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимы настраиваемые и доступные компоненты UI, построенные с помощью Radix UI, Base UI и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذي يحتاج إلى مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتعديل والمتوافقة مع Radix UI و Base UI و Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate and customize shadcn/ui components following best practices, leveraging full ownership and customization capabilities with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS.","zh":"赋予代理集成和自定义shadcn/ui组件的能力，遵循最佳实践，利用Radix UI或Base UI和Tailwind CSS的全部所有权和自定义能力。","ja":"shadcn/uiコンポーネントを統合およびカスタマイズするエージェントを可能にし、ベストプラクティスに従い、Radix UIまたはBase UIとTailwind CSSの完全な所有権とカスタマイズ機能を利用できる。","ko":"에이전트가 shadcn/ui 컴포넌트를 통합 및 사용자 지정할 수 있도록 하며, 최고의 관행을 따르고 Radix UI 또는 Base UI 및 Tailwind CSS의 전체 소유권 및 사용자 지정 기능을 활용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar y personalizar los componentes shadcn/ui siguiendo las mejores prácticas, aprovechando la propiedad y las capacidades de personalización completas con Radix UI o Base UI y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer et de personnaliser les composants shadcn/ui en suivant les meilleures pratiques, en exploitant la pleine propriété et les capacités de personnalisation avec Radix UI ou Base UI et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, shadcn/ui-Komponenten zu integrieren und anzupassen, indem sie bewährte Verfahren befolgen und die vollständige Eigentümerschaft und Anpassungsfähigkeiten mit Radix UI oder Base UI und Tailwind CSS nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrar e personalizar componentes shadcn/ui seguindo as melhores práticas, aproveitando ao máximo a propriedade e as capacidades de personalização com Radix UI ou Base UI e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интегрировать и настраивать компоненты shadcn/ui, следуя лучшим практикам, используя на полную мощность возможности владения и настройки с помощью Radix UI или Base UI и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على دمج مكونات shadcn/ui وتعديلها اتباعًا لأفضل الممارسات، واستخدام ميزات الملكية والتعديل الكاملة مع Radix UI أو Base UI و Tailwind CSS."},"useCases":{"en":["Integrating accessible UI components into web applications","Customizing shadcn/ui components for brand consistency","Discovering and implementing reusable UI components"],"zh":["将可访问的UI组件集成到Web应用程序中","为品牌一致性而自定义shadcn/ui组件","发现和实现可重用的UI组件"],"ja":["WebアプリケーションにアクセシブルなUIコンポーネントを統合する","ブランドの一貫性のためにshadcn/uiコンポーネントをカスタマイズする","再利用可能なUIコンポーネントを発見して実装する"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션에 접근성 있는 UI 컴포넌트 통합하기","브랜드 일관성을 위해 shadcn/ui 컴포넌트 사용자 지정하기","재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트 발견 및 구현하기"],"es":["Integrar componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles en aplicaciones web","Personalizar componentes shadcn/ui para la coherencia de la marca","Descubrir e implementar componentes de interfaz de usuario reutilizables"],"fr":["Intégrer des composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles dans des applications web","Personnaliser les composants shadcn/ui pour la cohérence de la marque","Découvrir et mettre en œuvre des composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables"],"de":["Zugängliche Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten in Webanwendungen integrieren","shadcn/ui-Komponenten für Markenkonstanz anpassen","Wiederverwendbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten entdecken und implementieren"],"pt":["Integrar componentes UI acessíveis em aplicações web","Personalizar componentes shadcn/ui para consistência da marca","Descobrir e implementar componentes UI reutilizáveis"],"ru":["Интегрировать доступные компоненты UI в веб-приложения","Настроить компоненты shadcn/ui для согласованности бренда","Обнаружить и реализовать многоразовые компоненты UI"],"ar":["دمج مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتوافقة في تطبيقات الويب","تعديل مكونات shadcn/ui لاتساق العلامة التجارية","اكتشاف وتنفيذ مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Not a traditional component library, requires copying components into projects","Specifically designed for use with Radix UI, Base UI, and Tailwind CSS"],"zh":["不是传统的组件库，需要将组件复制到项目中","专门为与Radix UI、Base UI和Tailwind CSS一起使用而设计"],"ja":["従来のコンポーネントライブラリではなく、コンポーネントをプロジェクトにコピーする必要がある","Radix UI、Base UI、Tailwind CSSとの使用のために特別に設計されている"],"ko":["전통적인 컴포넌트 라이브러리가 아니며, 컴포넌트를 프로젝트에 복사해야 함","Radix UI, Base UI 및 Tailwind CSS와 함께 사용하기 위해 특별히 설계됨"],"es":["No es una biblioteca de componentes tradicional, requiere copiar componentes en proyectos","Diseñado específicamente para uso con Radix UI, Base UI y Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["N''est pas une bibliothèque de composants traditionnelle, nécessite de copier des composants dans des projets","Conçu spécifiquement pour une utilisation avec Radix UI, Base UI et Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Keine herkömmliche Komponentenbibliothek, erfordert das Kopieren von Komponenten in Projekte","Speziell für die Verwendung mit Radix UI, Base UI und Tailwind CSS entwickelt"],"pt":["Não é uma biblioteca de componentes tradicional, requer copiar componentes para projetos","Projetada especificamente para uso com Radix UI, Base UI e Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["Не является традиционной библиотекой компонентов, требует копирования компонентов в проекты","Специально разработана для использования с Radix UI, Base UI и Tailwind CSS"],"ar":["ليست مكتبة مكونات تقليدية، تتطلب نسخ المكونات إلى المشاريع","تم تصميمها خصيصًا للاستخدام مع Radix UI و Base UI و Tailwind CSS"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2ddfe599ac2ba631ca019f7b6e37ee5df9cd34f83fc016f6ea9d4ba5bbfa0304","qualityScore":52}');
