s"],"de":["Cloud-Native-Plattform","Integrierte Sicherheit","Integriertes DevOps","Kubernetes-Unterstützung","Skalierbare Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["Plataforma cloud nativa baseada em Kubernetes","Abordagem opinada para DevOps e segurança","Integração com ferramentas de segurança","Suporte a ambientes de nuvem híbrida","Otimização de recursos e desempenho"],"ru":["Облачная платформа на основе Kubernetes","Опинионированный подход к DevOps и безопасности","Интеграция с инструментами безопасности","Поддержка гибридных облачных сред","Оптимизация ресурсов и производительности"],"ar":["منصة سحابية أصيلة مبنية على Kubernetes","نهج متقن لعمليات DevOps وأمن المعلومات","التكامل مع أدوات الأمن","دعم البيئات السحابية الهجينة","تحسين الموارد والأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["云原生平台","DevOps工具","Kubernetes教程","云安全解决方案","Spec安装指南","云计算平台","Spec vs 其他DevOps工具","如何使用Spec","Spec文档"],"ja":["クラウドネイティブプラットフォーム","DevOpsツール","Kubernetesチュートリアル","クラウドセキュリティソリューション","Specインストールガイド","クラウドコンピューティングプラットフォーム","Spec vs その他のDevOpsツール","Specの使い方","Specドキュメント"],"ko":["클라우드 네이티브 플랫폼","DevOps 도구","Kubernetes 튜토리얼","클라우드 보안 솔루션","Spec 설치 가이드","클라우드 컴퓨팅 플랫폼","Spec vs 다른 DevOps 도구","Spec 사용 방법","Spec 문서"],"es":["herramientas de agentes de ia","plataforma cloud nativa","seguridad en la nube","devops para aplicaciones","kubernetes para desarrolladores","cómo usar spec","alternativas a spec","spec vs plataforma x"],"fr":["outils d''agents ia","plateforme cloud native","sécurité dans le cloud","devops pour applications","kubernetes pour développeurs","comment utiliser spec","alternatives à spec","spec vs plateforme x"],"de":["ai-agenten-tools","cloud-native-plattform","sicherheit in der cloud","devops für anwendungen","kubernetes für entwickler","wie man spec verwendet","alternativen zu spec","spec vs plattform x"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","plataforma cloud nativa","devops","segurança","kubernetes","como usar spec","o que é spec","spec vs kubernetes","instalar spec","guia de configuração spec"],"ru":["ии агенты","облачная платформа","devops","безопасность","kubernetes","как использовать spec","что такое spec","spec vs kubernetes","установить spec","руководство по настройке spec"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","منصة سحابية","devops","أمن المعلومات","kubernetes","كيفية استخدام spec","ما هي spec","spec vs kubernetes","تثبيت spec","دليل إعداد spec"]}},"owner":"Smana","repo":"cloud-native-ref","repoPath":"Smana/cloud-native-ref","stars":89,"forks":15,"updatedAt":"2026-02-19T17:56:40Z","topics":["cloud","devops","kubernetes","security"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"spec","description":"Create a specification for non-trivial changes. Creates GitHub issue + spec file in a dedicated directory.","bodyPreview":"# Spec Skill\n\nCreate lightweight specifications for changes that benefit from upfront design.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/spec \"description\"\n/spec composition \"Add Valkey caching\"\n/spec infrastructure \"Add GPU node pool\"\n```\n\n**Types** (optional): `composition` | `infrastructure` | `security` | `platform`\n\nIf type is omitted, infer from description or ask.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- New Crossplane compositions\n- Major infrastructure changes (VPC, EKS, IAM)\n- Security changes (network policies, RBAC, PKI)\n- Multi-co","body":"# Spec Skill\n\nCreate lightweight specifications for changes that benefit from upfront design.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/spec \"description\"\n/spec composition \"Add Valkey caching\"\n/spec infrastructure \"Add GPU node pool\"\n```\n\n**Types** (optional): `composition` | `infrastructure` | `security` | `platform`\n\nIf type is omitted, infer from description or ask.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- New Crossplane compositions\n- Major infrastructure changes (VPC, EKS, IAM)\n- Security changes (network policies, RBAC, PKI)\n- Multi-component platform features\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\n- Version bumps, documentation-only, single-file bug fixes, minor config tweaks\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Generate Identifiers\n\n```bash\n# Next spec number (3 digits)\nMAX_NUM=$(find docs/specs -name \"spec.md\" -path \"*/[0-9]*\" 2>/dev/null | \\\n  sed ''s|.*/\\([0-9]*\\)-.*|\\1|'' | sort -rn | head -1)\nSPEC_NUM=$(printf \"%03d\" $((10#${MAX_NUM:-0} + 1)))\n\n# Slug from description (3-4 meaningful words, kebab-case)\n# Filter stop words, take meaningful words, join with hyphens\n```\n\n### 2. Create GitHub Issue\n\n```bash\nISSUE_URL=$(gh issue create \\\n  --title \"[SPEC] ${TITLE}\" \\\n  --label \"spec,spec:draft\" \\\n  --body \"## Summary\n${DESCRIPTION}\n\n## Spec Directory\n\\`docs/specs/${SPEC_NUM}-${SLUG}/\\`\n\n---\n_Lightweight spec. See spec file for details._\")\n\nISSUE_NUM=$(echo \"$ISSUE_URL\" | grep -oP ''issues/\\K\\d+$'')\n```\n\n**Labels used**:\n- `spec` - All specification issues\n- `spec:draft` - Initial state (add manually: `spec:implementing` when work starts, `spec:done` when archived)\n\n### 3. Create Spec Directory and File\n\n```bash\nSPEC_DIR=\"docs/specs/${SPEC_NUM}-${SLUG}\"\nmkdir -p \"$SPEC_DIR\"\n```\n\nCopy template from `docs/specs/templates/spec.md` and fill:\n- `SPEC-XXX` → `SPEC-${SPEC_NUM}`\n- `#XXX` → `#${ISSUE_NUM}`\n- `YYYY-MM-DD` → current date\n- `[Title]` → from description\n\n### 4. Link in Issue\n\n```bash\ngh issue comment ${ISSUE_NUM} --body \"Spec created: [\\`${SPEC_DIR}/spec.md\\`](${SPEC_DIR}/spec.md)\"\n```\n\n### 5. Output\n\n```\nSpec created:\n\n  Issue: https://github.com/Smana/cloud-native-ref/issues/XXX (label: spec:draft)\n  Spec:  docs/specs/XXX-slug/spec.md\n\nNext:\n  1. Fill in the spec (use /clarify for [NEEDS CLARIFICATION] sections)\n  2. Run /spec-status to see pipeline overview\n  3. When starting work: gh issue edit XXX --remove-label \"spec:draft\" --add-label \"spec:implementing\"\n  4. Implement the changes\n  5. Reference in PR: \"Implements #XXX\"\n  6. After merge: spec is auto-archived by GitHub Action\n```\n\n## Template Location\n\n`docs/specs/templates/spec.md` (~80 lines)\n\n## Clarifications\n\nUse `/clarify` to resolve `[NEEDS CLARIFICATION: ...]` markers with structured options, or discuss conversationally with Claude.\n\n## Integration\n\n- `/spec` creates spec + issue with `spec:draft` label (this skill)\n- `/spec-status` shows pipeline overview (Draft/Implementing/Done counts)\n- `/clarify` resolves [NEEDS CLARIFICATION] markers with structured options\n- `/create-pr` auto-detects specs and references issue\n- `/commit` for commits\n- GitHub Action auto-archives specs on PR merge\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:29:28.390Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Native Agents needing lightweight specification creation for infrastructure and composition changes.","zh":"非常适合需要为基础设施和构成变化创建轻量级规范的云原生代理。","ja":"クラウドネイティブエージェントがインフラストラクチャと構成の変更のための軽量の仕様を作成する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"인프라 및 구성 변경에 대한 경량 사양 생성이 필요한 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Nativos en la Nube que necesitan creación de especificaciones ligeras para cambios de infraestructura y composición.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Cloud Natifs nécessitant une création d''espécifications légère pour les modifications d''infrastructure et de composition.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud Native Agents, die eine leichtgewichtige Spezifikationserstellung für Infrastruktur- und Kompositionsänderungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Nativos em Nuvem que necessitam de criação de especificações leves para infraestrutura e alterações de composição.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, которым требуется создание легковесных спецификаций для инфраструктуры и изменений состава.","ar":"مثالي لعميل وكيل السحابي الذي يحتاج إلى إنشاء مواصفات خفيفة الوزن للبنية التحتية وتغييرات التركيب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive content analysis with types such as composition, infrastructure, security, and platform, utilizing Crossplane compositions and supporting protocols like VPC, EKS, and IAM.","zh":"赋予代理生成全面内容分析的能力，包括组合、基础设施、安全和平台等类型，利用Crossplane组合并支持VPC、EKS和IAM等协议。","ja":"Crossplaneの構成を利用し、VPC、EKS、IAMなどのプロトコルをサポートすることで、エージェントが構成、インフラストラクチャ、セキュリティ、プラットフォームなどのタイプを使用して包括的なコンテンツ分析を生成できるようにします。","ko":"Crossplane 구성 및 VPC, EKS, IAMなどの 프로토콜을 지원하여 에이전트가 구성, 인프라, 보안 및 플랫폼 등의 유형을 사용하여 포괄적인 내용 분석을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para generar un análisis de contenido integral con tipos como composición, infraestructura, seguridad y plataforma, utilizando composiciones de Crossplane y protocolos como VPC, EKS e IAM.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer une analyse de contenu complète avec des types tels que composition, infrastructure, sécurité et plate-forme, en utilisant des compositions Crossplane et en prenant en charge des protocoles tels que VPC, EKS et IAM.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse mit Typen wie Komposition, Infrastruktur, Sicherheit und Plattform zu generieren, indem Crossplane-Kompositionen und Protokolle wie VPC, EKS und IAM verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar análise de conteúdo abrangente com tipos como composição, infraestrutura, segurança e plataforma, utilizando composições do Crossplane e protocolos de suporte como VPC, EKS e IAM.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать всесторонний анализ содержимого с типами, такими как состав, инфраструктура, безопасность и платформа, используя составы Crossplane и поддерживаемые протоколы, такие как VPC, EKS и IAM.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء pouvoir لإنشاء تحليل محتوى شاملة مع أنواع مثل التركيب والبنية التحتية والأمان ومنصة، باستخدام تركيبات Crossplane والبروتوكولات المدعومة مثل VPC وEKS وIAM."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating specifications for new Crossplane compositions","Planning major infrastructure changes like adding GPU node pools","Designing security changes including network policies and RBAC"],"zh":["为新Crossplane组合创建规范","规划主要基础设施变化，例如添加GPU节点池","设计安全性变化，包括网络策略和RBAC"],"ja":["新しいCrossplane構成の仕様を作成する","GPUノードプールの追加などの主要なインフラストラクチャの変更を計画する","ネットワークポリシーとRBACを含むセキュリティの変更を設計する"],"ko":["새로운 Crossplane 구성의 사양 생성","GPU 노드 풀 추가와 같은 주요 인프라 변경 계획","네트워크 정책 및 RBAC를 포함한 보안 변경 설계"],"es":["Crear especificaciones para nuevas composiciones de Crossplane","Planificar cambios importantes en la infraestructura como agregar grupos de nodos GPU","Diseñar cambios de seguridad que incluyan políticas de red y RBAC"],"fr":["Créer des spécifications pour de nouvelles compositions Crossplane","Planifier des changements majeurs dans l''infrastructure tels que l''ajout de groupes de nœuds GPU","Concevoir des changements de sécurité incluant des politiques de réseau et RBAC"],"de":["Spezifikationen für neue Crossplane-Kompositionen erstellen","Wichtige Infrastrukturänderungen wie das Hinzufügen von GPU-Node-Pools planen","Sicherheitsänderungen entwerfen, einschließlich Netzwerkrichtlinien und RBAC"],"pt":["Criar especificações para novas composições do Crossplane","Planejar alterações de infraestrutura importantes, como adicionar pools de nós GPU","Projetar alterações de segurança, incluindo políticas de rede e RBAC"],"ru":["Создание спецификаций для новых составов Crossplane","Планирование значительных изменений инфраструктуры, таких как добавление пулов узлов GPU","Проектирование изменений безопасности, включая политики сети и RBAC"],"ar":["إنشاء مواصفات لتركيبات Crossplane الجديدة","تخطيط تغييرات البنية التحتية الرئيسية، مثل إضافة مجموعات من العقد GPU","تصميم التغييرات الأمنية، بما في ذلك سياسات الشبكة وRBAC"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires description or type to infer specification context","Limited to specific types such as composition, infrastructure, security, and platform"],"zh":["需要描述或类型来推断规范上下文","仅限于组合、基础设施、安全和平台等特定类型"],"ja":["仕様のコンテキストを推測するために説明またはタイプが必要","構成、インフラストラクチャ、セキュリティ、プラットフォームなどの特定のタイプに限定される"],"ko":["사양 문脈을 추론하기 위해 설명 또는 유형이 필요","구성, 인프라, 보안 및 플랫폼과 같은 특정 유형으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere descripción o tipo para inferir el contexto de la especificación","Limitado a tipos específicos como composición, infraestructura, seguridad y plataforma"],"fr":["Nécessite une description ou un type pour déduire le contexte de la spécification","Limité à des types spécifiques tels que composition, infrastructure, sécurité et plate-forme"],"de":["Benötigt Beschreibung oder Typ, um den Kontext der Spezifikation abzuleiten","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Typen wie Komposition, Infrastruktur, Sicherheit und Plattform"],"pt":["Exige descrição ou tipo para inferir contexto de especificação","Limitado a tipos específicos, como composição, infraestrutura, segurança e plataforma"],"ru":["Требует описания или типа для вывода контекста спецификации","Ограничен конкретными типами, такими как состав, инфраструктура, безопасность и платформа"],"ar":["يتطلب وصفًا أو نوعًا لاستنتاج سياق المواصفة","محدود بنوع معين، مثل التركيب والبنية التحتية والأمان ومنصة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f027afc083c4e4be8915da73a6f04a3ace31322ae7134ec4ad208a609fdc1102","qualityScore":51}');
