,"React と Node.js 統合"],"ko":["Spec-Driven Git Workflow","GitHub 통합","스프린트 관리","브라운 필드 마이그레이션 지원","CLI 지원","React와 Node.js 통합"],"es":["Integración con GitHub","Gestión de sprint","Soporte para migración de brownfield","Flujo de trabajo de Git integral","Compatibilidad con Claude Code"],"fr":["Intégration avec GitHub","Gestion de sprint","Support pour la migration de brownfield","Workflow Git complet","Compatibilité avec Claude Code"],"de":["Integration mit GitHub","Sprint-Management","Unterstützung für Brownfield-Migration","Umfassender Git-Workflow","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code"],"pt":["Integração GitHub","Gerenciamento de sprint","Suporte à migração de brownfield","Fluxo de trabalho Git automatizado","Melhoria da produtividade"],"ru":["Интеграция с GitHub","Управление спринтами","Поддержка миграции brownfield","Автоматизированный fluxo de trabalho Git","Повышение производительности"],"ar":["التكامل جيثب","سير عمل الاسبوع","دعم للهجرة من براون فيلد","تدفق العمل جيت آلي","تحسين الإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 doc-indexer","什么是 Spec-Driven Git Workflow","doc-indexer 替代品","doc-indexer 与 GitHub","doc-indexer 安装指南","doc-indexer 设置教程","AI 智能工具","开发工作流程"],"ja":["doc-indexer の使用方法","Spec-Driven Git Workflow とは","doc-indexer の代替","doc-indexer と GitHub","doc-indexer のインストールガイド","doc-indexer の設定チュートリアル","AI エージェント","開発ワークフロー"],"ko":["doc-indexer 사용 방법","Spec-Driven Git Workflow란","doc-indexer 대안","doc-indexer와 GitHub","doc-indexer 설치 가이드","doc-indexer 설정 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트","개발 워크플로우"],"es":["herramientas de IA para desarrollo","plugin de flujo de trabajo de Git","integración de GitHub","gestión de sprint","cómo usar doc-indexer","alternativas a doc-indexer","instalación de doc-indexer"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour le développement","plugin de workflow Git","intégration GitHub","gestion de sprint","comment utiliser doc-indexer","alternatives à doc-indexer","installation de doc-indexer"],"de":["KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","Git-Workflow-Plugin","GitHub-Integration","Sprint-Management","wie man doc-indexer verwendet","Alternativen zu doc-indexer","Installation von doc-indexer"],"pt":["como usar doc-indexer","o que é doc-indexer","ferramentas de IA para fluxo de trabalho Git","alternativas para doc-indexer","doc-indexer vs jenkins","instalar doc-indexer","guia de configuração do doc-indexer"],"ru":["как использовать doc-indexer","что такое doc-indexer","ИИ Агенты для Spec-Driven Git Workflow","альтернативы для doc-indexer","doc-indexer vs jenkins","установить doc-indexer","руководство по настройке doc-indexer"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام doc-indexer","ما هو doc-indexer","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتدفق العمل جيت","بديل ل doc-indexer","doc-indexer مقابل jenkins","تثبيت doc-indexer","دليل إعداد doc-indexer"]}},"owner":"bodangren","repo":"git-workflow","repoPath":"bodangren/git-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T13:13:22.761Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"doc-indexer","description":"Use this skill at the beginning of any session or when needing to understand available project documentation. Provides just-in-time context by scanning YAML frontmatter from all markdown files in the docs/ directory without loading full content.","bodyPreview":"# Document Indexer Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide just-in-time context about available project documentation without loading full file content into the context window. The doc-indexer scans all markdown files in the `docs/` directory, extracts their YAML frontmatter metadata, and returns a structured map of available documentation. This enables efficient discovery of specs, plans, retrospectives, and other documentation while minimizing token usage.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill in the following s","body":"# Document Indexer Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide just-in-time context about available project documentation without loading full file content into the context window. The doc-indexer scans all markdown files in the `docs/` directory, extracts their YAML frontmatter metadata, and returns a structured map of available documentation. This enables efficient discovery of specs, plans, retrospectives, and other documentation while minimizing token usage.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill in the following situations:\n\n- At the beginning of any work session to understand the current state of documentation\n- When starting work on a new issue to identify relevant specs and context\n- Before proposing changes to understand existing specifications\n- When planning a sprint to review available approved specs\n- Anytime you need an overview of project documentation without reading full files\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- The project must have a `docs/` directory\n- Documentation files should follow the convention of including YAML frontmatter\n- The `jq` tool is NOT required (script works without it)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Run the Documentation Scanner\n\nExecute the helper script to scan all markdown files in the docs/ directory:\n\n```bash\nbash scripts/scan-docs.sh\n```\n\nThis will output a human-readable summary showing each document''s frontmatter metadata.\n\nFor machine-readable JSON output (useful for programmatic processing):\n\n```bash\nbash scripts/scan-docs.sh -j\n```\n\n### Step 2: Review the Documentation Map\n\nThe scanner returns information about all markdown files found in `docs/`, including:\n\n- **File path**: Location of the documentation file\n- **Frontmatter metadata**: Key-value pairs from YAML frontmatter (title, status, type, etc.)\n- **Compliance warnings**: Files missing YAML frontmatter are flagged\n\n**Example human-readable output**:\n```\n---\nfile: docs/specs/001-synthesis-flow.md\ntitle: AgenticDev Methodology\nstatus: approved\ntype: spec\n---\nfile: docs/changes/my-feature/proposal.md\ntitle: My Feature Proposal\nstatus: in-review\ntype: proposal\n[WARNING] Non-compliant file (no frontmatter): docs/README.md\n```\n\n**Example JSON output**:\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"file\": \"docs/specs/001-synthesis-flow.md\",\n    \"compliant\": true,\n    \"frontmatter\": {\n      \"title\": \"AgenticDev Methodology\",\n      \"status\": \"approved\",\n      \"type\": \"spec\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"file\": \"docs/README.md\",\n    \"compliant\": false,\n    \"frontmatter\": null\n  }\n]\n```\n\n### Step 3: Use the Map to Identify Relevant Documentation\n\nBased on the documentation map, identify which specific files to read for your current task:\n\n- **For implementation work**: Look for approved specs related to your issue\n- **For spec proposals**: Review existing specs to understand the current state\n- **For sprint planning**: Identify approved specs ready for implementation\n- **For learning context**: Find retrospectives and design docs\n\n### Step 4: Read Specific Documentation Files\n\nOnce you''ve identified relevant files from the map, use the Read tool to load their full content:\n\n```bash\n# Example: Read a specific spec identified from the map\nRead docs/specs/001-synthesis-flow.md\n```\n\nThis two-step approach (scan first, then read selectively) minimizes token usage while ensuring you have access to all necessary context.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### No docs/ Directory\n\n**Symptom**: Script reports \"No such file or directory\"\n\n**Solution**:\n- Verify you''re in the project root directory\n- Check if the project has been initialized with `project-init` skill\n- Create `docs/` directory structure if needed\n\n### Files Missing Frontmatter\n\n**Symptom**: Script outputs \"[WARNING] Non-compliant file (no frontmatter): ...\"\n\n**Impact**: These files won''t have structured metadata in the output\n\n**Solution**:\n- Add YAML frontmatter to documentation files for better discoverability\n- Frontmatter should be at the top of the file between `---` markers\n- Example format:\n  ```markdown\n  ---\n  title: My Document\n  status: draft\n  type: design\n  ---\n\n  # Document content starts here\n  ```\n\n### Script Permission Errors\n\n**Symptom**: \"Permission denied\" when running the script\n\n**Solution**:\n```bash\nchmod +x scripts/scan-docs.sh\n```\n\n## Output Interpretation Guide\n\n### Frontmatter Fields\n\nCommon frontmatter fields you''ll encounter:\n\n- **title**: Human-readable document title\n- **status**: Document state (draft, in-review, approved, archived)\n- **type**: Document category (spec, proposal, design, retrospective, plan)\n- **epic**: Associated epic issue number\n- **sprint**: Sprint identifier\n- **author**: Document author\n- **created**: Creation date\n- **updated**: Last update date\n\n### Using JSON Output Programmatically\n\nThe JSON output mode is particularly useful when:\n\n- Filtering documents by specific criteria (e.g., only approved specs)\n- Counting documents by type or status\n- Building automated workflows\n- Integrating with other tools\n\nExample using `jq` to filter approved specs:\n```bash\nbash scripts/scan-docs.sh -j | jq ''.[] | select(.frontmatter.status == \"approved\")''\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- The scanner is non-invasive and read-only - it never modifies files\n- Large projects with many docs benefit most from this just-in-time approach\n- The script scans recursively through all subdirectories in `docs/`\n- Empty frontmatter sections are treated as non-compliant\n- The scan is fast and can be run frequently without performance concerns\n- Consider running this at the start of each work session to stay current with documentation changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T15:15:25.892Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code needing efficient project documentation discovery and metadata extraction from markdown files","zh":"适合需要高效项目文档发现和元数据提取的AI代理，如Claude Code，特别是从markdown文件中提取元数据","ja":"Claude Codeのような、プロジェクトのドキュメントの効率的な発見とメタデータの抽出が必要なAIエージェントに最適","ko":"클라우드 코드와 같은 효율적인 프로젝트 문서 발견 및 메타데이터 추출이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 특히 마크다운 파일에서 메타데이터를 추출하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code que necesitan una descubierta y extracción de metadatos de documentación de proyectos eficientes desde archivos markdown","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code nécessitant une découverte et une extraction de métadonnées de documentation de projet efficaces à partir de fichiers markdown","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, die eine effiziente Entdeckung und Metadatenextraktion von Projektdokumentationen aus Markdown-Dateien benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code que necessitam de descoberta eficiente de documentação de projeto e extração de metadados de arquivos markdown","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, требующих эффективного обнаружения документации проекта и извлечения метаданных из файлов markdown","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى اكتشاف كفء للوثائق الخاصة بالمشروع واستخراج البيانات الوصفية من ملفات markdown"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to scan and index markdown files in the `docs/` directory, extracting YAML frontmatter metadata and returning a structured map of available documentation, minimizing token usage and enhancing just-in-time context provision with GitHub integration and sprint management","zh":"赋予代理扫描和索引`docs/`目录中的markdown文件，提取YAML前置元数据，并返回可用文档的结构化映射，最大限度地减少令牌使用并增强与GitHub集成和冲刺管理的即时上下文提供","ja":"エージェントが`docs/`ディレクトリ内のMarkdownファイルをスキャンしてインデックス化し、YAMLフロントマターのメタデータを抽出し、使用可能なドキュメントの構造化マップを返すことで、トークンの使用を最小限に抑え、GitHubとの統合とスプリント管理で提供されるコンテキストを最適化する","ko":"에이전트가 `docs/` 디렉토리의 마크다운 파일을 스캔하고 인덱싱하여 YAML 전면 메타데이터를 추출하고 사용 가능한 문서의 구조화된 맵을 반환하여 토큰 사용을 최소화하고 GitHub 통합 및 스프린트 관리와 함께 즉시 제공하는 컨텍스트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escanear e indexar archivos markdown en el directorio `docs/`, extrayendo metadatos de YAML frontmatter y devolviendo un mapa estructurado de documentación disponible, minimizando el uso de tokens y mejorando la provisión de contexto en tiempo real con integración de GitHub y gestión de sprint","fr":"Permet aux agents de scanner et d''indexer des fichiers markdown dans le répertoire `docs/`, en extrayant des métadonnées YAML frontmatter et en renvoyant une carte structurée de documentation disponible, en minimisant l''utilisation de jetons et en améliorant la fourniture de contexte en temps réel avec l''intégration GitHub et la gestion de sprint","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Markdown-Dateien im Verzeichnis `docs/` zu scannen und zu indizieren, YAML-Frontmatter-Metadaten zu extrahieren und eine strukturierte Karte der verfügbaren Dokumentation zurückzugeben, wodurch der Tokenverbrauch minimiert und die Bereitstellung von Kontext in Echtzeit mit GitHub-Integration und Sprint-Management verbessert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a varrer e indexar arquivos markdown no diretório `docs/`, extrair metadados YAML frontmatter e retornar um mapa estruturado da documentação disponível, minimizando o uso de tokens e aprimorando a provisão de contexto em tempo real com integração GitHub e gerenciamento de sprint","ru":"Позволяет агентам сканировать и индексировать файлы markdown в директории `docs/`, извлекать метаданные YAML frontmatter и возвращать структурированную карту доступной документации, минимизируя использование токенов и улучшая предоставление контекста в режиме реального времени с интеграцией GitHub и управлением спринтами","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من مسح ملفات markdown في الدليل `docs/` واستخراج بيانات YAML frontmatter وإرجاع خريطة موجهة للوثائق المتاحة، وتقليل استخدام الرموز وتحسين توفير السياق في الوقت الفعلي مع دمج GitHub وإدارة سبورت"},"useCases":{"en":["Indexing project documentation for efficient discovery","Extracting YAML frontmatter metadata from markdown files","Enhancing spec-driven Git workflow with comprehensive development workflow and brownfield migration support"],"zh":["为高效发现而索引项目文档","从markdown文件中提取YAML前置元数据","增强规格驱动的Git工作流程，支持全面开发工作流程和棕地迁移"],"ja":["効率的な発見のためにプロジェクトのドキュメントをインデックス化する","MarkdownファイルからYAMLフロントマターのメタデータを抽出する","仕様駆動のGitワークフローを強化し、包括的な開発ワークフローとブラウニーフィールド移行をサポートする"],"ko":["효율적인 발견을 위해 프로젝트 문서를 인덱싱합니다.","마크다운 파일에서 YAML 전면 메타데이터를 추출합니다.","규격 주도 Git 워크플로우를 강화하고 포괄적인 개발 워크플로우와 브라운 필드 마이그레이션을 지원합니다."],"es":["Indexación de documentación de proyectos para una descubierta eficiente","Extracción de metadatos de YAML frontmatter desde archivos markdown","Mejora del flujo de trabajo de Git basado en especificaciones con soporte de flujo de trabajo de desarrollo integral y migración brownfield"],"fr":["Indexation de la documentation de projet pour une découverte efficace","Extraction de métadonnées YAML frontmatter à partir de fichiers markdown","Amélioration du flux de travail Git basé sur des spécifications avec un support de flux de travail de développement complet et une migration brownfield"],"de":["Indexierung von Projektdokumentationen für eine effiziente Entdeckung","Extraktion von YAML-Frontmatter-Metadaten aus Markdown-Dateien","Verbesserung des Git-Workflows basierend auf Spezifikationen mit umfassender Entwicklung-Workflow-Unterstützung und Brownfield-Migrationsunterstützung"],"pt":["Indexação de documentação de projeto para descoberta eficiente","Extração de metadados YAML frontmatter de arquivos markdown","Aprimoramento do fluxo de trabalho Git baseado em especificações com suporte abrangente ao fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento e migração brownfield"],"ru":["Индексация документации проекта для эффективного обнаружения","Извлечение метаданных YAML frontmatter из файлов markdown","Улучшение спецификации Git с полной поддержкой рабочего процесса разработки и миграции brownfield"],"ar":["فهرسة وثائق المشروع للكشف الفعال","استخراج بيانات YAML frontmatter من ملفات markdown","تحسين تدفق العمل Git القائم على المواصفات مع دعم شامل لسير عمل التطوير والهجرة brownfield"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the `docs/` directory","Limited to markdown files with YAML frontmatter metadata","Optimized for use with Claude Code and GitHub integration"],"zh":["需要访问`docs/`目录","仅限于带有YAML前置元数据的markdown文件","针对Claude Code和GitHub集成进行优化"],"ja":["`docs/`ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","YAMLフロントマターのメタデータを持つMarkdownファイルのみ","Claude CodeとGitHubの統合に対して最適化"],"ko":["`docs/` 디렉토리에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","YAML 전면 메타데이터가 있는 마크다운 파일만 해당됩니다.","클라우드 코드 및 깃허브 통합을 위해 최적화되었습니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio `docs/`","Limitado a archivos markdown con metadatos de YAML frontmatter","Optimizado para uso con Claude Code y integración de GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire `docs/`","Limité aux fichiers markdown avec des métadonnées YAML frontmatter","Optimisé pour une utilisation avec Claude Code et l''intégration GitHub"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis `docs/`","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Dateien mit YAML-Frontmatter-Metadaten","Optimiert für die Verwendung mit Claude Code und GitHub-Integration"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório `docs/`","Limitado a arquivos markdown com metadados YAML frontmatter","Otimizado para uso com Claude Code e integração GitHub"],"ru":["Требует доступа к директории `docs/`","Ограничен файлами markdown с метаданными YAML frontmatter","Оптимизирован для использования с Claude Code и интеграцией GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `docs/`","محدود بملفات markdown التي تحتوي على بيانات YAML frontmatter","مُحسّن للاستخدام مع Claude Code ودمج GitHub"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c644f16429f24e3e1e180220fd4eb9fa0703c69d4884b344185d342bb923b753","qualityScore":51}');
