umentação"],"ru":["Предустановленный для Java 21/Spring Boot WebFlux","Интеграция с Angular, Flutter и PostgreSQL","Поддержка Firebase","Набор для интеграции команды с Claude Code AI","Записи архитектурных решений для документации"],"ar":["مسبقًا لتكوين جافا 21/سبرينج بوت ويب فلکس","التكامل مع أنجولار، فلاتر وبوستجري إس كيو إل","دعم فايربيس","حزمة دمج الفريق مع مساعد الترميز Claude Code AI","سجلات قرارات الهندسة المعمارية للتدوين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","架构决策记录","Java 21/Spring Boot WebFlux","Angular","Flutter","PostgreSQL","Firebase","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理安装","AI智能代理设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","アーキテクチャ決定レコード","Java 21/Spring Boot WebFlux","Angular","Flutter","PostgreSQL","Firebase","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","아키텍처 결정 기록","Java 21/Spring Boot WebFlux","Angular","Flutter","PostgreSQL","Firebase","AI 에이전트 사용 방법","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar registros de decisiones de arquitectura","qué es un agente de IA","registros de decisiones de arquitectura para Java","alternativas a Claude Code AI"," Claude Code AI vs otros asistentes de codificación","instalación de registros de decisiones de arquitectura","guía de configuración de Claude Code AI"],"fr":["comment utiliser les enregistrements de décisions d''architecture","qu''est-ce qu''un outil d''IA","enregistrements de décisions d''architecture pour Java","alternatives à Claude Code AI","Claude Code AI vs autres assistants de codage","installation des enregistrements de décisions d''architecture","guide de configuration de Claude Code AI"],"de":["wie man Architekturentscheidungssätze verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Architekturentscheidungssätze für Java","Alternativen zu Claude Code AI","Claude Code AI vs andere Coding-Assistenten","Installation von Architekturentscheidungssätzen","Konfigurationsanleitung für Claude Code AI"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","registrar decisões de arquitetura","java 21","spring boot webflux","angular","flutter","postgreSQL","firebase","claude code ai","kit de integração de equipe"],"ru":["ии агенты","записи архитектурных решений","java 21","spring boot webflux","angular","flutter","postgresql","firebase","claude code ai","набор для интеграции команды"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","سجلات قرارات الهندسة المعمارية","جافا 21","سبرينج بوت ويب فلکس","أنجولار","فلاتر","بوستجري إس كيو إل","فايربيس","claude code ai","حزمة دمج الفريق"]}},"owner":"kumaran-is","repo":"claude-code-onboarding","repoPath":"kumaran-is/claude-code-onboarding","stars":3,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T15:29:22Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"architecture-decision-records","description":"This skill should be used when documenting significant technical decisions, reviewing past architectural choices, or establishing decision processes. It provides ADR templates and best practices.","bodyPreview":"# Architecture Decision Records\n\nCapture the context and rationale behind significant technical decisions using structured ADR formats.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n| Write ADR                  | Skip ADR               |\n| -------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| New framework adoption     | Minor version upgrades |\n| Database technology choice | Bug fixes              |\n| API design patterns        | Implementation details |\n| Security architecture      | Routine maintenance    |","body":"# Architecture Decision Records\n\nCapture the context and rationale behind significant technical decisions using structured ADR formats.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n| Write ADR                  | Skip ADR               |\n| -------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| New framework adoption     | Minor version upgrades |\n| Database technology choice | Bug fixes              |\n| API design patterns        | Implementation details |\n| Security architecture      | Routine maintenance    |\n| Integration patterns       | Configuration changes  |\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Copy the template: `cp docs/adr/template.md docs/adr/NNNN-your-title.md`\n2. Fill in: Context, Decision Drivers, Options, Decision, Consequences\n3. PR for review (2+ senior engineers)\n4. Update `docs/adr/README.md` index after merge\n\n## Core Concepts\n\nAn Architecture Decision Record captures:\n\n- **Context**: Why we needed to make a decision\n- **Decision**: What we decided\n- **Consequences**: What happens as a result\n\n### ADR Lifecycle\n\n```\nProposed --> Accepted --> Deprecated --> Superseded\n                |\n             Rejected\n```\n\nRead `reference/adr-lifecycle.md` for status transitions, deprecation patterns, and review checklists.\n\n## Process\n\n### 1. Choose a Template\n\nPick the format that fits the decision''s complexity:\n\n| Decision Complexity | Template |\n|---------------------|----------|\n| Simple tech selection | Y-Statement (one paragraph) |\n| Medium decision | Lightweight ADR (0.5-1 page) |\n| Significant architecture change | Standard MADR (1-2 pages) |\n| Retiring a decision | Deprecation ADR |\n| Major cross-team proposal | RFC Style (2-4 pages) |\n\nRead `reference/adr-templates.md` for all template formats ready to copy-paste.\n\n### 2. Write the ADR\n\n- Start with context -- explain the problem before the solution\n- List 2-3 real alternatives with honest pros/cons\n- State the decision clearly\n- Document both positive and negative consequences with specifics\n\n### 3. Review and Approve\n\n- Submit as PR with 2+ senior engineer reviewers\n- Consult affected teams\n- Assess security, cost, and reversibility implications\n\n### 4. Maintain\n\n- Update ADR index after acceptance\n- Create implementation tickets\n- Never edit accepted ADRs -- write new ones to supersede\n\nRead `reference/adr-examples.md` for complete worked examples (PostgreSQL selection, TypeScript adoption, MongoDB deprecation, event sourcing RFC).\n\n## Minimal Template (Copy-Paste Starter)\n\n```markdown\n# ADR-NNNN: [Title]\n\n## Status\nProposed | Accepted | Deprecated | Superseded by ADR-XXXX\n\n## Context\n[Why do we need to decide this? What''s the problem?]\n\n## Decision\nWe will [decision].\n\n## Consequences\n- **Good**: [benefits]\n- **Bad**: [drawbacks]\n- **Mitigations**: [how we''ll address the bad]\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| Writing ADR after implementation | Write during design phase |\n| Listing only one option | Always include 2-3 real alternatives |\n| Vague consequences | Be specific: \"Adds ~200ms latency to checkout\" |\n| Editing accepted ADRs | Write new ADR that supersedes |\n| No decision drivers | List explicit criteria with priorities |\n| Missing rejected ADRs | Document rejected options too |\n\n## Directory Structure\n\n```\ndocs/adr/\n  README.md           # Index of all ADRs\n  template.md         # Team''s ADR template\n  0001-use-postgresql.md\n  0002-caching-strategy.md\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\n| File | Contents |\n|------|----------|\n| `reference/adr-templates.md` | All formats: MADR, lightweight, Y-statement, deprecation, RFC |\n| `reference/adr-examples.md` | Complete worked examples for each format |\n| `reference/adr-lifecycle.md` | Status transitions, review checklists, automation with adr-tools |\n\n## Resources\n\n- [MADR Template](https://adr.github.io/madr/)\n- [ADR GitHub Organization](https://adr.github.io/)\n- [adr-tools](https://github.com/npryce/adr-tools)\n\n## Error Handling\n\n**Conflicting ADRs**: When a new decision contradicts an existing ADR, create a superseding ADR that explicitly references and deprecates the old one.\n\n**Missing context**: If the decision rationale is unclear or incomplete, flag it and request clarification before recording.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:39:39.114Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Technical Agents needing structured decision-making capabilities for framework adoption, database technology choice, and security architecture.","zh":"适合需要结构化决策能力的技术代理，用于框架采用、数据库技术选择和安全架构。","ja":"技術エージェントがフレームワークの採用、データベース技術の選択、セキュリティアーキテクチャに対して構造化された意思決定能力を必要とする場合に最適。","ko":"기술 에이전트가 프레임워크 채택, 데이터베이스 기술 선택, 보안 아키텍처를 위해 구조화된 의사 결정 능력이 필요한 경우에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Técnicos que necesitan capacidades de toma de decisiones estructuradas para la adopción de frameworks, la elección de tecnología de bases de datos y la arquitectura de seguridad.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents techniques ayant besoin de capacités de prise de décision structurées pour l''adoption de frameworks, le choix de la technologie de base de données et l''architecture de sécurité.","de":"Ideal für technische Agenten, die strukturierte Entscheidungskapazitäten für die Adoption von Frameworks, die Wahl der Datenbanktechnologie und die Sicherheitsarchitektur benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Técnicos que necessitam de capacidades de tomada de decisões estruturadas para adoção de framework, escolha de tecnologia de banco de dados e arquitetura de segurança.","ru":"Идеально для технических агентов, которым необходимы структурированные возможности принятия решений для внедрения фреймворка, выбора технологии базы данных и архитектуры безопасности.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تقني يحتاج إلى قدرات اتخاذ قرارات منظمات للتبني الإطار ، واختيار تقنية قاعدة البيانات وهندسة الأمن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture context and rationale behind significant technical decisions using structured ADR formats, facilitating informed decisions on API design patterns, new framework adoption, and database technology choice, all while ensuring adherence to security architecture best practices.","zh":"赋予代理捕获重要技术决策背后的上下文和理由的能力，使用结构化的ADR格式，促进对API设计模式、新的框架采用和数据库技术选择的明智决策，同时确保遵守安全架构的最佳实践。","ja":"エージェントが重要な技術上の意思決定の背後にあるコンテキストと理由を把握する能力を提供し、構造化されたADR形式を使用して、APIデザインパターン、新しいフレームワークの採用、データベース技術の選択に関する情報に基づいた意思決定を促進し、セキュリティアーキテクチャのベストプラクティスへの遵守を確保する。","ko":"에이전트가 중요한 기술적 의사 결정의 背後にある 컨텍스트와 이유를 포착하는 능력을 제공하며, 구조화된 ADR 포맷을 사용하여 API 디자인 패턴, 새로운 프레임워크 채택, 데이터베이스 기술 선택에 대한 정보에 기반한 의사 결정을 촉진하며, 보안 아키텍처의 베스트 프랙티스에 대한 준수를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a capturar el contexto y la justificación detrás de las decisiones técnicas significativas utilizando formatos de ADR estructurados, facilitando la toma de decisiones informadas sobre patrones de diseño de API, la adopción de nuevos frameworks y la elección de tecnología de bases de datos, todo ello garantizando el cumplimiento de las mejores prácticas de arquitectura de seguridad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de capturer le contexte et la justification derrière les décisions techniques importantes en utilisant des formats ADR structurés, facilitant ainsi la prise de décisions éclairées sur les modèles de conception d''API, l''adoption de nouveaux frameworks et le choix de la technologie de base de données, tout en garantissant le respect des meilleures pratiques d''architecture de sécurité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, den Kontext und die Begründung hinter wichtigen technischen Entscheidungen mithilfe strukturierter ADR-Formate zu erfassen, wodurch fundierte Entscheidungen über API-Designmuster, die Adoption neuer Frameworks und die Wahl der Datenbanktechnologie erleichtert werden, während gleichzeitig die Einhaltung der Sicherheitsarchitektur-Best Practices gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a capturar o contexto e a justificativa por trás das decisões técnicas significativas usando formatos ADR estruturados, facilitando decisões informadas sobre padrões de design de API, adoção de novos frameworks e escolha de tecnologia de banco de dados, garantindo ao mesmo tempo a adesão às melhores práticas de arquitetura de segurança.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью захватывать контекст и обоснование значимых технических решений с помощью структурированных форматов ADR, облегчая принятие обоснованных решений по шаблонам проектирования API, внедрению новых фреймворков и выбору технологии базы данных, обеспечивая при этом соблюдение лучших практик архитектуры безопасности.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على التقاط السياق والأساس المنطقي وراء القرارات التقنية الهامة باستخدام تنسيقات ADR المنظمة ، وتسهيل القرارات المطلع عليها حول أنماط تصميم API واعتماد الإطارات الجديدة واختيار تقنية قاعدة البيانات ، مع ضمان الالتزام بأفضل الممارسات لمعمارية الأمن في الوقت نفسه."},"useCases":{"en":["Documenting database technology choices","Recording API design pattern decisions","Creating security architecture blueprints","Tracking framework adoption rationales"],"zh":["记录数据库技术选择","记录API设计模式的决定","创建安全架构蓝图","跟踪框架采用理由"],"ja":["データベース技術の選択を文書化する","APIデザインパターンの決定を記録する","セキュリティアーキテクチャのブループリントを作成する","フレームワークの採用理由を追跡する"],"ko":["데이터베이스 기술 선택을 문서화하는 것","API 디자인 패턴 결정 기록","보안 아키텍처 블루프린트 생성","프레임워크 채택 이유 추적"],"es":["Documentar las elecciones de tecnología de bases de datos","Grabar las decisiones de patrones de diseño de API","Crear planos de arquitectura de seguridad","Rastrear las razones de la adopción de frameworks"],"fr":["Documenter les choix de technologie de base de données","Enregistrer les décisions de modèles de conception d''API","Créer des plans d''architecture de sécurité","Traiter les raisons de l''adoption de frameworks"],"de":["Dokumentation der Datenbanktechnologie-Auswahlen","Aufzeichnung der API-Designmuster-Entscheidungen","Erstellung von Sicherheitsarchitektur-Plänen","Nachverfolgung der Gründe für die Adoption von Frameworks"],"pt":["Documentação de escolhas de tecnologia de banco de dados","Gravação de decisões de padrões de design de API","Criação de plantas de arquitetura de segurança","Rastreamento de razões para adoção de frameworks"],"ru":["Документирование выбора технологии базы данных","Запись решений по шаблонам проектирования API","Создание схем архитектуры безопасности","Отслеживание обоснований для внедрения фреймворков"],"ar":["توثيق اختيارات تقنية قاعدة البيانات","تسجيل قرارات أنماط تصميم API","إنشاء مخططات هندسة الأمن","تتبع причины لاعتماد الإطارات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires significant technical decision-making context","Most useful for major version upgrades or new technology adoptions, less so for minor version upgrades or bug fixes"],"zh":["需要大量的技术决策上下文","最适合用于主要版本升级或新技术采用，较少适用于次要版本升级或bug修复"],"ja":["技術上の意思決定のコンテキストが大量に必要","主にメジャーバージョンのアップグレードや新しい技術の導入に最適で、マイナーバージョンのアップグレードやバグ修正にはあまり適していない"],"ko":["기술적 의사 결정의 컨텍스트가大量 필요","주로 메이저 버전 업그레이드나 새로운 기술 도입에 적합하며, 마이너 버전 업그레이드나 버그 수정에는 적합하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere un contexto de toma de decisiones técnicas significativo","Más útil para actualizaciones de versiones principales o adopciones de nuevas tecnologías, menos para actualizaciones de versiones menores o correcciones de errores"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de prise de décision technique important","Plus utile pour les mises à jour de versions majeures ou les adoptions de nouvelles technologies, moins pour les mises à jour de versions mineures ou les corrections de bogues"],"de":["Benötigt einen signifikanten Kontext für technische Entscheidungen","Nützlicher für Hauptversionen-Updates oder die Adoption neuer Technologien, weniger für Nebenversionen-Updates oder Fehlerkorrekturen"],"pt":["Exige contexto de tomada de decisões técnicas significativo","Mais útil para atualizações de versão principal ou adoção de novas tecnologias, menos para atualizações de versão menor ou correções de bugs"],"ru":["Требует значительного контекста принятия технических решений","Более полезен для обновлений основной версии или внедрения новых технологий, менее для обновлений минорной версии или исправления ошибок"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق اتخاذ قرارات تقنية هامة","أكثر فائدة لتحديثات الإصدار الرئيسي أو اعتماد تقنيات جديدة ، وأقل لتحديثات الإصدار الأصغر أو تصحيح الأخطاء"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9d43523332a9396c3dd73b6e88037aadb0342e376e63af781c00c7d3f8dd8450","qualityScore":51}');
