t Strapi","Kompatibilität mit NextJS","Konfiguration von Turborepo","Schnelles und effizientes Projektentwicklung","Anpassung der Benutzeroberfläche mit Shadcn/ui"],"pt":["Combinação de Strapi, NextJS e Shadcn/ui","Configuração de Turborepo","Desenvolvimento de projetos Strapi","Tecnologias de ponta para desenvolvimento web","Modelo inicial personalizável"],"ru":["Сочетание Strapi, NextJS и Shadcn/ui","Настройка Turborepo","Разработка проектов Strapi","Передовые технологии для веб-разработки","Настраиваемый шаблон"],"ar":["مزيج من Strapi و NextJS و Shadcn/ui","إعداد Turborepo","تطوير مشاريع Strapi","تقنيات متقدمة لتعليم الويب","نموذج إعداد قابل للتخصيص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用add-locale","什么是Strapi","add-locale替代品","add-locale与NextJS比较","安装add-locale","add-locale设置指南","Strapi项目开发"],"ja":["add-localeの使い方","Strapiとは","add-localeの代替","add-localeとNextJSの比較","add-localeのインストール","add-localeの設定ガイド","Strapiプロジェクト開発"],"ko":["add-locale 사용법","Strapi란","add-locale 대체품","add-locale와 NextJS 비교","add-locale 설치","add-locale 설정 가이드","Strapi 프로젝트 개발"],"es":["herramientas de AI","add-locale","Strapi","NextJS","Turborepo","desarrollo de proyectos","starter template","Shadcn/ui","configuración de proyectos"],"fr":["outils d''IA","add-locale","Strapi","NextJS","Turborepo","développement de projets","modèle de démarrage","Shadcn/ui","configuration de projets"],"de":["KI-Tools","add-locale","Strapi","NextJS","Turborepo","Projektentwicklung","Starter-Template","Shadcn/ui","Projekt-Konfiguration"],"pt":["como usar add-locale","o que é add-locale","add-locale alternative","add-locale vs Strapi","instalar add-locale","guia de configuração do add-locale","desenvolvimento de projetos Strapi","tecnologias de ponta para desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["как использовать add-locale","что такое add-locale","альтернатива add-locale","add-locale vs Strapi","установить add-locale","руководство по настройке add-locale","разработка проектов Strapi","передовые технологии для веб-разработки"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام add-locale","ما هو add-locale","بديل add-locale","add-locale مقابل Strapi","تثبيت add-locale","دليل إعداد add-locale","تطوير مشاريع Strapi","تقنيات متقدمة لتعليم الويب"]}},"owner":"notum-cz","repo":"strapi-next-monorepo-starter","repoPath":"notum-cz/strapi-next-monorepo-starter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.713Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-locale","description":"Adds a new language/locale to the application. Involves Strapi admin config, Next.js i18n routing, and translation files. Triggers: add language, add locale, new language, new translation, internationalization.","bodyPreview":"Add a new language/locale to the application. Involves Strapi admin config, Next.js i18n routing, and translation files.\n\n## Input Validation\n\nBefore proceeding, validate inputs:\n\n- **Locale code**: must be valid ISO 639-1 (2 letters, lowercase, e.g. `de`, `fr`, `sk`). Reject uppercase or invalid codes.\n- **Locale name**: capitalized, no special characters (e.g. `German`, `French`, `Slovak`).\n\nIf invalid format provided, ask user to correct before proceeding.\n\n## Inputs\n\nAsk the user for:\n\n- **L","body":"Add a new language/locale to the application. Involves Strapi admin config, Next.js i18n routing, and translation files.\n\n## Input Validation\n\nBefore proceeding, validate inputs:\n\n- **Locale code**: must be valid ISO 639-1 (2 letters, lowercase, e.g. `de`, `fr`, `sk`). Reject uppercase or invalid codes.\n- **Locale name**: capitalized, no special characters (e.g. `German`, `French`, `Slovak`).\n\nIf invalid format provided, ask user to correct before proceeding.\n\n## Inputs\n\nAsk the user for:\n\n- **Locale code**: ISO 639-1 code (e.g. `de`, `fr`, `sk`)\n- **Locale name**: human-readable name (e.g. `German`, `French`, `Slovak`)\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Create locale translation file\n\nCopy `apps/ui/locales/en.json` to `apps/ui/locales/{locale}.json`.\n\nThe file structure must match `en.json` exactly — same keys, translated values. Initially copy as-is and mark values for translation.\n\nExisting locales for reference: `en.json`, `cs.json`.\n\n### 2. Update routing config\n\nEdit `apps/ui/src/lib/navigation.ts`.\n\nAdd the new locale code to the `locales` array:\n\n```typescript\nexport const routing = defineRouting({\n  locales: [\"cs\", \"en\", \"{locale}\"],\n  defaultLocale: \"en\",\n  localePrefix: \"as-needed\",\n})\n```\n\nKeep the array sorted alphabetically.\n\n### 3. Update i18n config (if needed)\n\nThe i18n config at `apps/ui/src/lib/i18n.ts` uses dynamic imports and automatically picks up new locale files:\n\n```typescript\nmessages: (\n  await (locale === \"en\"\n    ? import(\"../../locales/en.json\")\n    : import(`../../locales/${locale}.json`))\n).default,\n```\n\nNo changes needed unless you want HMR support for the new locale during development (currently only `en` has HMR via static import).\n\n### 4. Manual steps (inform user)\n\nAfter the automated steps complete, inform the user:\n\n> The translation file and routing config are set up. You need to manually:\n>\n> 1. **Enable locale in Strapi**: Go to Settings > Internationalization > Add new locale > select {locale}\n> 2. **Translate content**: For each content type with i18n enabled, switch to the new locale in Strapi admin and translate\n\n## Notes\n\n- The `[locale]` route segment in `apps/ui/src/app/[locale]/` handles locale routing automatically via `next-intl`\n- `generateStaticParams` in the root layout iterates `routing.locales` — new locale pages are generated automatically\n- The `localePrefix: \"as-needed\"` setting means the default locale (`en`) has no prefix, all others get `/{locale}/` prefix\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:45:28.029Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multilingual Agents needing seamless locale integration with Strapi and NextJS","zh":"非常适合需要与Strapi和NextJS实现无缝本地化集成的多语言Agent","ja":"StrapiとNextJSのローカライズ統合を必要とするマルチリンガルエージェントに最適","ko":"Strapi와 NextJS의無縫한 로컬라이제이션 통합을 필요로 하는 다국어 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Multilingües que necesitan una integración de locale sin problemas con Strapi y NextJS","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Multilingues ayant besoin d''une intégration de locale sans problème avec Strapi et NextJS","de":"Perfekt für multilinguale Agenten, die eine nahtlose Locale-Integration mit Strapi und NextJS benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Multilíngues que precisam de integração de locale sem interrupções com Strapi e NextJS","ru":"Идеально для Мультилингвальных Агентов, которым требуется беспрепечная интеграция локалей с Strapi и NextJS","ar":"يُفضل Agent Multilingual الذي يحتاج إلى 통합 الموقع المحلي بدون انقطاع مع Strapi و NextJS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage multiple locales by configuring Strapi admin settings, implementing Next.js i18n routing, and handling translation files, all while adhering to ISO 639-1 standards for locale codes","zh":"通过配置Strapi管理设置、实现Next.js的i18n路由以及处理翻译文件，同时遵循ISO 639-1标准来管理多个本地化语言","ja":"Strapi管理設定の構成、Next.jsのi18nルーティングの実装、翻訳ファイルの処理を行い、ISO 639-1標準に従って複数のローカライズを管理する","ko":"Strapi 관리 설정을 구성하고 Next.js의 i18n 라우팅을 구현하며 번역 파일을 처리함으로써 다중 로컬라이제이션을 관리하고 ISO 639-1 표준을 준수","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar múltiples locales configurando la configuración de administrador de Strapi, implementando enrutamiento i18n de Next.js y manipulando archivos de traducción, todo mientras se adhiere a los estándares ISO 639-1 para códigos de locale","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer plusieurs locales en configurant les paramètres d''administration de Strapi, en mettant en œuvre le routage i18n de Next.js et en gérant les fichiers de traduction, tout en respectant les normes ISO 639-1 pour les codes de locale","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mehrere Locale zu verwalten, indem sie die Strapi-Admin-Einstellungen konfigurieren, das Next.js-i18n-Routing implementieren und Übersetzungsdateien bearbeiten, während sie den ISO-639-1-Standards für Locale-Codes entsprechen","pt":"Empodera agentes para gerenciar vários locais configurando as configurações do Strapi admin, implementando o Next.js i18n routing e lidando com arquivos de tradução, tudo enquanto aderindo aos padrões ISO 639-1 para códigos de local","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять несколькими локациями, конфигурируя настройки Strapi admin, реализуя Next.js i18n routing и обрабатывая файлы перевода, при этом соблюдая стандарты ISO 639-1 для кодов локалей","ar":"يمنح وكلاء إدارة مواقع متعددة من خلال تكوين إعدادات Strapi admin، وتنفيذ Next.js i18n routing، وprocessing files ترجمة، مع الحفاظ على معايير ISO 639-1 للكو"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Strapi admin for new locales","Implementing i18n routing with Next.js","Validating locale codes against ISO 639-1 standards"],"zh":["为新的本地化语言配置Strapi管理设置","使用Next.js实现i18n路由","验证本地化语言代码是否符合ISO 639-1标准"],"ja":["新しいローカライズのためにStrapi管理設定を構成する","Next.jsでi18nルーティングを実装する","ローカライズコードをISO 639-1標準に従って検証する"],"ko":["새로운 로컬라이제이션을 위한 Strapi 관리 설정 구성","Next.js에서 i18n 라우팅 구현","로컬라이제이션 코드를 ISO 639-1 표준에 따라 검증"],"es":["Configuración de Strapi admin para nuevos locales","Implementación de enrutamiento i18n con Next.js","Validación de códigos de locale contra los estándares ISO 639-1"],"fr":["Configuration de l''administration Strapi pour de nouveaux locales","Mise en œuvre du routage i18n avec Next.js","Validation des codes de locale contre les normes ISO 639-1"],"de":["Konfiguration von Strapi-Admin für neue Locale","Implementierung des Next.js-i18n-Routings","Validierung von Locale-Codes gegen die ISO-639-1-Standards"],"pt":["Configurando o Strapi admin para novos locais","Implementando i18n routing com Next.js","Validando códigos de local contra os padrões ISO 639-1"],"ru":["Настройка Strapi admin для новых локалей","Реализация i18n routing с Next.js","Проверка кодов локалей против стандартов ISO 639-1"],"ar":["تكوين Strapi admin لمواقع جديدة","تنفيذ Next.js i18n routing","التحقق من كود المواقع المحلية ضد معايير ISO 639-1"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires valid ISO 639-1 locale codes","Limited to Strapi and NextJS frameworks","Locale names must be capitalized and free of special characters"],"zh":["需要有效的ISO 639-1本地化语言代码","仅限于Strapi和NextJS框架","本地化语言名称必须大写且不能包含特殊字符"],"ja":["有効なISO 639-1ローカライズコードが必要","StrapiとNextJSフレームワークのみに限定","ローカライズ名は大文字で特殊文字を含めない"],"ko":["유효한 ISO 639-1 로컬라이제이션 코드가 필요","Strapi와 NextJS 프레임워크만으로 제한","로컬라이제이션 이름은 대문자여야 하며 특수 문자를 포함할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere códigos de locale ISO 639-1 válidos","Limitado a los frameworks Strapi y NextJS","Los nombres de locale deben estar capitalizados y libres de caracteres especiales"],"fr":["Nécessite des codes de locale ISO 639-1 valides","Limité aux frameworks Strapi et NextJS","Les noms de locale doivent être capitalisés et exempts de caractères spéciaux"],"de":["Erfordert gültige ISO-639-1-Locale-Codes","Beschränkt auf die Frameworks Strapi und NextJS","Locale-Namen müssen großgeschrieben und frei von Sonderzeichen sein"],"pt":["Requer códigos de local ISO 639-1 válidos","Limitado a Strapi e NextJS frameworks","Os nomes dos locais devem ser capitalizados e livres de caracteres especiais"],"ru":["Требует действительных кодов локалей ISO 639-1","Ограничен до Strapi и NextJS frameworks","Имена локалей должны быть капитализированы и не содержать специальные символы"],"ar":["يحتاج إلى كود المواقع المحلية ISO 639-1 صحيح","محدود إلى إطار Strapi و NextJS","يجب أن يكون اسم الموقع المحلي مكتوبًا بالحروف الكبيرة و خاليًا من الحروف الخاصة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"798b53275d6d90dfa0f150e0572e52cbd02e3e1c26aae3d8279c4b152bb58870","qualityScore":51}');
