AI 에이전트","멀티체인 블록체인 네트워크","제로ギャ프 보장","이더리움","비트코인","솔라나","블록체인 네트워크 성능 메트릭스","vm-infrastructure-ops 사용 방법","vm-infrastructure-ops 설치 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para blockchain","métricas de redes blockchain","vm-infrastructure-ops alternativa","cómo usar vm-infrastructure-ops","guía de instalación de vm-infrastructure-ops","vm-infrastructure-ops vs otros herramientas de AI"],"fr":["outils IA pour blockchain","métriques de réseaux blockchain","vm-infrastructure-ops alternative","comment utiliser vm-infrastructure-ops","guide d''installation de vm-infrastructure-ops","vm-infrastructure-ops vs autres outils IA"],"de":["KI-Tools für Blockchain","Metriken von Blockchain-Netzwerken","vm-infrastructure-ops Alternative","wie man vm-infrastructure-ops verwendet","Installationsanleitung für vm-infrastructure-ops","vm-infrastructure-ops vs andere KI-Tools"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para blockchain","coleta de métricas blockchain","vm-infrastructure-ops alternative","como usar vm-infrastructure-ops","guia de instalação vm-infrastructure-ops","desenvolvimento de blockchain","análise de desempenho blockchain","ferramentas de desenvolvimento blockchain"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для блокчейна","сбор метрик блокчейна","альтернативы vm-infrastructure-ops","как использовать vm-infrastructure-ops","руководство по установке vm-infrastructure-ops","разработка блокчейна","анализ производительности блокчейна","инструменты разработки блокчейна"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للعملات الرقمية","جمع متريكات العملات الرقمية","بديل vm-infrastructure-ops","كيفية استخدام vm-infrastructure-ops","دليل تركيب vm-infrastructure-ops","تطوير العملات الرقمية","تحليل الأداء العملات الرقمية","أدوات تطوير العملات الرقمية"]}},"owner":"terrylica","repo":"gapless-network-data","repoPath":"terrylica/gapless-network-data","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.724Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vm-infrastructure-ops","description":"Troubleshoot and manage GCP e2-micro VM running eth-realtime-collector. Use when VM service is down, systemd failures occur, real-time data stream stops, or VM network issues arise. Keywords systemd, journalctl, eth-collector, gcloud compute.","bodyPreview":"# VM Infrastructure Operations\n\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n**Last Updated**: 2025-11-13\n**Purpose**: Troubleshoot and manage GCP e2-micro VM running eth-realtime-collector\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- VM service down, \"eth-collector\" systemd failures\n- Real-time data stream stopped (ClickHouse not receiving blocks)\n- VM network issues, DNS resolution failures\n- Need to check service status, view logs, or restart services\n- Keywords: systemd, journalctl, eth-collector, gcloud compute\n\n## Prer","body":"# VM Infrastructure Operations\n\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n**Last Updated**: 2025-11-13\n**Purpose**: Troubleshoot and manage GCP e2-micro VM running eth-realtime-collector\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- VM service down, \"eth-collector\" systemd failures\n- Real-time data stream stopped (ClickHouse not receiving blocks)\n- VM network issues, DNS resolution failures\n- Need to check service status, view logs, or restart services\n- Keywords: systemd, journalctl, eth-collector, gcloud compute\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- GCP project access: `eonlabs-ethereum-bq`\n- VM instance: `eth-realtime-collector` in zone `us-east1-b`\n- gcloud CLI configured with appropriate credentials\n\n## Workflows\n\n### 1. Check Service Status\n\nCheck if eth-collector systemd service is running:\n\n```bash\ngcloud compute ssh eth-realtime-collector --zone=us-east1-b \\\n  --command=''sudo systemctl status eth-collector''\n```\n\n**Expected Output** (healthy):\n```\n● eth-collector.service - Ethereum Real-Time Collector\n   Loaded: loaded (/etc/systemd/system/eth-collector.service; enabled)\n   Active: active (running) since ...\n```\n\n**Alternative** (use provided script):\n```bash\n.claude/skills/vm-infrastructure-ops/scripts/check_vm_status.sh\n```\n\n### 2. View Logs (Live Tail)\n\nStream real-time logs from the collector service:\n\n```bash\ngcloud compute ssh eth-realtime-collector --zone=us-east1-b \\\n  --command=''sudo journalctl -u eth-collector -f''\n```\n\n**What to Look For**:\n- \"Block inserted\" messages every ~12 seconds (healthy)\n- gRPC errors, DNS resolution failures (unhealthy)\n- \"Connection refused\" or \"Metadata server unreachable\" (network issues)\n\n### 3. View Recent Logs (Last 100 Lines)\n\n```bash\ngcloud compute ssh eth-realtime-collector --zone=us-east1-b \\\n  --command=''sudo journalctl -u eth-collector -n 100''\n```\n\n### 4. Restart Service\n\nRestart the collector service after configuration changes or to recover from errors:\n\n```bash\ngcloud compute ssh eth-realtime-collector --zone=us-east1-b \\\n  --command=''sudo systemctl restart eth-collector''\n```\n\n**Alternative** (use provided script with pre-checks):\n```bash\n.claude/skills/vm-infrastructure-ops/scripts/restart_collector.sh\n```\n\n**When to Use**:\n- After deploying code updates\n- Recovering from gRPC metadata validation errors\n- After Secret Manager credential updates\n\n### 5. VM Hard Reset\n\nHard reset the VM instance (use as last resort):\n\n```bash\ngcloud compute instances reset eth-realtime-collector --zone=us-east1-b\n```\n\n**When to Use**:\n- VM network connectivity completely lost\n- DNS resolution failures\n- Metadata server unreachable\n- Service restart doesn''t resolve issues\n\n**Warning**: This forcefully restarts the VM. All in-memory state is lost.\n\n### 6. Verify Data Flow\n\nAfter restarting services, verify data is flowing to ClickHouse:\n\n```bash\ncd \ndoppler run --project aws-credentials --config prd -- python3 -c \"\nimport clickhouse_connect\nimport os\nclient = clickhouse_connect.get_client(\n    host=os.environ[''CLICKHOUSE_HOST''],\n    port=8443,\n    username=''default'',\n    password=os.environ[''CLICKHOUSE_PASSWORD''],\n    secure=True\n)\nresult = client.query(''SELECT MAX(timestamp), MAX(number) FROM ethereum_mainnet.blocks FINAL'')\nprint(f''Latest block: {result.result_rows[0][1]:,} at {result.result_rows[0][0]}'')\n\"\n```\n\n**Expected Output** (healthy):\n```\nLatest block: 23,800,000+ at <within last 60 seconds>\n```\n\n## Common Failure Modes\n\nSee [VM Failure Modes](/.claude/skills/vm-infrastructure-ops/references/vm-failure-modes.md) for detailed troubleshooting guide.\n\n**Quick Reference**:\n\n| Symptom | Likely Cause | Solution |\n|---------|--------------|----------|\n| Service status: `failed` | gRPC metadata error | Check logs, restart with `.strip()` fix |\n| No blocks for >5 minutes | Network connectivity | Check network, reset VM if needed |\n| DNS resolution errors | Metadata server unreachable | VM hard reset |\n| \"Connection refused\" | Service not running | Restart service |\n\n## Systemd Commands\n\nSee [Systemd Commands Reference](/.claude/skills/vm-infrastructure-ops/references/systemd-commands.md) for complete systemd operations.\n\n**Quick Reference**:\n\n```bash\n# Status\nsudo systemctl status eth-collector\n\n# Start\nsudo systemctl start eth-collector\n\n# Stop\nsudo systemctl stop eth-collector\n\n# Restart\nsudo systemctl restart eth-collector\n\n# Enable (start on boot)\nsudo systemctl enable eth-collector\n\n# Disable (don''t start on boot)\nsudo systemctl disable eth-collector\n\n# View service logs\nsudo journalctl -u eth-collector\n\n# Follow logs live\nsudo journalctl -u eth-collector -f\n```\n\n## Operational History\n\n**Infrastructure Recovery** (2025-11-10 07:00 UTC):\n- VM network failure detected (DNS resolution failed, metadata server unreachable)\n- Recovery: VM reset restored network connectivity\n- eth-collector service restarted with `.strip()` fix (gRPC metadata validation resolved)\n- Real-time data flow confirmed: blocks streaming every ~12 seconds\n- Database verified: 23.8M blocks (2015-2025), latest block within seconds\n\n**Maintainability SLO Achievement**: Critical infrastructure failure (VM network down) resolved in <30 minutes (VM reset + service restart + verification).\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n- [ClickHouse Migration ADR](/docs/architecture/decisions/2025-11-25-motherduck-clickhouse-migration.md) - Production database migration\n- [Real-Time Collector Deployment Guide](/docs/deployment/realtime-collector.md) - VM deployment\n- [Gap Monitor README](/deployment/gcp-functions/gap-monitor/README.md) - Automated gap detection\n- [Data Pipeline Monitoring Skill](/.claude/skills/data-pipeline-monitoring/SKILL.md) - Cloud Run Jobs monitoring\n\n## Scripts\n\n- [`check_vm_status.sh`](/.claude/skills/vm-infrastructure-ops/scripts/check_vm_status.sh) - Automated status check via gcloud\n- [`restart_collector.sh`](/.claude/skills/vm-infrastructure-ops/scripts/restart_collector.sh) - Safe restart with pre-checks\n\n## References\n\n- [`vm-failure-modes.md`](/.claude/skills/vm-infrastructure-ops/references/vm-failure-modes.md) - Common failure scenarios and solutions\n- [`systemd-commands.md`](/.claude/skills/vm-infrastructure-ops/references/systemd-commands.md) - Complete systemd operations reference\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:54:48.639Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Infrastructure Agents needing advanced VM management and troubleshooting capabilities for GCP e2-micro VMs","zh":"适用于需要高级 VM 管理和故障排除能力的 Cloud Infrastructure Agents，特别是用于 GCP e2-micro VMs","ja":"Cloud Infrastructure Agents に高度な VM 管理とトラブルシューティング機能が必要な場合、GCP e2-micro VMs に最適","ko":"클라우드 인프라 에이전트에게 고급 VM 관리 및 문제 해결 기능이 필요한 경우, 특히 GCP e2-micro VMs에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Infraestructura en la Nube que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de administración y solución de problemas de máquinas virtuales para GCP e2-micro VMs","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Infrastructure Cloud nécessitant des capacités avancées de gestion et de dépannage de machines virtuelles pour les VM GCP e2-micro","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Infrastruktur-Agents, die erweiterte VM-Verwaltungs- und Fehlerbehebungsfunktionen für GCP-e2-micro-VMs benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Infraestrutura em Nuvem que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento e solução de problemas de VM para VMs GCP e2-micro","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов облачной инфраструктуры, требующих расширенных возможностей управления и устранения неполадок виртуальных машин для виртуальных машин GCP e2-micro","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البنية السحابية الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة وحل مشاكل أجهزة افتراضية لآلات افتراضية GCP e2-micro"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to troubleshoot and manage GCP e2-micro VMs running eth-realtime-collector, leveraging systemd, journalctl, and gcloud compute for real-time data stream management and blockchain network metrics collection","zh":"赋予代理能力以排除 GCP e2-micro VMs 上运行的 eth-realtime-collector 的故障，并利用 systemd、journalctl 和 gcloud compute 进行实时数据流管理和区块链网络指标收集","ja":"エージェントが GCP e2-micro VMs 上で実行されている eth-realtime-collector のトラブルシューティングと管理を行い、systemd、journalctl、gcloud compute を使用してリアルタイムデータストリーム管理とブロックチェーンネットワークメトリクスの収集を行うことを可能に","ko":"에이전트가 GCP e2-micro VMs에서 실행되는 eth-realtime-collector의 문제를 해결하고, systemd, journalctl 및 gcloud compute를 사용하여 실시간 데이터 스트림 관리 및 블록체인 네트워크 메트릭 수집을 수행할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a solucionar problemas y administrar GCP e2-micro VMs que ejecutan eth-realtime-collector, aprovechando systemd, journalctl y gcloud compute para la administración de flujos de datos en tiempo real y la recopilación de métricas de redes de blockchain","fr":"Permet aux agents de dépanner et de gérer les VM GCP e2-micro exécutant eth-realtime-collector, en exploitant systemd, journalctl et gcloud compute pour la gestion des flux de données en temps réel et la collecte de métriques de réseaux de blockchain","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, GCP-e2-micro-VMs zu debuggen und zu verwalten, die eth-realtime-collector ausführen, wobei systemd, journalctl und gcloud compute für die Verwaltung von Echtzeit-Datenströmen und die Erfassung von Blockchain-Netzwerkmetriken genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a solucionar problemas e gerenciar VMs GCP e2-micro que executam eth-realtime-collector, utilizando systemd, journalctl e gcloud compute para gerenciamento de fluxo de dados em tempo real e coleta de métricas de rede de blockchain","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью устранять неполадки и управлять виртуальными машинами GCP e2-micro, на которых запущен eth-realtime-collector, используя systemd, journalctl и gcloud compute для управления потоком данных в реальном времени и сбора метрик blockchain","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من حل المشاكل وإدارة أجهزة افتراضية GCP e2-micro التي تعمل على تشغيل eth-realtime-collector، باستخدام systemd و journalctl و gcloud compute لإدارة تدفق البيانات في الوقت الفعلي وجمع معايير شبكة البلوكشين"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging VM service downtime and eth-collector systemd failures","Resolving real-time data stream issues with ClickHouse and blockchain networks like Ethereum, Bitcoin, and Solana","Managing VM network issues and DNS resolution failures"],"zh":["调试 VM 服务停机和 eth-collector systemd 故障","解决与 ClickHouse 和区块链网络（如 Ethereum、Bitcoin 和 Solana）相关的实时数据流问题","管理 VM 网络问题和 DNS 解析故障"],"ja":["VM サービスのダウンタイムと eth-collector systemd の障害をデバッグする","ClickHouse とブロックチェーンネットワーク（例：Ethereum、Bitcoin、Solana）に関するリアルタイムデータストリームの問題を解決する","VM ネットワークの問題と DNS 解決の障害を管理する"],"ko":["VM 서비스 중단 및 eth-collector systemd 장애를 디버깅하는 것","ClickHouse 및 블록체인 네트워크(예: 이더리움, 비트코인, 솔라나) 관련 실시간 데이터 스트림 문제를 해결하는 것","VM 네트워크 문제 및 DNS 해석 실패를 관리하는 것"],"es":["Depuración de tiempos de inactividad del servicio de máquina virtual y fallas de systemd de eth-collector","Resolución de problemas de flujos de datos en tiempo real con ClickHouse y redes de blockchain como Ethereum, Bitcoin y Solana","Administración de problemas de red de máquina virtual y fallas de resolución de DNS"],"fr":["Débogage des temps d''arrêt du service de machine virtuelle et des défaillances de systemd d''eth-collector","Résolution des problèmes de flux de données en temps réel avec ClickHouse et des réseaux de blockchain comme Ethereum, Bitcoin et Solana","Gestion des problèmes de réseau de machine virtuelle et des défaillances de résolution de DNS"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Ausfallzeiten des Virtual Machine-Dienstes und systemd-Fehlern von eth-collector","Behebung von Problemen mit Echtzeit-Datenströmen mit ClickHouse und Blockchain-Netzwerken wie Ethereum, Bitcoin und Solana","Verwaltung von Virtual Machine-Netzwerkproblemen und DNS-Auflösungsfehlern"],"pt":["Depuração de downtime de serviço de VM e falhas de systemd de eth-collector","Resolução de problemas de fluxo de dados em tempo real com ClickHouse e redes de blockchain como Ethereum, Bitcoin e Solana","Gerenciamento de problemas de rede de VM e falhas de resolução de DNS"],"ru":["Отладка простоя сервиса виртуальной машины и сбоев systemd eth-collector","Решение проблем с потоком данных в реальном времени с ClickHouse и сетями blockchain, такими как Ethereum, Bitcoin и Solana","Управление проблемами сети виртуальной машины и сбоями разрешения DNS"],"ar":["تصحيح مشاكل انقطاع خدمة الجهاز الافتراضي وأعطال systemd ل eth-collector","حل مشاكل تدفق البيانات في الوقت الفعلي مع ClickHouse وشبكات البلوكشين مثل Ethereum و Bitcoin و Solana","إدارة مشاكل شبكة الجهاز الافتراضي وفشل حل DNS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GCP e2-micro VM setup and eth-realtime-collector configuration","Limited to GCP and specific blockchain networks (Ethereum, Bitcoin, Solana)"],"zh":["需要 GCP e2-micro VM 设置和 eth-realtime-collector 配置","仅限 GCP 和特定区块链网络（Ethereum、Bitcoin、Solana）"],"ja":["GCP e2-micro VM の設定と eth-realtime-collector の構成が必要","GCP と特定のブロックチェーンネットワーク（Ethereum、Bitcoin、Solana）のみに限定"],"ko":["GCP e2-micro VM 설정 및 eth-realtime-collector 구성이 필요","GCP 및 특정 블록체인 네트워크(이더리움, 비트코인, 솔라나)만 지원"],"es":["Requiere configuración de GCP e2-micro VM y configuración de eth-realtime-collector","Limitado a GCP y redes de blockchain específicas (Ethereum, Bitcoin, Solana)"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de VM GCP e2-micro et une configuration d''eth-realtime-collector","Limité à GCP et à des réseaux de blockchain spécifiques (Ethereum, Bitcoin, Solana)"],"de":["Benötigt GCP-e2-micro-VM-Setup und eth-realtime-collector-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf GCP und bestimmte Blockchain-Netzwerke (Ethereum, Bitcoin, Solana)"],"pt":["Exige configuração de VM GCP e2-micro e configuração de eth-realtime-collector","Limitado ao GCP e a redes de blockchain específicas (Ethereum, Bitcoin, Solana)"],"ru":["Требует настройки виртуальной машины GCP e2-micro и конфигурации eth-realtime-collector","Ограничен GCP и определенными сетями blockchain (Ethereum, Bitcoin, Solana)"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد جهاز افتراضي GCP e2-micro وتفاصيل إعداد eth-realtime-collector","محدود بـ GCP وشبكات البلوكشين المحددة (Ethereum و Bitcoin و Solana)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3c1389412fa9e018d27e2c9ee47c3d5e376b8fd947e38c4f44fe663677fd2f7e","qualityScore":51}');
