ipts/read_logs.sh --message-like \"Processing failed\" --limit 10\n```\n\n## Agent-Friendly CLI\n\nUse the agent helper for targeted queries:\n\n```sh\npython scripts/logfire","body":"# Logfire Read Skill\n\nUse this skill to read Logfire records with JSONL output using the repo’s reader utilities.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Load `.env` from the repo root:\n\n```sh\nset -a\n. ./.env\nset +a\n```\n\n2. Run the JSONL reader:\n\n```sh\npython scripts/logfire-fetch.py\n```\n\nOr use the bundled script:\n\n```sh\n./.codex/skills/logfire-read/scripts/read_logs.sh --message-like \"Processing failed\" --limit 10\n```\n\n## Agent-Friendly CLI\n\nUse the agent helper for targeted queries:\n\n```sh\npython scripts/logfire-read-agent.py --since 2026-01-11T00:00:00Z --message-like \"Processing failed\" --limit 10\n```\n\n## Module API\n\nUse `query_logfire()` for programmatic access:\n\n```python\nfrom logger import query_logfire\n\nrows = query_logfire(jsonl=True, level=21, message_like=\"Processing failed\", limit=10)\nfor row in rows:\n    print(row)\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nRequired:\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_URL` (e.g., `https://logfire-us.pydantic.dev/v1/query`)\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_TOKEN`\n\nOptional filters:\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_COLUMNS`\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_LIMIT`\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_SINCE`\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_LEVEL`\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_MESSAGE_LIKE`\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_TRACE_ID`\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_SPAN_ID`\n- `LOGFIRE_READ_JSONL=true`\n\n## Output Format\n\n- JSONL output returns one JSON object per record.\n- `level` is converted to severity strings (`trace`, `debug`, `info`, `warn`, `error`, `fatal`).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:05:05.304Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Logging Analysis Agents needing structured logging of Python function calls for containerized applications and Docker Compose","zh":"非常适合需要对容器化应用程序中的Python函数调用进行结构化日志记录的日志分析代理，特别适用于Docker Compose","ja":"Python関数呼び出しの構造化ログ記録が必要なコンテナ化アプリケーションとDocker Composeのログ分析エージェントに最適","ko":"Python 함수 호출에 대한 구조화된 로깅이 필요한 컨테이너화된 애플리케이션 및 Docker Compose를 위한 로그 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Registro que necesitan registro estructurado de llamadas a funciones de Python para aplicaciones contenerizadas y Docker Compose","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Journal nécessitant un journal structuré des appels de fonctions Python pour des applications conteneurisées et Docker Compose","de":"Perfekt für Logging-Analyse-Agents, die strukturiertes Logging von Python-Funktionenaufrufen für containerisierte Anwendungen und Docker Compose benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Registros que necessitam de registros estruturados de chamadas de funções Python para aplicativos containerizados e Docker Compose","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа журналов, которым необходимы структурированные журналы вызовов функций Python для контейнеризированных приложений и Docker Compose","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل السجلات الذي يحتاج إلى سجلات بنية لاستدعاءات دالة Python لتطبيقات الحاويات و Docker Compose"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to read Logfire records with JSONL output using Python scripts and the repo''s reader utilities, enabling targeted queries with the agent helper for advanced logging analysis and debugging with Docker Compose","zh":"赋予代理读取Logfire记录的能力，使用Python脚本和仓库的读取工具，以JSONL输出格式，实现有针对性的查询和高级日志分析与Docker Compose的调试","ja":"Pythonスクリプトとリポジトリのリーダーutilityを使用して、JSONL出力でLogfireレコードを読み取るエージェントを可能にし、エージェントヘルパーを使用したターゲットクエリとDocker Composeの高度なログ分析およびデバッグを可能にする","ko":"Python 스크립트와 저장소의 리더 유틸리티를 사용하여 JSONL 출력 형식으로 Logfire 레코드를 읽는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 에이전트 헬퍼를 사용한 타겟 쿼리와 Docker Compose의 고급 로깅 분석 및 디버깅을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a leer registros de Logfire con salida JSONL utilizando scripts de Python y las utilidades de lectura del repositorio, lo que permite consultas dirigidas con el ayudante del agente para un análisis de registro avanzado y depuración con Docker Compose","fr":"Permet aux agents de lire des enregistrements Logfire avec une sortie JS