","行政スタッフ向けのデータ分析をサポート","データ可視化機能を提供","多種のデータ形式をサポート","リアルタイムデータ更新を提供"],"ko":["OpenStreetMap(OSM)의 자전거 및 주차 인프라 데이터에 액세스","AI 에이전트를 사용하여 정적 데이터셋을 추가","행정 직원용 데이터 분석을 지원","데이터 시각화 기능을 제공","여러 가지 데이터 형식을 지원","실시간 데이터 업데이트를 제공"],"es":["Acceso a datos de OpenStreetMap","Infraestructura de bicicletas y aparcamiento","Mejora de la toma de decisiones para personal administrativo","Datos estáticos para análisis","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Accès aux données d''OpenStreetMap","Infrastructure de bicyclette et de stationnement","Amélioration de la prise de décision pour le personnel administratif","Données statiques pour analyse","Intégration avec des outils de développement"],"de":["Zugang zu OpenStreetMap-Daten","Fahrrad- und Parkinfrastruktur","Verbesserung der Entscheidungsfindung für Administrativpersonal","Statische Daten für Analyse","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Acesso a dados de infraestrutura de bicicletas e estacionamento","Integração com OpenStreetMap","Gestão de dados estáticos","Ferramenta de IA para staff administrativo","Suporte a dados de localização"],"ru":["Доступ к данным о велосипедной и парковочной инфраструктуре","Интеграция с OpenStreetMap","Управление статическими данными","ИИ Агент для административного персонала","Поддержка данных о местоположении"],"ar":["الوصول إلى بيانات بنية تحتية للدراجات والانتظار","التكامل مع OpenStreetMap","إدارة البيانات الثابتة","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي لأفراد الموظفين الإداريين","دعم بيانات الموقع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用TILDA添加静态数据集","什么是AI工具","TILDA静态数据集添加教程","AI工具与静态数据集","TILDA静态数据集添加指南","如何安装TILDA","TILDA设置指南","TILDA替代工具","TILDA与其他AI工具的比较"],"ja":["TILDAで静的データセットを追加する方法","AIエージェントとは","TILDA静的データセット追加チュートリアル","AIエージェントと静的データセット","TILDA静的データセット追加ガイド","TILDAのインストール方法","TILDA設定ガイド","TILDAの代替ツール","TILDAと他のAIエージェントの比較"],"ko":["TILDA에서 정적 데이터셋을 추가하는 방법","AI 에이전트란","TILDA 정적 데이터셋 추가 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트와 정적 데이터셋","TILDA 정적 데이터셋 추가 가이드","TILDA 설치 방법","TILDA 설정 가이드","TILDA 대체 도구","TILDA와 다른 AI 에이전트 비교"],"es":["herramientas de AI","datos estáticos","TILDA","OpenStreetMap","infraestructura de bicicletas","aparcamiento","cómo usar TILDA","guía de instalación de TILDA","alternativas a TILDA"],"fr":["outils d''IA","données statiques","TILDA","OpenStreetMap","infrastructure de bicyclette","stationnement","comment utiliser TILDA","guide d''installation de TILDA","alternatives à TILDA"],"de":["KI-Tools","statische Daten","TILDA","OpenStreetMap","Fahrradinfrastruktur","Parkinfrastruktur","wie man TILDA verwendet","TILDA-Installationsanleitung","Alternativen zu TILDA"],"pt":["como usar TILDA","o que é TILDA","ferramentas de IA para dados estáticos","TILDA vs outras ferramentas","instalar TILDA","guia de configuração do TILDA","TILDA para staff administrativo","acesso a dados de infraestrutura"],"ru":["как использовать TILDA","что такое TILDA","ИИ Агенты для статических данных","TILDA vs другие инструменты","установить TILDA","руководство по настройке TILDA","TILDA для административного персонала","доступ к данным о инфраструктуре"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام TILDA","ما هي TILDA","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للبيانات الثابتة","TILDA مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت TILDA","دليل إعداد TILDA","TILDA لأفراد الموظفين الإداريين","الوصول إلى بيانات البنية التحتية"]}},"owner":"FixMyBerlin","repo":"tilda-geo","repoPath":"FixMyBerlin/tilda-geo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.796Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-static-dataset","description":"Add a new static dataset to app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson. Infers config from prompt, asks for missing data, uses types to guide required fields.","bodyPreview":"# Add Static Dataset\n\nAdds a new static dataset folder to `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`. The `/geojson` folder is a symlink.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User wants to add a new GeoJSON dataset\n- User mentions adding static data, geojson files, \"uploads\", or datasets\n- User provides a geojson file path and wants it integrated\n\n## Required Information\n\nExtract from user prompt or ask if missing:\n\n1. **Group folder** (e.g., `region-berlin`, `region-bb`) - parent folder name\n2. **Sub-folder name** (e.","body":"# Add Static Dataset\n\nAdds a new static dataset folder to `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`. The `/geojson` folder is a symlink.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User wants to add a new GeoJSON dataset\n- User mentions adding static data, geojson files, \"uploads\", or datasets\n- User provides a geojson file path and wants it integrated\n\n## Required Information\n\nExtract from user prompt or ask if missing:\n\n1. **Group folder** (e.g., `region-berlin`, `region-bb`) - parent folder name\n2. **Sub-folder name** (e.g., `berlin-bezirke`) - dataset folder name (must be valid slug). **Must include region/group prefix**: for `region-berlin` use `berlin-<name>`, not just `<name>`\n3. **GeoJSON file path** - absolute path to source file on disk\n4. **Regions** - array of region slugs (e.g., `[''infravelo'']`, `[''berlin'']`)\n5. **Optional**: transformation needs, style preferences, category, attribution, license\n\n## Process\n\n### 1. Create Folder Structure\n\n```bash\napp/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/<GROUP_FOLDER>/<SUB_FOLDER>/\n```\n\n**Important**: `/geojson` is a symlink. Create folders in `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/` path.\n\nCreate directory if group folder doesn''t exist. Ensure sub-folder name follows naming convention (see Required Information above).\n\n### 2. Move GeoJSON File\n\n- Move source file to `<SUB_FOLDER>/<FILENAME>.geojson`\n- Run prettier from `app/` directory (prettier config is in app/): `cd app && bunx prettier --write scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/<GROUP_FOLDER>/<SUB_FOLDER>/<FILENAME>.geojson`\n\n### 3. Create transform.ts (if needed)\n\nOnly if transformation required. Use helpers from `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/_utils`:\n\n- `transformUtils.ts` - property transformations\n- `defaultLayerStyles.ts` - default styling helpers\n- `translateUtils.ts` - translation helpers\n\nExample:\n\n```typescript\nimport { FeatureCollection } from \"geojson\";\n\nexport const transform = (data: FeatureCollection) => {\n  // Use helper functions from _utils when possible\n  return data;\n};\n```\n\n### 4. Create meta.ts\n\n**Critical**: Research similar datasets in same group folder first.\n\n**Before writing meta.ts**:\n\n1. List all datasets in `<GROUP_FOLDER>/` directory\n2. Read 2-3 similar `meta.ts` files (similar geometry type, similar purpose)\n3. Infer patterns:\n   - Category from similar datasets\n   - Attribution patterns\n   - License conventions\n   - Style patterns\n   - Inspector settings\n4. If unclear, ask user to confirm or provide missing data\n\n**Required fields** (from `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/types.ts`):\n\n- `regions`: RegionSlug[] (required)\n- `public`: boolean (required)\n- `dataSourceType`: ''local'' (required)\n- `configs`: Array with at least one config (required)\n\n**Config required fields**:\n\n- `name`: string\n- `attributionHtml`: string\n- `inspector`: { enabled: boolean, ... } or { enabled: false }\n- `layers`: Layer[] (required)\n\n**Config optional fields**:\n\n- `category`: StaticDatasetCategoryKey | null\n- `updatedAt`: string\n- `description`: string\n- `dataSourceMarkdown`: string\n- `licence`: License type (see types.ts)\n- `licenceOsmCompatible`: ''licence'' | ''waiver'' | ''no''\n- `legends`: Legend[]\n\n**Style/Legend**: If not specified, make best guess:\n\n- Use `defaultLayerStyles()` from `_utils/defaultLayerStyles.ts` for simple cases\n- For polygons: fill + outline\n- For lines: colored line with width\n- For points: circle markers\n- Create appropriate legend entries\n\n**Example structure**:\n\n```typescript\nimport { MetaData } from \"../../../types\";\nimport { defaultLayerStyles } from \"../../_utils/defaultLayerStyles\";\n\nexport const data: MetaData = {\n  regions: [\"infravelo\"], // From user or infer from group folder\n  public: true,\n  dataSourceType: \"local\",\n  configs: [\n    {\n      name: \"Dataset Name\",\n      category: \"berlin/misc\", // Infer from similar datasets\n      attributionHtml: \"Source Name\", // Ask if unclear\n      licence: \"DL-DE/ZERO-2.0\", // Infer from similar datasets\n      inspector: { enabled: false }, // Default unless specified\n      layers: defaultLayerStyles(), // Or custom layers\n    },\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### 5. Verify Command\n\nCheck `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/updateStaticDatasets.ts` for correct params:\n\n- `--folder-filter=<SUB_FOLDER_NAME>` (matches full path, so sub-folder name works)\n- `--env=dev` (or staging/production, required)\n\n**One-click command** (replace `<SUB_FOLDER_NAME>` with actual folder name):\n\n```bash\nbun --env-file=.env ./scripts/StaticDatasets/updateStaticDatasets.ts --folder-filter=<SUB_FOLDER_NAME> --env=dev\n```\n\nNote: `updateDownloadSources.ts` is for WFS downloads (requires downloadConfig.ts). Use `updateStaticDatasets.ts` for local GeoJSON files.\n\n### 6. Verify TypeScript Compilation\n\n**Always run this after creating or modifying TypeScript files** (meta.ts, transform.ts, or any imports):\n\n```bash\nnpm run type-check:deploy\n```\n\nThis temporarily removes the `geojson` symlink, runs TypeScript type-checking, and restores the symlink. It simulates the Docker build environment where symlinks aren''t available, ensuring your code will compile correctly during builds.\n\n## Validation\n\nBefore completing:\n\n1. ✅ Folder structure created\n2. ✅ GeoJSON file moved and prettier run\n3. ✅ transform.ts created only if needed\n4. ✅ meta.ts follows type structure (check with TypeScript)\n5. ✅ Similar datasets in group folder reviewed for patterns\n6. ✅ Command verified and provided as one-click action\n7. ✅ `npm run type-check:deploy` run successfully (see Step 6)\n\n## References\n\n- Types: `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/types.ts`\n- Examples: `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/region-berlin/*/meta.ts`\n- Utils: `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/_utils/`\n- Docs: `docs/Features-Parameter-Deeplinks.md`, `docs/Regional-Masks.md`\n- Update script: `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/updateStaticDatasets.ts`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:28:25.888Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Geographic Information System (GIS) Agents requiring seamless integration of static GeoJSON datasets.","zh":"适用于需要无缝集成静态 GeoJSON 数据集的 Geographic Information System (GIS) Agents。","ja":"Geographic Information System (GIS) エージェントが静的 GeoJSON データセットを無制限に統合する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"정적 GeoJSON 데이터셋을 무제한으로 통합해야 하는 Geographic Information System (GIS) 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de Sistemas de Información Geográfica (GIS) que requieren una integración perfecta de conjuntos de datos GeoJSON estáticos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de Système d''Information Géographique (GIS) nécessitant une intégration transparente des jeux de données GeoJSON statiques.","de":"Ideal für Geographic Information System (GIS) Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration statischer GeoJSON-Datensätze erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Sistema de Informação Geográfica (GIS) que exigem integração perfeita de conjuntos de dados GeoJSON estáticos.","ru":"Идеально для Географических Информационных Систем (GIS) агентов, требующих бесшовной интеграции статических наборов данных GeoJSON.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل لنظام المعلومات الجغرافية (GIS) التي تتطلب تكاملًا بدون فواصل لمجموعات بيانات GeoJSON الثابتة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage and add new static dataset folders to the `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` directory, utilizing GeoJSON file formats and symlinks for streamlined data access and analysis.","zh":"使得代理能够高效地管理和添加新的静态数据集文件夹到 `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` 目录中，利用 GeoJSON 文件格式和符号链接实现流畅的数据访问和分析。","ja":"エージェントが `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` ディレクトリに新しい静的データセットフォルダーを効率的に管理および追加できるようにし、GeoJSON ファイル形式とシンボリックリンクを使用してスムーズなデータアクセスと分析を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` 디렉토리에 새로운 정적 데이터셋 폴더를 효율적으로 관리하고 추가할 수 있도록 하며, GeoJSON 파일 형식과 심볼릭 링크를 사용하여 데이터 액세스와 분석을 원활하게 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar y agregar eficientemente nuevas carpetas de conjuntos de datos estáticos al directorio `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`, utilizando formatos de archivo GeoJSON y enlaces simbólicos para un acceso y análisis de datos optimizado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer et d''ajouter efficacement de nouveaux dossiers de jeux de données statiques au répertoire `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`, en utilisant les formats de fichiers GeoJSON et les liens symboliques pour un accès et une analyse des données rationalisés.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents, neue statische Datensatzordner effizient im Verzeichnis `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` zu verwalten und hinzuzufügen, unter Verwendung von GeoJSON-Dateiformaten und Symlinks für einen optimierten Datenzugriff und -analyse.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem e adicionem novas pastas de conjuntos de dados estáticos ao diretório `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` de forma eficiente, utilizando formatos de arquivo GeoJSON e symlinks para acesso e análise de dados otimizados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять и добавлять новые папки статических наборов данных в директорию `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`, используя форматы файлов GeoJSON и symlinks для оптимизированного доступа и анализа данных.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إدارة وأضافة مجلدات جديدة لمجموعات البيانات الثابتة إلى الدليل `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` بطريقة فعالة، مستخدماً تنسيقات الملفات GeoJSON والروابط الرمزية لتحقيق وصول وتحليل البيانات المُتَстраَع."},"useCases":{"en":["Adding new administrative region datasets","Integrating custom GeoJSON files for data visualization","Uploading static datasets for urban planning analysis"],"zh":["添加新的行政区域数据集","集成自定义 GeoJSON 文件以进行数据可视化","上传静态数据集以进行城市规划分析"],"ja":["新しい行政区域データセットを追加する","データ可視化のためにカスタム GeoJSON ファイルを統合する","都市計画分析のための静的データセットをアップロードする"],"ko":["新的 행정 구역 데이터셋을 추가하는 것","데이터 시각화를 위한 사용자 지정 GeoJSON 파일을 통합하는 것","도시 계획 분석을 위한 정적 데이터셋을 업로드하는 것"],"es":["Adición de nuevos conjuntos de datos de regiones administrativas","Integración de archivos GeoJSON personalizados para la visualización de datos","Carga de conjuntos de datos estáticos para análisis de planificación urbana"],"fr":["Ajout de nouveaux jeux de données de régions administratives","Intégration de fichiers GeoJSON personnalisés pour la visualisation des données","Téléchargement de jeux de données statiques pour l''analyse de la planification urbaine"],"de":["Hinzufügen neuer administrativer Regionsdatensätze","Integrieren benutzerdefinierter GeoJSON-Dateien für die Datenvisualisierung","Hochladen statischer Datensätze für die Analyse der Stadtplanung"],"pt":["Adicionar novos conjuntos de dados de regiões administrativas","Integrar arquivos GeoJSON personalizados para visualização de dados","Fazer upload de conjuntos de dados estáticos para análise de planejamento urbano"],"ru":["Добавление новых наборов данных административных регионов","Интеграция пользовательских файлов GeoJSON для визуализации данных","Загрузка статических наборов данных для анализа городского планирования"],"ar":["إضافة مجموعات بيانات جديدة لمناطق إدارية","دمج ملفات GeoJSON مخصصة لتصور البيانات","تحميل مجموعات البيانات الثابتة لتحليل تخطيط المدن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user-provided group folder and sub-folder names","Limited to GeoJSON file format","Dependent on access to the `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` directory"],"zh":["需要用户提供的组文件夹和子文件夹名称","仅限于 GeoJSON 文件格式","依赖于对 `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` 目录的访问"],"ja":["ユーザー提供のグループフォルダーとサブフォルダーの名前が必要","GeoJSON ファイル形式のみ","`app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` ディレクトリへのアクセスに依存"],"ko":["사용자 제공 그룹 폴더 및 하위 폴더 이름이 필요","GeoJSON 파일 형식만","`app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson` 디렉토리への 액세스에 의존"],"es":["Requiere nombres de carpetas de grupo y subcarpetas proporcionados por el usuario","Limitado al formato de archivo GeoJSON","Depende del acceso al directorio `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`"],"fr":["Nécessite des noms de dossiers de groupe et de sous-dossiers fournis par l''utilisateur","Limité au format de fichier GeoJSON","Dépend de l''accès au répertoire `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`"],"de":["Erfordert vom Benutzer bereitgestellte Gruppenordner- und Unterordnernamen","Beschränkt auf das GeoJSON-Dateiformat","Abhängig vom Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`"],"pt":["Exige nomes de pastas e subpastas de grupo fornecidos pelo usuário","Limitado ao formato de arquivo GeoJSON","Dependente do acesso ao diretório `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`"],"ru":["Требует предоставления пользователем имен групповых папок и подпапок","Ограничен форматом файла GeoJSON","Зависит от доступа к директорию `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`"],"ar":["يتطلب اسماء مجلدات فرعية ومجلدات مجموعة مقدمة من قبل المستخدم","محدود بتنسيق الملف GeoJSON","يعتمد على الوصول إلى الدليل `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"dcae1b227597c1a96b7c1135632a3253ba3535a4923294dccc51f128f9ccbe06","qualityScore":51}');
