ement agile et efficace"],"de":["Code-Entwicklung basierend auf Spezifikationen","Integration mit KI-Coding-Assistenten wie Claude Code","Leichtes und flexibles Framework","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen","Agiles und effizientes Entwickeln"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento orientado a especificações","Integração com assistentes de codificação de IA","Framework leve e flexível","Suporte a Claude Code e outros assistentes de codificação","Desenvolvimento rápido e eficiente"],"ru":["Разработка на основе спецификаций","Интеграция с ИИ-ассистентами кодирования","Легкий и гибкий фреймворк","Поддержка Claude Code и других ИИ-ассистентов кодирования","Быстрая и эффективная разработка"],"ar":["التنمية الموجهة للمواصفات","التكامل مع مساعدين للتعليم بالذكاء الاصطناعي","إطار عمل خفيف وممكن","دعم Claude Code ومساعدين آخرين للتعليم","التنمية السريعة والفعالة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["how to use refine","what is refine","refine alternative","refine vs other AI tools","refine install","refine setup guide"],"ja":["how to use refine","what is refine","refine alternative","refine vs other AI tools","refine install","refine setup guide"],"ko":["how to use refine","what is refine","refine alternative","refine vs other AI tools","refine install","refine setup guide"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrollo","cómo usar refine","qué es refine","refine vs otros frameworks","instalación de refine","guía de configuración de refine","desarrollo de código con IA"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour le développement","comment utiliser refine","qu''est-ce que refine","refine vs autres frameworks","installation de refine","guide de configuration de refine","développement de code avec IA"],"de":["KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","wie man refine verwendet","was ist refine","refine vs andere Frameworks","Installation von refine","Konfigurationsanleitung für refine","Code-Entwicklung mit KI"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","desenvolvimento orientado a especificações","assistente de codificação de ia","claude code","refine framework","como usar refine","o que é refine","refine vs outros frameworks","instalar refine","guia de configuração do refine"],"ru":["ии агенты","разработка на основе спецификаций","ии ассистент кодирования","claude code","refine фреймворк","как использовать refine","что такое refine","refine vs другие фреймворки","установить refine","руководство по настройке refine"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التنمية الموجهة للمواصفات","مساعد للتعليم بالذكاء الاصطناعي","claude code","إطار عمل refine","كيفية استخدام refine","ما هو refine","refine مقابل إطارات عمل أخرى","تثبيت refine","دليل إعداد refine"]}},"owner":"heiko-braun","repo":"draft","repoPath":"heiko-braun/draft","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.797Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"refine","description":"Refines existing specs","bodyPreview":"# Refine Existing Spec\n\nRefine an existing specification based on new insights, feedback, or changing requirements.\n\n**Feature to refine:** $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. **Load the existing spec** from `/specs/{feature}.md`\n   - If no spec exists for this feature, suggest using `/spec` instead\n   - If multiple specs match, ask the user which one to refine\n\n2. **Ask 2-3 focused refinement questions** (one at a time):\n   - What aspect needs refinement? (goals, criteria, approach, scope)\n   - Wha","body":"# Refine Existing Spec\n\nRefine an existing specification based on new insights, feedback, or changing requirements.\n\n**Feature to refine:** $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. **Load the existing spec** from `/specs/{feature}.md`\n   - If no spec exists for this feature, suggest using `/spec` instead\n   - If multiple specs match, ask the user which one to refine\n\n2. **Ask 2-3 focused refinement questions** (one at a time):\n   - What aspect needs refinement? (goals, criteria, approach, scope)\n   - What new information or feedback has emerged?\n   - Are there specific pain points with the current spec?\n\n3. **Check scope and modularity:**\n   - Does the refinement keep the spec small enough for a single vertical slice?\n   - If criteria are being added, does the total still stay at ~5 or fewer?\n   - Does the refinement change which modules are affected? Update the \"Affected Modules\" section.\n   - If the refinement significantly expands scope or blast radius, suggest a separate spec instead.\n\n4. **Update the spec in place**:\n   - **Preserve front-matter**: Keep all existing front-matter fields (title, description, author). Keep `status: proposed` (refinements don''t change status)\n   - Preserve completed acceptance criteria checkboxes\n   - Update goals, criteria, or approach as needed\n   - Update \"Affected Modules\" and \"Test Strategy\" if the changes alter them\n   - Add to \"Out of Scope\" if removing features\n   - Add refinement notes to the \"Notes\" section with timestamp\n\n5. **Show a diff summary**:\n   - Highlight what changed (goals, new criteria, removed items, affected modules, etc.)\n   - Ask for confirmation before saving\n\n6. **Get user confirmation** before proceeding to implementation\n   - If confirmed, use the **implement** skill with the refined spec\n   - If not, ask if they want to refine further\n\n## Refinement Guidelines\n\n- **Preserve progress**: Don''t uncheck completed criteria unless they''re no longer valid\n- **Be additive when possible**: Add new criteria rather than rewriting existing ones\n- **Document changes**: Always add a timestamped note explaining what was refined and why\n- **Validate scope**: Check if refinements are expanding scope significantly - if so, suggest a new spec\n- **Validate modularity**: If the refinement introduces new module dependencies or widens the blast radius, flag it explicitly\n\n## Example Refinement Note\n\n```markdown\n## Notes\n\n**Refinement 2026-01-25**: Updated approach to use WebSocket instead of polling based on performance testing results. Added new acceptance criterion for connection handling. Blast radius unchanged — change is contained within the `transport` module.\n```\n\nRemember:\n- Keep refinements focused and minimal\n- Preserve the spec''s history through notes\n- Suggest new specs for major scope changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:28:39.980Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Assistant Agents like Claude Code needing advanced specification refinement capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级规格细化功能的代码助手代理，如 Claude Code。","ja":"Claude Code のような高度な仕様の精査機能を必要とするコードアシスタントエージェントに適しています。","ko":"클로드 코드와 같은 고급 사양 세부 정보 기능이 필요한 코드 조수 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes asistentes de código como Claude Code que necesitan capacidades de refinamiento de especificaciones avanzadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''assistance de code comme Claude Code nécessitant des capacités de raffinement de spécifications avancées.","de":"Ideal für Code-Assistenten-Agenten wie Claude Code, die erweiterte Spezifikationsverfeinerungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Assistente de Código, como Claude Code, que precisam de capacidades de refinamento de especificações avançadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-помощников кода, таких как Claude Code, которым требуются продвинутые возможности уточнения спецификаций.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مساعد الشفرة مثل Claude Code الذي يحتاج إلى تعريف مواصفات متقدم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to refine existing specifications using focused refinement questions, supporting spec-driven development with features like loading specs from `/specs/{feature}.md` and handling multiple spec matches, all while integrating with AI coding assistants through protocols like Markdown file analysis.","zh":"赋予代理通过专注的精化问题来完善现有的规格，支持通过特性如从 `/specs/{feature}.md` 加载规格和处理多个规格匹配来驱动开发，并通过协议如 Markdown 文件分析与 AI 编码助手集成。","ja":"エージェントに、焦点を当てた精査の質問を使用して既存の仕様を精査する機能を提供し、`/specs/{feature}.md` から仕様を読み込み、複数の仕様の一致を処理するなど、仕様駆動開発をサポートし、Markdown ファイル分析などのプロトコルを介して AI コーディング アシスタントと統合します。","ko":"대리人が焦점을 맞춘 세부 사항 질문을 사용하여 기존 사양을 세부적으로 분석할 수 있도록 하여 사양 구동 개발을 지원하고, `/specs/{feature}.md`에서 사양을 로드하고 여러 사양 일치를 처리하는 등의 기능을 제공하며, Markdown 파일 분석과 같은 프로토콜을 통해 AI 코딩 조수로 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a refinar las especificaciones existentes utilizando preguntas de refinamiento enfocadas, lo que admite el desarrollo impulsado por especificaciones con características como la carga de especificaciones desde `/specs/{feature}.md` y el manejo de varias coincidencias de especificaciones, todo mientras se integra con asistentes de codificación de IA a través de protocolos como el análisis de archivos Markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents de raffiner les spécifications existantes en utilisant des questions de raffinement ciblées, ce qui prend en charge le développement piloté par les spécifications avec des fonctionnalités comme le chargement des spécifications à partir de `/specs/{feature}.md` et la gestion de plusieurs correspondances de spécifications, le tout tout en s''intégrant avec les assistants de codage IA via des protocoles tels que l''analyse de fichiers Markdown.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, bestehende Spezifikationen mithilfe fokussierter Verfeinerungsfragen zu verfeinern, wodurch die spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklung mit Funktionen wie dem Laden von Spezifikationen aus `/specs/{feature}.md` und dem Umgang mit mehreren Spezifikationsübereinstimmungen unterstützt wird, während gleichzeitig die Integration mit AI-Coding-Assistenten über Protokolle wie die Analyse von Markdown-Dateien erfolgt.","pt":"Permite que os agentes refine as especificações existentes usando perguntas de refinamento focadas, apoiando o desenvolvimento orientado por especificações com recursos como carregar especificações de `/specs/{feature}.md` e lidar com várias correspondências de especificações, tudo isso integrando-se com assistentes de codificação de IA por meio de protocolos como análise de arquivos Markdown.","ru":"Позволяет агентам уточнять существующие спецификации с помощью сфокусированных вопросов уточнения, поддерживая разработку, ориентированную на спецификации, с функциями, такими как загрузка спецификаций из `/specs/{feature}.md` и обработка нескольких совпадений спецификаций, все это интегрируется с помощниками кодирования ИИ через протоколы, такие как анализ файлов Markdown.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تعريف المواصفات الحالية باستخدام أسئلة دقيقة، ودعم تطوير مواصفات التوجيه باستخدام ميزات مثل تحميل المواصفات من `/specs/{feature}.md` ومعالجة مطابقات المواصفات المتعددة، كل ذلك من خلال بروتوكولات مثل تحليل ملفات Markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Refining existing specifications based on user feedback","Loading and analyzing specs from designated directories","Asking targeted questions to clarify spec requirements"],"zh":["根据用户反馈完善现有的规格","从指定目录加载和分析规格","提出有针对性的问题以阐明规格要求"],"ja":["ユーザーのフィードバックに基づいて既存の仕様を精査する","指定されたディレクトリから仕様を読み込み分析する","仕様の要件を明確にするためにターゲットを絞った質問をする"],"ko":["사용자 피드백을 기반으로 기존 사양을 분석하는 것","지정된 디렉토리에서 사양을 로드하고 분석하는 것","사양 요구 사항을 명확히하기 위해 대상 질문을 하는 것"],"es":["Refinar las especificaciones existentes en función de la retroalimentación del usuario","Cargar y analizar las especificaciones desde directorios designados","Hacer preguntas dirigidas para aclarar los requisitos de las especificaciones"],"fr":["Raffiner les spécifications existantes en fonction des commentaires des utilisateurs","Charger et analyser les spécifications à partir de répertoires désignés","Poser des questions ciblées pour clarifier les exigences de spécification"],"de":["Bestehende Spezifikationen auf der Grundlage von Benutzerfeedback verfeinern","Spezifikationen aus bestimmten Verzeichnissen laden und analysieren","Gezielte Fragen stellen, um die Spezifikationsanforderungen zu klären"],"pt":["Refinamento de especificações existentes com base no feedback do usuário","Carregar e analisar especificações de diretórios designados","Fazer perguntas direcionadas para esclarecer requisitos de especificações"],"ru":["Уточнение существующих спецификаций на основе обратной связи пользователя","Загрузка и анализ спецификаций из назначенных каталогов","Задавание целевых вопросов для уточнения требований спецификаций"],"ar":["تعريف المواصفات الحالية بناءً على ملاحظات المستخدم","تحميل وتحليل المواصفات من الدلائل المحددة","الأسئلة المستهدفة لتوضيح متطلبات المواصفات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing specification files in Markdown format","Limited to refining specs within the `/specs/` directory hierarchy"],"zh":["需要现有的 Markdown 格式的规格文件","仅限于 `/specs/` 目录层次结构内的规格精化"],"ja":["既存の Markdown 形式の仕様ファイルが必要"," `/specs/` ディレクトリ階層内でのみ仕様の精査が可能"],"ko":["기존의 Markdown 형식의 사양 파일이 필요함"," `/specs/` 디렉토리 계층 구조 내에서만 사양 세부 사항 분석이 가능"],"es":["Requiere archivos de especificaciones existentes en formato Markdown","Limitado a la refinación de especificaciones dentro de la jerarquía del directorio `/specs/`"],"fr":["Nécessite des fichiers de spécification existants au format Markdown","Limité au raffinement des spécifications dans la hiérarchie du répertoire `/specs/`"],"de":["Benötigt bestehende Spezifikationsdateien im Markdown-Format","Begrenzt auf die Verfeinerung von Spezifikationen innerhalb der Verzeichnishierarchie `/specs/`"],"pt":["Exige arquivos de especificações existentes no formato Markdown","Limitado a refinar especificações dentro da hierarquia de diretórios `/specs/`"],"ru":["Требует существующих файлов спецификаций в формате Markdown","Ограничен уточнением спецификаций внутри иерархии каталогов `/specs/`"],"ar":["يتطلب ملفات مواصفات موجودة بالفعل بالتنسيق Markdown","محدود بتحسين المواصفات داخل هيكل الدلائل `/specs/`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a465c272f8953ae45cdd237db0de329b3422998f3c7885de9bf0c62c219c7ae2","qualityScore":51}');
