ion financière dans les environnements Pulumi","Interface en ligne de commande pour la présentation financière","Simplification des tâches de gestion financière","Intégration avec les outils de développement","Support pour plusieurs formats de présentation"],"de":["Finanzmanagement in Pulumi-Umgebungen","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle für Finanzpräsentation","Vereinfachung der Finanzmanagement-Aufgaben","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für mehrere Präsentationsformate"],"pt":["Gerenciamento financeiro em ambientes Pulumi","Ferramenta de linha de comando para apresentação financeira","Integração com o ecossistema Pulumi","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de arquivo","Personalização de relatórios financeiros"],"ru":["Финансовое управление в среде Pulumi","ИИ Агент для финансовой презентации","Интеграция с экосистемой Pulumi","Поддержка нескольких форматов файлов","Настройка финансовых отчетов"],"ar":["إدارة العرض المالي في بيئة Pulumi","أداة سطر أوامر للعرض المالي","التكامل مع بيئة Pulumi","دعم تنسيقات الملفات المتعددة","تخصيص تقارير مالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Finfocus-dev","Pulumi","金融演示","金融管理","CLI","AI工具","如何使用Finfocus-dev","Finfocus-dev替代品","Finfocus-dev安装"],"ja":["Finfocus-dev","Pulumi","金融プレゼンテーション","金融管理","CLI","AIエージェント","Finfocus-devの使い方","Finfocus-devの代替","Finfocus-devの設定"],"ko":["Finfocus-dev","Pulumi","금융 프레젠테이션","금융 관리","CLI","AI 에이전트","Finfocus-dev 사용법","Finfocus-dev 대체","Finfocus-dev 설치 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar Finfocus-dev","qué es Finfocus-dev","herramientas de AI para finanzas","Finfocus-dev alternativa","Finfocus-dev vs otras herramientas","instalación de Finfocus-dev","guía de configuración de Finfocus-dev"],"fr":["comment utiliser Finfocus-dev","qu''est-ce que Finfocus-dev","outils IA pour la finance","Finfocus-dev alternative","Finfocus-dev vs autres outils","installation de Finfocus-dev","guide de configuration de Finfocus-dev"],"de":["wie man Finfocus-dev verwendet","was ist Finfocus-dev","KI-Tools für Finanzen","Finfocus-dev-Alternative","Finfocus-dev vs andere Tools","Installation von Finfocus-dev","Setup-Anleitung für Finfocus-dev"],"pt":["como usar Finfocus-dev","o que é Finfocus-dev","Finfocus-dev vs outras ferramentas","instalar Finfocus-dev","guia de configuração do Finfocus-dev","ferramentas de apresentação financeira","gerenciamento financeiro em Pulumi","desenvolvimento de software com Finfocus-dev"],"ru":["как использовать Finfocus-dev","что такое Finfocus-dev","Finfocus-dev vs другие инструменты","установить Finfocus-dev","руководство по настройке Finfocus-dev","инструменты финансовой презентации","финансовое управление в Pulumi","разработка программного обеспечения с Finfocus-dev"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Finfocus-dev","ما هو Finfocus-dev","Finfocus-dev مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت Finfocus-dev","دليل إعداد Finfocus-dev","أدوات العرض المالي","إدارة العرض المالي في Pulumi","تطوير البرمجيات مع Finfocus-dev"]}},"owner":"rshade","repo":"finfocus","repoPath":"rshade/finfocus","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.902Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"finfocus-dev","description":">","bodyPreview":"# FinFocus Development Workflow\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```bash\nmake build          # Build binary to bin/finfocus\nmake test           # Unit tests (fast, default)\nmake lint           # golangci-lint + markdownlint (5+ min, use extended timeout)\nmake validate       # go mod tidy + go vet\nmake test-race      # Race detector\nmake test-integration  # Cross-component tests (10min timeout)\nmake build-all      # Build binary + all plugins\n```\n\n**Critical rules**: Always run `make lint` and `make test` be","body":"# FinFocus Development Workflow\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```bash\nmake build          # Build binary to bin/finfocus\nmake test           # Unit tests (fast, default)\nmake lint           # golangci-lint + markdownlint (5+ min, use extended timeout)\nmake validate       # go mod tidy + go vet\nmake test-race      # Race detector\nmake test-integration  # Cross-component tests (10min timeout)\nmake build-all      # Build binary + all plugins\n```\n\n**Critical rules**: Always run `make lint` and `make test` before claiming success.\nNever run `git commit` (user commits manually). Never modify `.golangci.yml`.\n\n## Adding a CLI Command\n\n1. Create `internal/cli/your_command.go`\n1. Follow constructor pattern:\n\n```go\nfunc NewYourCmd() *cobra.Command {\n    var flagVar string\n    cmd := &cobra.Command{\n        Use:   \"your-command\",\n        Short: \"Description\",\n        RunE: func(cmd *cobra.Command, args []string) error {\n            // Use cmd.Printf() not fmt.Printf()\n            return nil\n        },\n    }\n    cmd.Flags().StringVar(&flagVar, \"flag\", \"\", \"description\")\n    return cmd\n}\n```\n\n1. Register in parent command (e.g., `root.go` or `cost.go`)\n1. Use `RunE` (not `Run`) for error handling\n1. Defer cleanup immediately: `defer cleanup()`\n\n## Resource Processing Pipeline\n\nAll cost commands follow:\n\n```text\ningest.LoadPulumiPlan(path) -> ingest.MapResources() -> registry.Open(ctx, adapter)\n  -> engine.GetProjectedCost/GetActualCost() -> engine.RenderResults(format, results)\n```\n\n## Testing Standards\n\n- Use `testify/assert` and `testify/require` exclusively (never manual `if/t.Errorf`)\n- `require.*` for setup that must succeed; `assert.*` for value checks\n- Table-driven tests for variations\n- Package suffix `_test` for black-box testing\n- `t.TempDir()` for temporary files (auto-cleanup)\n- Capture output: `cmd.SetOut(&buf)` and `cmd.SetErr(&buf)`\n- Target 80% coverage minimum, 95% for critical paths\n\nSee [references/testing-patterns.md](references/testing-patterns.md) for detailed\ntest patterns and examples.\n\n## Project Structure\n\nSee [references/project-structure.md](references/project-structure.md) for the\ncomplete package map and key file locations.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- Wrap errors: `fmt.Errorf(\"context: %w\", err)`\n- Return early on errors\n- Plugin failures don''t stop processing (graceful degradation)\n- Validation prefix: `\"VALIDATION: %v\"`, plugin error prefix: `\"ERROR:\"`\n\n## Logging (zerolog)\n\n```go\nlog := logging.FromContext(ctx)\nlog.Debug().Ctx(ctx).Str(\"component\", \"engine\").Msg(\"message\")\n```\n\nStandard fields: `trace_id`, `component`, `operation`, `duration_ms`.\nEnable debug: `--debug` flag or `FINFOCUS_LOG_LEVEL=debug`.\n\n## Date Handling\n\nSupport both `\"2006-01-02\"` and RFC3339. Default `--to` to `time.Now()`.\nValidate ranges (to must be after from).\n\n## Output Formats\n\nThree formats via `--output` flag: `table` (default), `json`, `ndjson`.\nAlways use `cmd.Printf()` for testability.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:57:21.668Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for CLI Agents needing comprehensive financial presentation and management in a Pulumi Environment","zh":"非常适合需要在Pulumi环境中进行全面财务呈现和管理的CLI代理","ja":"Pulumi Environmentで包括的な財務プレゼンテーションと管理が必要なCLIエージェントに最適","ko":"Pulumi 환경에서 포괄적인 재무 프레젠테이션 및 관리가 필요한 CLI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes CLI que necesitan presentación y gestión financiera integral en un entorno Pulumi","fr":"Parfait pour les agents CLI nécessitant une présentation et une gestion financière complètes dans un environnement Pulumi","de":"Perfekt für CLI-Agents, die eine umfassende finanzielle Präsentation und Verwaltung in einer Pulumi-Umgebung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes CLI que necessitam de apresentação e gerenciamento financeiro abrangente em um Ambiente Pulumi","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов CLI, которым требуется комплексная финансовая презентация и управление в среде Pulumi","ar":"مثالي لعميل CLI الذي يحتاج إلى عرض وتحكم مالي شامل في بيئة Pulumi"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build and test FinFocus binaries, leveraging golangci-lint, markdownlint, and go mod tidy for robust financial data analysis and validation via make commands like make build, make test, and make lint","zh":"赋予代理构建和测试FinFocus二进制文件的能力，利用golangci-lint、markdownlint和go mod tidy进行强大的财务数据分析和验证，通过make命令如make build、make test和make lint","ja":"エージェントがFinFocusバイナリを構築してテストする機能を提供し、golangci-lint、markdownlint、go mod tidyを利用して強力な財務データ分析と検証を実行し、makeコマンド seperti make build、make test、make lint","ko":"에이전트가 FinFocus 바이너리를 빌드하고 테스트할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, golangci-lint, markdownlint 및 go mod tidy를 사용하여 강력한 재무 데이터 분석 및 검증을 수행하며, make build, make test 및 make lint와 같은 make 명령어","es":"Habilita a los agentes a compilar y probar binarios de FinFocus, aprovechando golangci-lint, markdownlint y go mod tidy para un análisis y validación robustos de datos financieros a través de comandos make como make build, make test y make lint","fr":"Permet aux agents de compiler et de tester des binaires FinFocus, en exploitant golangci-lint, markdownlint et go mod tidy pour une analyse et une validation robustes des données financières via des commandes make comme make build, make test et make lint","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, FinFocus-Binaries zu erstellen und zu testen, indem sie golangci-lint, markdownlint und go mod tidy für eine robuste Analyse und Validierung von Finanzdaten über make-Befehle wie make build, make test und make lint nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir e testar binários FinFocus, utilizando golangci-lint, markdownlint e go mod tidy para análise e validação robusta de dados financeiros via comandos make como make build, make test e make lint","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и тестировать бинарные файлы FinFocus, используя golangci-lint, markdownlint и go mod tidy для прочной аналитики и проверки финансовых данных через команды make, такие как make build, make test и make lint","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء وتجربة ثنائيات FinFocus، باستخدام golangci-lint و markdownlint و go mod tidy من أجل تحليل وتصديق بيانات مالية قوي عبر أوامر make مثل make build و make test و make lint"},"useCases":{"en":["Building FinFocus binaries for financial data visualization","Validating financial presentation code with golangci-lint and markdownlint","Automating unit tests and integration tests for FinFocus"],"zh":["为财务数据可视化构建FinFocus二进制文件","使用golangci-lint和markdownlint验证财务呈现代码","自动化FinFocus的单元测试和集成测试"],"ja":["財務データの視覚化のためにFinFocusバイナリを構築する","golangci-lintとmarkdownlintを使用して財務プレゼンテーションコードを検証する","FinFocusのユニットテストと統合テストを自動化する"],"ko":["재무 데이터 시각화를 위한 FinFocus 바이너리 빌드","golangci-lint 및 markdownlint를 사용한 재무 프레젠테이션 코드 검증","FinFocus의 유닛 테스트 및 통합 테스트 자동화"],"es":["Construir binarios de FinFocus para la visualización de datos financieros","Validar el código de presentación financiera con golangci-lint y markdownlint","Automatizar pruebas unitarias y de integración para FinFocus"],"fr":["Construire des binaires FinFocus pour la visualisation de données financières","Valider le code de présentation financière avec golangci-lint et markdownlint","Automatiser les tests unitaires et d''intégration pour FinFocus"],"de":["Erstellen von FinFocus-Binaries für die Visualisierung von Finanzdaten","Validieren des Finanzpräsentationscodes mit golangci-lint und markdownlint","Automatisieren von Einheitstests und Integrationstests für FinFocus"],"pt":["Construir binários FinFocus para visualização de dados financeiros","Validar código de apresentação financeira com golangci-lint e markdownlint","Automatizar testes unitários e integração para FinFocus"],"ru":["Создание бинарных файлов FinFocus для визуализации финансовых данных","Проверка кода финансовой презентации с помощью golangci-lint и markdownlint","Автоматизация юнит-тестов и интеграционных тестов для FinFocus"],"ar":["بناء ثنائيات FinFocus لعرض البيانات المالية","التحقق من صحة رمز العرض المالي باستخدام golangci-lint و markdownlint","توفير اختبارات الوحدات واختبارات التكامل للبرنامج FinFocus"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Pulumi Environment setup","Dependent on Go programming language and make command-line tooling"],"zh":["需要Pulumi Environment设置","依赖于Go编程语言和make命令行工具"],"ja":["Pulumi Environmentの設定が必要","Goプログラミング言語とmakeコマンドラインツールへの依存"],"ko":["Pulumi 환경 설정 필요","Go 프로그래밍 언어 및 make 명령줄 도구에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración de entorno Pulumi","Dependiente del lenguaje de programación Go y de la herramienta de línea de comandos make"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de l''environnement Pulumi","Dépendant du langage de programmation Go et de l''outil de ligne de commande make"],"de":["Benötigt Pulumi-Umgebungssetup","Abhängig von der Programmiersprache Go und der make-Kommandozeilen-Tooling"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Ambiente Pulumi","Dependente da linguagem de programação Go e da ferramenta de linha de comando make"],"ru":["Требуется настройка среды Pulumi","Зависит от языка программирования Go и инструмента командной строки make"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد بيئة Pulumi","يعتمد على لغة البرمجة Go وأداة سطر الأوامر make"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1050581098f50c06be488033a630bcb4abf850ecd07296b1afac9bf99481ffa1","qualityScore":51}');
