che"],"pt":["Ferramenta de AI simples para Mac","Escrita em Swift","Suportada em macOS 14+ Sonoma","Solução nativa para entrada de texto em vietnamita","Fácil de usar e instalar"],"ru":["Простой инструмент ИИ для macOS","Написанный на Swift","Поддерживаемый в macOS 14+ Sonoma","Родное решение для ввода текста на вьетнамском языке","Легко использовать и устанавливать"],"ar":["أداة ذكاء اصطناعي بسيطة للماك","مكتوبة بلغة Swift","مدعومة في macOS 14+ Sonoma","حل أصلي لإدخال النص باللغة الفيتنامية","سهل الاستخدام والتركيب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","release-app","中文输入法","Swift","macOS 14+ Sonoma","如何使用release-app","release-app安装","release-app设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","release-app","ベトナム語入力法","Swift","macOS 14+ Sonoma","release-appの使い方","release-appのインストール","release-appの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","release-app","베트남어 입력기","Swift","macOS 14+ Sonoma","release-app 사용법","release-app 설치","release-app 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para macOS","release-app alternative","cómo usar release-app","release-app vs otras herramientas","instalación de release-app","guía de configuración de release-app","desarrollo de aplicaciones para macOS","herramientas de código abierto para macOS"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour macOS","release-app alternative","comment utiliser release-app","release-app vs d''autres outils","installation de release-app","guide de configuration de release-app","développement d''applications pour macOS","outils open source pour macOS"],"de":["KI-Tools für macOS","release-app Alternative","wie man release-app verwendet","release-app vs andere Tools","Installation von release-app","Konfigurationsanleitung für release-app","Entwicklung von Anwendungen für macOS","Open-Source-Tools für macOS"],"pt":["ferramentas de AI para Mac","release-app alternative","como usar release-app","o que é release-app","instalar release-app","guias de setup para release-app"],"ru":["инструменты ИИ для macOS","release-app альтернатива","как использовать release-app","что такое release-app","установить release-app","руководства по настройке release-app"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للماك","release-app بديل","كيفية استخدام release-app","ما هو release-app","تركيب release-app","دليل إعداد release-app"]}},"owner":"khanhicetea","repo":"Caffee","repoPath":"khanhicetea/Caffee","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.916Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release-app","description":"Automate the release process for Caffee app.","bodyPreview":"## Instructions\n\nWhen the user invokes this skill with an app path:\n\n1. **Extract version from filename**\n   - The app filename format is `Caffee-v{VERSION}.app` (e.g., `Caffee-v1.18.0.app`)\n   - Extract the version string including the ''v'' prefix (e.g., `v1.18.0`)\n   - Also extract just the number part for display (e.g., `1.18.0`)\n\n2. **Verify the app exists**\n   - Check if the provided app path exists\n   - If not, report error and stop\n\n3. **Rename app to Caffee.app**\n   - Copy/rename the app","body":"## Instructions\n\nWhen the user invokes this skill with an app path:\n\n1. **Extract version from filename**\n   - The app filename format is `Caffee-v{VERSION}.app` (e.g., `Caffee-v1.18.0.app`)\n   - Extract the version string including the ''v'' prefix (e.g., `v1.18.0`)\n   - Also extract just the number part for display (e.g., `1.18.0`)\n\n2. **Verify the app exists**\n   - Check if the provided app path exists\n   - If not, report error and stop\n\n3. **Rename app to Caffee.app**\n   - Copy/rename the app to `Caffee.app` in the same directory\n   - This ensures consistent naming when users install the app\n   - Example: `cp -R ~/Documents/Caffee-v1.18.0 ~/Documents/Caffee.app`\n\n4. **Create DMG**\n   - Run: `create-dmg Caffee.app .` (use the renamed Caffee.app)  (use which for get path)\n   - This creates a DMG in the current directory\n   - Rename the output to `Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg` (e.g., `Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg`)\n   - Clean up: remove the temporary Caffee.app copy\n\n5. **Sign the DMG**\n   - Run: `sign_update Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg` (use which for get path)\n   - Capture the output which contains:\n     - `sparkle:edSignature=\"...\"`\n     - `length=\"...\"`\n   - Parse and extract the signature and file size\n\n6. **Get file size and checksum**\n   - Get file size: `stat -f%z Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg`\n   - Get SHA256 checksum: `shasum -a 256 Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg`\n\n7. **Update web/appcast.xml**\n   - Add a new `<item>` element at the top of the channel (before existing items)\n   - Use current date in RFC 2822 format for pubDate\n   - The download URL format: `https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/{VERSION}/Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg`\n   - Include the signature and length from sign_update output\n   - If release notes provided, use them; otherwise generate from git log since previous version\n   - the <sparkle:version> should be integer, e.g., 11901 (1.19.1 => 1*10000 + 19*100 + 1)\n\n8. **Update web/index.html**\n   - Update the download button version text and link\n   - Add new release notes entry in the Release Notes section with checksum\n   - Release notes (changelogs) translate into Vietnamese\n\n9. **Update web/download.html**\n   - Update the meta refresh URL to point to the new DMG release\n   - Update the direct download link in the body\n   - URL format: `https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/{VERSION}/Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg`\n\n10. **Summary**\n   - Show summary of what was done\n   - Show the DMG path for upload to GitHub\n   - Remind user to:\n     - Upload DMG to GitHub releases at the tag `{VERSION}`\n     - Deploy updated web files\n\n## Example appcast.xml item format\n\n```xml\n<item>\n  <title>Version 1.18.0</title>\n  <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>\n  <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.18.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>\n  <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jan 2026 12:00:00 +0700</pubDate>\n  <enclosure\n    url=\"https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/v1.18.0/Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg\"\n    sparkle:edSignature=\"SIGNATURE_HERE\"\n    length=\"12345678\"\n    type=\"application/octet-stream\"\n  />\n  <description><![CDATA[\n    <h2>What''s New</h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Release notes here</li>\n    </ul>\n  ]]></description>\n</item>\n```\n\n## Example index.html updates\n\nDownload button (around line 64):\n```html\n<button class=\"secondary\" onclick=\"location.href=''/download.html?v=1.18.0''\">\n    Tải app tại đây (v1.18.0)\n</button>\n```\n\nRelease notes section (after line 240):\n```html\n<div>\n    <h5>v1.18.0</h5>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Checksum sha256 (Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg) :\n            <code>CHECKSUM_HERE</code>\n        </li>\n        <li>Release notes here</li>\n    </ul>\n    <hr />\n</div>\n```\n\n## Example download.html updates\n\nMeta refresh tag (line 9):\n```html\n<meta\n    http-equiv=\"refresh\"\n    content=\"2; URL=https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/v1.18.0/Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg\"\n/>\n```\n\nDirect download link (line 24):\n```html\n<a\n    href=\"https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/v1.18.0/Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg\"\n    >bấm vào đây để tải ngay</a\n>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:03:13.489Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for macOS-focused Agents needing automated app release management with Swift compatibility.","zh":"非常适合需要自动应用程序发布管理并兼容Swift的macOS专用Agent。","ja":"Swiftとの互換性を備えた自動アプリのリリース管理が必要なmacOS専用のエージェントに最適です。","ko":"스위프트와 호환되는 자동 앱 릴리즈 관리가 필요한 macOS 전용 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes centrados en macOS que necesitan una gestión automática de lanzamiento de aplicaciones con compatibilidad con Swift.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents axés sur macOS nécessitant une gestion automatisée de publication d''applications avec une compatibilité Swift.","de":"Perfekt für macOS-fokussierte Agenten, die eine automatisierte App-Release-Verwaltung mit Swift-Kompatibilität benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agents focados em macOS que necessitam de gerenciamento de lançamento de aplicativos automatizado com compatibilidade com Swift.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на macOS, которым требуется автоматизированное управление выпуском приложений с совместимостью Swift.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على macOS والذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة إصدار تطبيقات آلية مع توافق Swift."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract version information from filenames, verify app existence, and rename apps to a standardized format, leveraging macOS 14+ Sonoma support and Swift programming.","zh":"赋予代理从文件名中提取版本信息、验证应用程序存在性以及使用macOS 14+ Sonoma支持和Swift编程将应用程序重命名为标准化格式的能力。","ja":"macOS 14+ SonomaのサポートとSwiftプログラミングを利用して、ファイル名からバージョン情報を抽出する、アプリの存在を確認する、アプリを標準化された形式に名前を変更するエージェントの能力を可能にします。","ko":"macOS 14+ Sonoma 지원과 스위프트 프로그래밍을 활용하여 파일 이름에서 버전 정보를 추출하고, 앱 존재를 확인하며, 앱을 표준화된 형식으로 이름을 변경하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer información de versión de nombres de archivos, verificar la existencia de aplicaciones y renombrar aplicaciones a un formato estandarizado, aprovechando el soporte de macOS 14+ Sonoma y la programación Swift.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire des informations de version à partir de noms de fichiers, de vérifier l''existence d''applications et de renommer des applications dans un format standardisé, en exploitant le support de macOS 14+ Sonoma et la programmation Swift.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Versionsinformationen aus Dateinamen zu extrahieren, die Existenz von Apps zu überprüfen und Apps in ein standardisiertes Format umzubenennen, indem es die Unterstützung von macOS 14+ Sonoma und die Swift-Programmierung nutzt.","pt":"Permite que os agentes extraiam informações de versão de nomes de arquivos, verifiquem a existência de aplicativos e renomeiem aplicativos para um formato padronizado, aproveitando o suporte do macOS 14+ Sonoma e a programação Swift.","ru":"Позволяет агентам извлекать информацию о версии из имен файлов, проверять существование приложений и переименовывать приложения в стандартный формат, используя поддержку macOS 14+ Sonoma и программирование на Swift.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء استخراج معلومات الإصدار من أسماء الملفات والتحقق من وجود التطبيقات وإعادة تسمية التطبيقات إلى تنسيق معياري ، مستفيدة من دعم macOS 14+ Sonoma وبرمجة Swift."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating app version extraction for release notes","Verifying app existence before deployment","Renaming apps to a consistent format for easier management"],"zh":["自动为发布说明提取应用程序版本信息","部署前验证应用程序存在性","将应用程序重命名为一致的格式以便于管理"],"ja":["リリースノートの自動アプリバージョン抽出","デプロイ前のアプリ存在確認","一貫した形式にアプリを名前変更して管理を容易にする"],"ko":["릴리즈 노트를 위한 자동 앱 버전 추출","배포 전 앱 존재 확인","관리하기 쉽도록 일관된 형식으로 앱 이름 변경"],"es":["Automatizar la extracción de versión de aplicaciones para notas de lanzamiento","Verificar la existencia de aplicaciones antes de la implementación","Renombrar aplicaciones a un formato coherente para una gestión más sencilla"],"fr":["Automatiser l''extraction de version d''applications pour les notes de publication","Vérifier l''existence d''applications avant le déploiement","Renommer des applications dans un format cohérent pour une gestion plus facile"],"de":["Automatisieren der Versionsextraktion von Apps für Versionshinweise","Überprüfen der Existenz von Apps vor der Bereitstellung","Umbenennen von Apps in ein konsistentes Format für eine einfachere Verwaltung"],"pt":["Automatizar a extração da versão do aplicativo para notas de lançamento","Verificar a existência do aplicativo antes da implantação","Renomear aplicativos para um formato consistente para facilitar a gestão"],"ru":["Автоматизировать извлечение версии приложения для заметок о выпуске","Проверить существование приложения перед развертыванием","Переименовать приложения в последовательный формат для легкого управления"],"ar":["تأتمتة استخراج إصدار التطبيق لملاحظات الإصدار","التحقق من وجود التطبيق قبل النشر","إعادة تسمية التطبيقات إلى تنسيق متسق لتسهيل الإدارة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires macOS 14+ Sonoma or later","Limited to apps with filenames in the ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app'' format"],"zh":["需要macOS 14+ Sonoma或更高版本","仅限文件名为''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app''格式的应用程序"],"ja":["macOS 14+ Sonoma以降が必要","ファイル名が''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app''形式のアプリのみ"],"ko":["macOS 14+ Sonoma 이상이 필요","파일 이름이 ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app'' 형식인 앱만 해당"],"es":["Requiere macOS 14+ Sonoma o posterior","Limitado a aplicaciones con nombres de archivos en el formato ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app''"],"fr":["Nécessite macOS 14+ Sonoma ou ultérieur","Limité aux applications avec des noms de fichiers au format ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app''"],"de":["Erfordert macOS 14+ Sonoma oder neuer","Begrenzt auf Apps mit Dateinamen im Format ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app''"],"pt":["Requer macOS 14+ Sonoma ou posterior","Limitado a aplicativos com nomes de arquivos no formato ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app''"],"ru":["Требуется macOS 14+ Sonoma или позже","Ограничен для приложений с именами файлов в формате ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app''"],"ar":["يتطلب macOS 14+ Sonoma أو لاحقًا","محدود للتطبيقات بأسماء الملفات بتنسيق ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app''"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"da33f480e83f445743b747f591fa0ae23bbbc90f0144a7f6fe0295429c1bb4ac","qualityScore":51}');
