频连接多模态LLM教程","TypeScript库连接Mux视频到多模态LLM"],"ja":["Mux動画をマルチモーダルLLMに接続する方法","AIエージェントとは","Mux動画をマルチモーダルLLMに接続するライブラリ","AIエージェントツール","Mux動画をマルチモーダルLLMに接続するチュートリアル","TypeScriptライブラリを使用してMux動画をマルチモーダルLLMに接続"],"ko":["Mux 비디오를 멀티모달 LLM에 연결하는 방법","AI 에이전트란","Mux 비디오를 멀티모달 LLM에 연결하는 라이브러리","AI 에이전트 도구","Mux 비디오를 멀티모달 LLM에 연결하는 튜토리얼","TypeScript 라이브러리를 사용하여 Mux 비디오를 멀티모달 LLM에 연결"],"es":["herramientas de AI","biblioteca de TypeScript","Mux","LLMs multi-modales","cómo usar develop-ai-functions-example","alternativas a develop-ai-functions-example","instalación de develop-ai-functions-example","guía de configuración de develop-ai-functions-example"],"fr":["outils IA","bibliothèque TypeScript","Mux","LLMs multi-modaux","comment utiliser develop-ai-functions-example","alternatives à develop-ai-functions-example","installation de develop-ai-functions-example","guide de configuration de develop-ai-functions-example"],"de":["KI-Tools","TypeScript-Bibliothek","Mux","multi-modale LLMs","wie man develop-ai-functions-example verwendet","alternativen zu develop-ai-functions-example","installation von develop-ai-functions-example","konfigurationsanleitung für develop-ai-functions-example"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","biblioteca typescript","mux","llm","desenvolvimento de ia","como usar mux","o que é llm","alternativa ao mux","configuração do mux"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","typescript библиотека","mux","llm","разработка ИИ","как использовать mux","что такое llm","альтернатива mux","настройка mux"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مكتبة TypeScript","mux","llm","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام mux","ما هي llm","بديل لموكس","إعداد موكس"]}},"owner":"muxinc","repo":"ai","repoPath":"muxinc/ai","stars":57,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T18:53:02Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"develop-ai-functions-example","description":"Develop examples for AI SDK functions. Use when creating, running, or modifying examples under examples/ai-functions/src to validate provider support, demonstrate features, or create test fixtures.","bodyPreview":"## AI Functions Examples\n\nThe `examples/ai-functions/` directory contains scripts for validating, testing, and iterating on AI SDK functions across providers.\n\n## Example Categories\n\nExamples are organized by AI SDK function in `examples/ai-functions/src/`:\n\n| Directory          | Purpose                                              |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `generate-text/`   | Non-streaming text generation with `generateText()`  |\n| `stre","body":"## AI Functions Examples\n\nThe `examples/ai-functions/` directory contains scripts for validating, testing, and iterating on AI SDK functions across providers.\n\n## Example Categories\n\nExamples are organized by AI SDK function in `examples/ai-functions/src/`:\n\n| Directory          | Purpose                                              |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `generate-text/`   | Non-streaming text generation with `generateText()`  |\n| `stream-text/`     | Streaming text generation with `streamText()`        |\n| `generate-object/` | Structured output generation with `generateObject()` |\n| `stream-object/`   | Streaming structured output with `streamObject()`    |\n| `agent/`           | `ToolLoopAgent` examples for agentic workflows       |\n| `embed/`           | Single embedding generation with `embed()`           |\n| `embed-many/`      | Batch embedding generation with `embedMany()`        |\n| `generate-image/`  | Image generation with `generateImage()`              |\n| `generate-speech/` | Text-to-speech with `generateSpeech()`               |\n| `transcribe/`      | Audio transcription with `transcribe()`              |\n| `rerank/`          | Document reranking with `rerank()`                   |\n| `middleware/`      | Custom middleware implementations                    |\n| `registry/`        | Provider registry setup and usage                    |\n| `telemetry/`       | OpenTelemetry integration                            |\n| `complex/`         | Multi-component examples (agents, routers)           |\n| `lib/`             | Shared utilities (not examples)                      |\n| `tools/`           | Reusable tool definitions                            |\n\n## File Naming Convention\n\nExamples follow the pattern: `{provider}-{feature}.ts`\n\n| Pattern                                  | Example                                    | Description                |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| `{provider}.ts`                          | `openai.ts`                                | Basic provider usage       |\n| `{provider}-{feature}.ts`                | `openai-tool-call.ts`                      | Specific feature           |\n| `{provider}-{sub-provider}.ts`           | `amazon-bedrock-anthropic.ts`              | Provider with sub-provider |\n| `{provider}-{sub-provider}-{feature}.ts` | `google-vertex-anthropic-cache-control.ts` | Sub-provider with feature  |\n\n## Example Structure\n\nAll examples use the `run()` wrapper from `lib/run.ts` which:\n\n- Loads environment variables from `.env`\n- Provides error handling with detailed API error logging\n\n### Basic Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from \"@ai-sdk/provider-name\";\nimport { generateText } from \"ai\";\n\nimport { run } from \"../lib/run\";\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = await generateText({\n    model: providerName(\"model-id\"),\n    prompt: \"Your prompt here.\",\n  });\n\n  console.warn(result.text);\n  console.warn(\"Token usage:\", result.usage);\n  console.warn(\"Finish reason:\", result.finishReason);\n});\n```\n\n### Streaming Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from \"@ai-sdk/provider-name\";\nimport { streamText } from \"ai\";\n\nimport { printFullStream } from \"../lib/print-full-stream\";\nimport { run } from \"../lib/run\";\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = streamText({\n    model: providerName(\"model-id\"),\n    prompt: \"Your prompt here.\",\n  });\n\n  await printFullStream({ result });\n});\n```\n\n### Tool Calling Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from \"@ai-sdk/provider-name\";\nimport { generateText, tool } from \"ai\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\n\nimport { run } from \"../lib/run\";\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = await generateText({\n    model: providerName(\"model-id\"),\n    tools: {\n      myTool: tool({\n        description: \"Tool description\",\n        inputSchema: z.object({\n          param: z.string().describe(\"Parameter description\"),\n        }),\n        execute: async ({ param }) => {\n          return { result: `Processed: ${param}` };\n        },\n      }),\n    },\n    prompt: \"Use the tool to...\",\n  });\n\n  console.warn(JSON.stringify(result, null, 2));\n});\n```\n\n### Structured Output Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from \"@ai-sdk/provider-name\";\nimport { generateObject } from \"ai\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\n\nimport { run } from \"../lib/run\";\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = await generateObject({\n    model: providerName(\"model-id\"),\n    schema: z.object({\n      name: z.string(),\n      items: z.array(z.string()),\n    }),\n    prompt: \"Generate a...\",\n  });\n\n  console.warn(JSON.stringify(result.object, null, 2));\n  console.warn(\"Token usage:\", result.usage);\n});\n```\n\n## Running Examples\n\nFrom the `examples/ai-functions` directory:\n\n```bash\npnpm tsx src/generate-text/openai.ts\npnpm tsx src/stream-text/openai-tool-call.ts\npnpm tsx src/agent/openai-generate.ts\n```\n\n## When to Write Examples\n\nWrite examples when:\n\n1. **Adding a new provider**: Create basic examples for each supported API (`generateText`, `streamText`, `generateObject`, etc.)\n\n2. **Implementing a new feature**: Demonstrate the feature with at least one provider example\n\n3. **Reproducing a bug**: Create an example that shows the issue for debugging\n\n4. **Adding provider-specific options**: Show how to use `providerOptions` for provider-specific settings\n\n5. **Creating test fixtures**: Use examples to generate API response fixtures (see `capture-api-response-test-fixture` skill)\n\n## Utility Helpers\n\nThe `lib/` directory contains shared utilities:\n\n| File                   | Purpose                                                  |\n| ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `run.ts`               | Error-handling wrapper with `.env` loading               |\n| `print.ts`             | Clean object printing (removes undefined values)         |\n| `print-full-stream.ts` | Colored streaming output for tool calls, reasoning, text |\n| `save-raw-chunks.ts`   | Save streaming chunks for test fixtures                  |\n| `present-image.ts`     | Display images in terminal                               |\n| `save-audio.ts`        | Save audio files to disk                                 |\n\n### Using print utilities\n\n```typescript\nimport { print } from \"../lib/print\";\n\n// Pretty print objects without undefined values\nprint(\"Result:\", result);\nprint(\"Usage:\", result.usage, { depth: 2 });\n```\n\n### Using printFullStream\n\n```typescript\n// import { printFullStream } from ''../lib/print-full-stream'';\n\n// const result = streamText({ ... });\n// await printFullStream({ result }); // Colored output for text, tool calls, reasoning\n```\n\n## Reusable Tools\n\nThe `tools/` directory contains reusable tool definitions:\n\n```typescript\nimport { weatherTool } from \"../tools/weather-tool\";\n\nconst result = await generateText({\n  model: openai(\"gpt-4o\"),\n  tools: { weather: weatherTool },\n  prompt: \"What is the weather in San Francisco?\",\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Keep examples focused**: Each example should demonstrate one feature or use case\n\n2. **Use descriptive prompts**: Make it clear what the example is testing\n\n3. **Handle errors gracefully**: The `run()` wrapper handles this automatically\n\n4. **Use realistic model IDs**: Use actual model IDs that work with the provider\n\n5. **Add comments for complex logic**: Explain non-obvious code patterns\n\n6. **Reuse tools when appropriate**: Use `weatherTool` or create new reusable tools in `tools/`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:30:05.659Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for TypeScript-based AI Agent Developers working with multimodal video and language models.","zh":"适合使用TypeScript开发的AI Agent开发人员，特别是那些处理多模态视频和语言模型的开发人员。","ja":"TypeScriptベースのAIエージェント開発者、特に多モーダルビデオと言語モデルを扱う開発者に最適です。","ko":"TypeScript 기반 AI 에이전트 개발자에게 적합하며, 특히 멀티모달 비디오 및 언어 모델을 처리하는 개발자를 위해 설계되었습니다.","es":"Ideal para desarrolladores de Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial basados en TypeScript que trabajan con modelos de video y lenguaje multimodales.","fr":"Idéal pour les développeurs d''Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle basés sur TypeScript travaillant avec des modèles de vidéo et de langage multimodaux.","de":"Ideal für auf TypeScript basierende Entwickler von KI-Agents, die mit multimodalen Video- und Sprachmodellen arbeiten.","pt":"Ideal para desenvolvedores de Agentes de IA baseados em TypeScript que trabalham com modelos de vídeo e linguagem multimodais.","ru":"Идеально для разработчиков агентов ИИ на основе TypeScript, работающих с многомодальными видео- и языковыми моделями.","ar":"مثالي لمطوري وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المستندة إلى TypeScript الذين يعملون مع نماذج فيديو ولغة متعددة التحديثات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct integration between Mux video assets and AI providers through the AI SDK''s generateText() function. Provides structured examples for validating and testing multi-modal LLM connections with streaming and non-streaming text generation capabilities.","zh":"通过AI SDK的generateText()函数实现Mux视频资产和AI提供商之间的直接集成。为验证和测试多模态LLM连接提供了结构化的示例，包括流媒体和非流媒体文本生成能力。","ja":"AI SDKのgenerateText()関数を通じて、MuxビデオアセットとAIプロバイダーを直接統合します。ストリーミングとノンストリーミングのテキスト生成機能を備えた、マルチモーダルLLM接続の検証とテストのための構造化された例を提供します。","ko":"AI SDK의 generateText() 함수를 통해 Mux 비디오 자산과 AI 제공업체를 직접 통합합니다. 스트리밍 및 비스트리밍 텍스트 생성 기능을備えた 멀티모달 LLM 연결의 검증 및 테스트를 위한 구조화된 예제를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la integración directa entre los activos de video de Mux y los proveedores de inteligencia artificial a través de la función generateText() del SDK de IA. Proporciona ejemplos estructurados para validar y probar conexiones de LLM multimodales con capacidades de generación de texto de flujo y no de flujo.","fr":"Permet l''intégration directe entre les actifs vidéo Mux et les fournisseurs d''intelligence artificielle via la fonction generateText() du SDK d''IA. Fournit des exemples structurés pour valider et tester les connexions de LLM multimodales avec des capacités de génération de texte en flux et non en flux.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Integration zwischen Mux-Video-Anlagen und KI-Anbietern über die generateText()-Funktion des KI-SDK. Bietet strukturierte Beispiele für die Validierung und das Testen von multimodalen LLM-Verbindungen mit Streaming- und Nicht-Streaming-Textgenerierungsfunktionen.","pt":"Permite a integração direta entre ativos de vídeo Mux e fornecedores de IA por meio da função generateText() do SDK de IA. Fornece exemplos estruturados para validar e testar conexões de LLM multimodais com capacidades de geração de texto de streaming e não streaming.","ru":"Позволяет осуществлять прямую интеграцию между активами видео Mux и поставщиками ИИ через функцию generateText() SDK ИИ. Предоставляет структурированные примеры для проверки и тестирования подключений многомодальных LLM с возможностями потоковой и не-потоковой генерации текста.","ar":"تمكن من التكامل المباشر بين أصول فيديو Mux ومقدمي الذكاء الاصطناعي من خلال دالة generateText() من SDK الذكاء الاصطناعي. توفر أمثلة منظمة لتحقق واختبار الاتصالات متعددة التحديثات LLM مع قدرات توليد النص المتدفق وغير المتدفق."},"useCases":{"en":["Testing Mux video integration with multi-modal LLMs","Validating AI SDK function implementations across providers","Iterating on streaming vs non-streaming text generation workflows"],"zh":["测试Mux视频与多模态LLM的集成","验证AI SDK函数在不同提供商之间的实现","迭代流媒体和非流媒体文本生成工作流"],"ja":["MuxビデオとマルチモーダルLLMの統合をテストする","AI SDKの関数実装をプロバイダー間で検証する","ストリーミングとノンストリーミングのテキスト生成ワークフローを反復する"],"ko":["Mux 비디오와 멀티모달 LLM의 통합을 테스트합니다","AI SDK 함수 구현을 제공업체间에서 검증합니다","스트리밍 및 비스트리밍 텍스트 생성 워크플로우를 반복합니다"],"es":["Pruebas de integración de video de Mux con LLM multimodales","Validación de implementaciones de funciones del SDK de IA en varios proveedores","Iteración en flujos de trabajo de generación de texto en flujo y no en flujo"],"fr":["Tests d''intégration de la vidéo Mux avec des LLM multimodales","Validation des implémentations des fonctions du SDK d''IA auprès de plusieurs fournisseurs","Itération sur les flux de travail de génération de texte en flux et non en flux"],"de":["Testen der Mux-Video-Integration mit multimodalen LLM","Validierung von Implementierungen von KI-SDK-Funktionen bei verschiedenen Anbietern","Iterieren auf Streaming- und Nicht-Streaming-Textgenerierungs-Workflows"],"pt":["Testar a integração de vídeo Mux com LLMs multimodais","Validar implementações de funções do SDK de IA em fornecedores","Iterar em fluxos de trabalho de geração de texto de streaming e não streaming"],"ru":["Тестирование интеграции видео Mux с многомодальными LLM","Проверка реализаций функций SDK ИИ у поставщиков","Итерация по потокам генерации текста и не-потоковым рабочим процессам"],"ar":["اختبار دمج فيديو Mux مع LLMs متعددة التحديثات","تحقق من تنفيذ دوال SDK الذكاء الاصطناعي عبر مقدمي الخدمة","تكرار سير عمل توليد النص المتدفق وغير المتدفق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Mux account credentials","TypeScript library dependency","Limited to AI SDK compatible providers"],"zh":["需要Mux账户凭证","依赖TypeScript库","仅限于AI SDK兼容的提供商"],"ja":["Muxアカウントの資格情報が必要","TypeScriptライブラリに依存する","AI SDKと互換性のあるプロバイダーに限定される"],"ko":["Mux 계정 자격 증명이 필요합니다","TypeScript 라이브러리에 의존","AI SDK와 호환되는 공급자로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere credenciales de cuenta de Mux","Dependencia de biblioteca de TypeScript","Limitado a proveedores compatibles con el SDK de IA"],"fr":["Nécessite des informations d''identification de compte Mux","Dépendance de la bibliothèque TypeScript","Limité aux fournisseurs compatibles avec le SDK d''IA"],"de":["Benötigt Mux-Kontozugangsdaten","TypeScript-Bibliotheksabhängigkeit","Eingeschränkt auf KI-SDK-kompatible Anbieter"],"pt":["Requer credenciais de conta Mux","Dependência da biblioteca TypeScript","Limitado a fornecedores compatíveis com o SDK de IA"],"ru":["Требует учетных данных аккаунта Mux","Зависимость от библиотеки TypeScript","Ограничен поставщиками, совместимыми с SDK ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب بيانات اعتماد حساب Mux","اعتماد على مكتبة TypeScript","محدود بمقدمي الخدمة المتوافقة مع SDK الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a8bbd98d8873d65391d19b295e97f8911d2678d6f716730229c100b366024b26","qualityScore":50}');
