x-usage, framework rápido para DCC","ru":"ИИ Агенты: vx-usage, быстрый фреймворк для DCC","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: vx-usage، إطار سريع للتعاون الرقمي","en":"vx-usage"},"description":{"zh":"vx-usage是一个快速轻量的WebView框架，用于DCC软件开发，具有Rust和Python绑定","ja":"vx-usageはDCCソフトウェア開発向けの高速軽量なWebViewフレームワークで、RustとPythonバインディングを備えています","ko":"vx-usage는 DCC 소프트웨어 개발을 위한 빠르고 가벼운 WebView 프레임워크로, Rust와 Python 바인딩을 지원합니다","es":"vx-usage es un framework de WebView ligero y rápido para software de creación de contenido digital, construido con Rust y Python","fr":"vx-usage est un framework de WebView léger et rapide pour les logiciels de création de contenu numérique, construit avec Rust et Python","de":"vx-usage ist ein leichtes und schnelles WebView-Framework für DCC-Software, entwickelt mit Rust und Python","pt":"vx-usage é um framework leve e rápido para DCC, construído com Rust e Python bindings, ideal para aplicações de criação de conteúdo digital","ru":"vx-usage - быстрый и лёгкий фреймворк для DCC, построенный на Rust и Python bindings, подходящий для приложений цифрового контента","ar":"vx-usage هو إطار سريع وخفيف الوزن للتعاون الرقمي، مبني على Rust و Python bindings، مناسب لتطبيقات إنشاء المحتوى الرقمي","en":"A blazingly fast, lightweight WebView framework for DCC (Digital Content Creation) software, built with Rust and Python bindings."},"definition":{"en":"A blazingly fast, lightweight WebView framework for DCC (Digital Content Creation) software, built with Rust and Python bindings."},"features":{"zh":["快速轻量的WebView框架","Rust和Python绑定","适用于DCC软件开发","提升开发效率","支持多平台"],"ja":["高速軽量なWebViewフレームワーク","RustとPythonバインディング","DCCソフトウェア開発向け","開発効率の向上","マルチプラットフォーム対応"],"ko":["빠르고 가벼운 WebView 프레임워크","Rust와 Python 바인딩","DCC 소프트웨어 개발을 위한","개발 효율을 향상","멀티 플랫폼 지원"],"es":["Framework de WebView ligero y rápido","Construido con Rust y Python","Ideal para software de creación de contenido digital","Fácil de integrar y personalizar","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas"],"fr":["Framework de WebView léger et rapide","Construit avec Rust et Python","Idéal pour les logiciels de création de contenu numérique","Facile à intégrer et personnaliser","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Leichtes und schnelles WebView-Framework","Entwickelt mit Rust und Python","Ideal für DCC-Software","Einfach zu integrieren und anpassen","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Framework leve e rápido para DCC","Construído com Rust e Python bindings","Ideal para aplicações de criação de conteúdo digital","Suporte a visualização da web","Fácil integração com projetos existentes"],"ru":["Быстрый и лёгкий фреймворк для DCC","Построенный на Rust и Python bindings","Подходящий для приложений цифрового контента","Поддержка веб-представления","Лёгкая интеграция с существующими проектами"],"ar":["إطار سريع وخفيف الوزن للتعاون الرقمي","مبني على Rust و Python bindings","مناسب لتطبيقات إنشاء المحتوى الرقمي","دعم عرض ويب","تكامل سهل مع المشاريع الحالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["vx-usage安装","vx-usage教程","WebView框架","DCC软件开发","Rust和Python绑定","vx-usage替代品","vx-usage vs 其他框架"],"ja":["vx-usageのインストール","vx-usageのチュートリアル","WebViewフレームワーク","DCCソフトウェア開発","RustとPythonバインディング","vx-usageの代替","vx-usage vs 他のフレームワーク"],"ko":["vx-usage 설치","vx-usage 튜토리얼","WebView 프레임워크","DCC 소프트웨어 개발","Rust와 Python 바인딩","vx-usage 대안","vx-usage vs 다른 프레임워크"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","framework de WebView","software de creación de contenido digital","cómo usar vx-usage","vx-usage vs otros frameworks","instalación de vx-usage","guía de configuración de vx-usage","alternativas a vx-usage"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle","framework de WebView","logiciels de création de contenu numérique","comment utiliser vx-usage","vx-usage vs autres frameworks","installation de vx-usage","guide de configuration de vx-usage","alternatives à vx-usage"],"de":["KI-Tools","WebView-Framework","DCC-Software","wie man vx-usage verwendet","vx-usage vs andere Frameworks","Installation von vx-usage","Konfigurationsanleitung für vx-usage","Alternativen zu vx-usage"],"pt":["vx-usage","framework para DCC","Rust","Python bindings","criação de conteúdo digital","como usar vx-usage","vx-usage vs outros frameworks","instalar vx-usage"],"ru":["vx-usage","фреймворк для DCC","Rust","Python bindings","цифровой контент","как использовать vx-usage","vx-usage vs другие фреймворки","установить vx-usage"],"ar":["vx-usage","إطار للتعاون الرقمي","Rust","Python bindings","إنشاء المحتوى الرقمي","كيفية استخدام vx-usage","vx-usage مقابل إطارات أخرى","تثبيت vx-usage"]}},"owner":"loonghao","repo":"auroraview","repoPath":"loonghao/auroraview","stars":26,"forks":3,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T11:19:28Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vx-usage","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# VX - Universal Development Tool Manager\n\nvx is a universal development tool manager that automatically installs and manages\ndevelopment tools (Node.js, Python/uv, Go, Rust, etc.) with zero configuration.\n\n## Core Concept\n\nInstead of requiring users to manually install tools, prefix any command with `vx`:\n\n```bash\nvx node --version      # Auto-installs Node.js if needed\nvx uv pip install x    # Auto-installs uv if needed\nvx go build .          # Auto-installs Go if needed\nvx cargo build","body":"# VX - Universal Development Tool Manager\n\nvx is a universal development tool manager that automatically installs and manages\ndevelopment tools (Node.js, Python/uv, Go, Rust, etc.) with zero configuration.\n\n## Core Concept\n\nInstead of requiring users to manually install tools, prefix any command with `vx`:\n\n```bash\nvx node --version      # Auto-installs Node.js if needed\nvx uv pip install x    # Auto-installs uv if needed\nvx go build .          # Auto-installs Go if needed\nvx cargo build         # Auto-installs Rust if needed\nvx just test           # Auto-installs just if needed\n```\n\nvx is fully transparent - same commands, same arguments, just add `vx` prefix.\n\n## Essential Commands\n\n### Tool Execution (most common)\n```bash\nvx <tool> [args...]           # Run any tool (auto-installs if missing)\nvx node app.js                # Run Node.js\nvx python script.py           # Run Python (via uv)\nvx npm install                # Run npm\nvx npx create-react-app app   # Run npx\nvx cargo test                 # Run cargo\nvx just build                 # Run just (task runner)\nvx git status                 # Run git\n```\n\n### Tool Management\n```bash\nvx install node@22            # Install specific version\nvx install uv go rust         # Install multiple tools at once\nvx list                       # List all available tools\nvx list --installed           # List installed tools only\nvx versions node              # Show available versions\nvx switch node@20             # Switch active version\nvx uninstall go@1.21          # Remove a version\n```\n\n### Project Management\n```bash\nvx init                       # Initialize vx.toml for project\nvx sync                       # Install all tools from vx.toml\nvx setup                      # Full project setup (sync + hooks)\nvx dev                        # Enter dev environment with all tools\nvx run test                   # Run project scripts from vx.toml\nvx check                      # Verify tool constraints\nvx lock                       # Generate vx.lock for reproducibility\n```\n\n### Environment & Config\n```bash\nvx env list                   # List environments\nvx config show                # Show configuration\nvx cache info                 # Show cache usage\nvx search <query>             # Search available tools\nvx info                       # System info and capabilities\n```\n\n## Project Configuration (vx.toml)\n\nProjects use `vx.toml` in the root directory:\n\n```toml\n[tools]\nnode = \"22\"         # Major version\ngo = \"1.22\"         # Minor version\nuv = \"latest\"       # Always latest\nrust = \"1.80\"       # Specific version\njust = \"*\"          # Any version\n\n[scripts]\ndev = \"npm run dev\"\ntest = \"cargo test\"\nlint = \"npm run lint && cargo clippy\"\nbuild = \"just build\"\n\n[hooks]\npre_commit = [\"vx run lint\"]\npost_setup = [\"npm install\"]\n```\n\n## Using `--with` for Multi-Runtime\n\nWhen a command needs additional runtimes available:\n\n```bash\nvx --with bun node app.js     # Node.js + Bun in PATH\nvx --with deno npm test        # npm + Deno available\n```\n\n## Package Aliases\n\nvx supports **package aliases** — short commands that automatically route to ecosystem packages:\n\n```bash\n# These are equivalent:\nvx vite              # Same as: vx npm:vite\nvx vite@5.0          # Same as: vx npm:vite@5.0\nvx rez               # Same as: vx uv:rez\nvx pre-commit        # Same as: vx uv:pre-commit\nvx meson             # Same as: vx uv:meson\nvx release-please    # Same as: vx npm:release-please\n```\n\n**Benefits**:\n- Simpler commands without remembering ecosystem prefixes\n- Automatic runtime dependency management (node/python installed as needed)\n- Respects project `vx.toml` version configuration\n\n**Available Aliases**:\n| Short Command | Equivalent | Ecosystem |\n|--------------|------------|-----------|\n| `vx vite` | `vx npm:vite` | npm |\n| `vx release-please` | `vx npm:release-please` | npm |\n| `vx rez` | `vx uv:rez` | uv |\n| `vx pre-commit` | `vx uv:pre-commit` | uv |\n| `vx meson` | `vx uv:meson` | uv |\n\n## Companion Tool Environment Injection\n\nWhen `vx.toml` includes tools like MSVC, vx automatically injects discovery environment variables into **all** subprocess environments. This allows any tool needing a C/C++ compiler to discover the vx-managed installation.\n\n```toml\n# vx.toml — MSVC env vars injected for ALL tools\n[tools]\nnode = \"22\"\ncmake = \"3.28\"\nrust = \"1.82\"\n\n[tools.msvc]\nversion = \"14.42\"\nos = [\"windows\"]\n```\n\nNow tools like node-gyp, CMake, Cargo (cc crate) automatically find MSVC:\n\n```bash\n# node-gyp finds MSVC via VCINSTALLDIR\nvx npx node-gyp rebuild\n\n# CMake discovers the compiler\nvx cmake -B build -G \"Ninja\"\n\n# Cargo cc crate finds MSVC for C dependencies\nvx cargo build\n```\n\n**Injected Environment Variables** (MSVC example):\n| Variable | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|\n| `VCINSTALLDIR` | VS install path (node-gyp, CMake) |\n| `VCToolsInstallDir` | Exact toolchain path |\n| `VX_MSVC_ROOT` | vx MSVC root path |\n\n## MSVC Build Tools (Windows)\n\nMicrosoft Visual C++ compiler for Windows development:\n\n```bash\n# Install MSVC Build Tools\nvx install msvc@latest\nvx install msvc 14.40       # Specific version\n\n# Using MSVC tools via namespace\nvx msvc cl main.cpp -o main.exe\nvx msvc link main.obj\nvx msvc nmake\n\n# Direct aliases\nvx cl main.cpp              # Same as: vx msvc cl\nvx nmake                    # Same as: vx msvc nmake\n\n# Version-specific usage\nvx msvc@14.40 cl main.cpp\n```\n\n**Available MSVC Tools**:\n| Tool | Command | Description |\n|------|---------|-------------|\n| cl | `vx msvc cl` | C/C++ compiler |\n| link | `vx msvc link` | Linker |\n| lib | `vx msvc lib` | Library manager |\n| nmake | `vx msvc nmake` | Make utility |\n\n## Supported Tools (50+)\n\n| Category | Tools |\n|----------|-------|\n| JavaScript | node, npm, npx, bun, deno, pnpm, yarn, vite |\n| Python | uv, uvx, python, pip |\n| Rust | cargo, rustc, rustup |\n| Go | go, gofmt |\n| System | git, just, jq, cmake, make, ninja, meson |\n| Cloud | docker, kubectl, helm, awscli, azcli, gcloud, terraform |\n| .NET | dotnet, msbuild, nuget |\n| Other | zig, java, protoc, ffmpeg, gh, ollama, dagu, skills |\n\n## Important Rules for AI Agents\n\n1. **Always use `vx` prefix** when running tools in vx-managed projects\n2. **Use `vx just`** instead of `just` for task runner commands\n3. **Use `vx npm`** instead of `npm` directly\n4. **Use `vx cargo`** instead of `cargo` directly\n5. **Check `vx.toml`** first to understand project tool requirements\n6. **Use `vx run <script>`** for project-defined scripts\n7. **Never suggest manual tool installation** - vx handles it automatically\n8. Commands like `vx install` are for explicit pre-installation; normal usage auto-installs\n\n## GitHub Actions Integration\n\nvx provides a GitHub Action (`action.yml`) for CI/CD workflows. Use it in `.github/workflows/` files:\n\n### Basic Usage\n\n```yaml\n- uses: loonghao/vx@main\n  with:\n    version: ''latest''           # vx version (default: latest)\n    github-token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n```\n\n### Pre-install Tools\n\n```yaml\n- uses: loonghao/vx@main\n  with:\n    tools: ''node go uv''         # Space-separated tools to pre-install\n    cache: ''true''               # Enable tool caching (default: true)\n```\n\n### Project Setup (vx.toml)\n\n```yaml\n- uses: loonghao/vx@main\n  with:\n    setup: ''true''               # Run `vx setup --ci` for vx.toml projects\n```\n\n### Full Example\n\n```yaml\nname: CI\non: [push, pull_request]\n\njobs:\n  build:\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest, windows-latest]\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v6\n\n      - uses: loonghao/vx@main\n        with:\n          tools: ''node@22 uv''\n          setup: ''true''\n          cache: ''true''\n\n      - run: vx node --version\n      - run: vx npm test\n```\n\n### Action Inputs\n\n| Input | Default | Description |\n|-------|---------|-------------|\n| `version` | `latest` | vx version to install |\n| `github-token` | `${{ github.token }}` | GitHub token for API requests |\n| `tools` | `''''` | Space-separated tools to pre-install |\n| `cache` | `true` | Enable caching of ~/.vx directory |\n| `cache-key-prefix` | `vx-tools` | Custom prefix for cache key |\n| `setup` | `false` | Run `vx setup --ci` for vx.toml projects |\n\n### Action Outputs\n\n| Output | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `version` | The installed vx version |\n| `cache-hit` | Whether the cache was hit |\n\n## Docker Support\n\nvx provides a Docker image for containerized workflows:\n\n```dockerfile\n# Use vx as base image\nFROM ghcr.io/loonghao/vx:latest\n\n# Tools are auto-installed on first use\nRUN vx node --version\nRUN vx uv pip install mypackage\n```\n\n### Multi-stage Build with vx\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM ghcr.io/loonghao/vx:latest AS builder\nRUN vx node --version && vx npm ci && vx npm run build\n\nFROM nginx:alpine\nCOPY --from=builder /home/vx/dist /usr/share/nginx/html\n```\n\n### GitHub Actions with Docker\n\n```yaml\njobs:\n  build:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    container:\n      image: ghcr.io/loonghao/vx:latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v6\n      - run: vx node --version\n      - run: vx npm test\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T13:16:59.519Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated tool management and zero-configuration installations of Node.js, Python, Go, and Rust.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化工具管理和零配置安装 Node.js、Python、Go 和 Rust 的开发代理。","ja":"Node.js、Python、Go、Rust の自動化ツール管理とゼロコンフィギュレーションのインストールが必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Node.js, Python, Go 및 Rust의 자동화된 도구 관리 및 영구 구성 설치가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una gestión de herramientas automatizada y una instalación sin configuración de Node.js, Python, Go y Rust.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion d''outils automatisée et d''installations sans configuration de Node.js, Python, Go et Rust.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Toolverwaltung und Installationen ohne Konfiguration von Node.js, Python, Go und Rust benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de ferramentas automatizado e instalações de zero-configuração do Node.js, Python, Go e Rust.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходим автоматизированный менеджмент инструментов и установки с нулевой конфигурацией Node.js, Python, Go и Rust.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة أدوات أوتوماتيكية وتثبيتات بدون تكوين ل Node.js و Python و Go و Rust."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly install and manage development tools like Node.js, Python/uv, Go, and Rust, using a universal command prefix ''vx'', and supports protocols like Python bindings and Rust for efficient development workflows.","zh":"赋予代理无缝安装和管理开发工具的能力，如 Node.js、Python/uv、Go 和 Rust，使用通用命令前缀 ''vx''，并支持 Python 绑定和 Rust 等协议，以实现高效的开发工作流程。","ja":"エージェントに、Node.js、Python/uv、Go、Rust などの開発ツールをシームレスにインストールおよび管理する能力を与え、汎用コマンドプレフィックス ''vx'' を使用し、Python バインディングや Rust などのプロトコルをサポートして、効率的な開発ワークフローを実現します。","ko":"에이전트에게 Node.js, Python/uv, Go 및 Rust와 같은 개발 도구를 원활하게 설치하고 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 범용 명령어 접두사 ''vx''를 사용하고, Python 바인딩 및 Rust와 같은 프로토콜을 지원하여 효율적인 개발 워크플로우를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a instalar y gestionar herramientas de desarrollo como Node.js, Python/uv, Go y Rust de forma transparente, utilizando un prefijo de comando universal ''vx'', y admite protocolos como enlaces de Python y Rust para flujos de trabajo de desarrollo eficientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''installer et de gérer des outils de développement tels que Node.js, Python/uv, Go et Rust de manière transparente, en utilisant un préfixe de commande universel ''vx'', et prend en charge des protocoles tels que les liaisons Python et Rust pour des flux de travail de développement efficaces.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Entwicklungstools wie Node.js, Python/uv, Go und Rust nahtlos zu installieren und zu verwalten, indem sie ein universelles Kommandopräfix ''vx'' verwenden, und unterstützt Protokolle wie Python-Bindings und Rust für effiziente Entwicklungswerkflüsse.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a instalar e gerenciar ferramentas de desenvolvimento como Node.js, Python/uv, Go e Rust de forma transparente, utilizando um prefixo de comando universal ''vx'', e suporta protocolos como ligações Python e Rust para fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento eficientes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью бесшовно устанавливать и управлять инструментами разработки, такими как Node.js, Python/uv, Go и Rust, используя универсальный префикс команды ''vx'', и поддерживает протоколы, такие как привязки Python и Rust для эффективных рабочих процессов разработки.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تثبيت أدوات التطوير وإدارتها بسهولة، مثل Node.js و Python/uv و Go و Rust، باستخدام بادئة أمر عالمية ''vx''، ودعم البروتوكولات مثل ربط Python و Rust من أجل سير عمل تطوير فعال."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating tool installations for Node.js and Python projects","Streamlining development workflows with zero-configuration for Go and Rust","Simplifying command-line interactions with ''vx'' prefix for various tools"],"zh":["为 Node.js 和 Python 项目自动化工具安装","使用零配置为 Go 和 Rust 简化开发工作流程","使用 ''vx'' 前缀简化各种工具的命令行交互"],"ja":["Node.js と Python プロジェクトのツールインストールを自動化する","ゼロコンフィギュレーションで Go と Rust の開発ワークフローを最適化する","汎用コマンドプレフィックス ''vx'' を使用して、さまざまなツールのコマンドライン操作を簡素化する"],"ko":["Node.js 및 Python 프로젝트의 도구 설치 자동화","영구 구성으로 Go 및 Rust의 개발 워크플로우 최적화","범용 명령어 접두사 ''vx''를 사용하여 다양한 도구의 명령줄 상호작용 단순화"],"es":["Automatizar la instalación de herramientas para proyectos de Node.js y Python","Optimizar los flujos de trabajo de desarrollo con una configuración cero para Go y Rust","Simplificar las interacciones de línea de comandos con el prefijo ''vx'' para varias herramientas"],"fr":["Automatiser l''installation d''outils pour les projets Node.js et Python","Optimiser les flux de travail de développement avec une configuration zéro pour Go et Rust","Simplifier les interactions de ligne de commande avec le préfixe ''vx'' pour divers outils"],"de":["Automatisieren der Tool-Installation für Node.js- und Python-Projekte","Optimieren der Entwicklungswerkflüsse mit Nullkonfiguration für Go und Rust","Vereinfachen der Kommandozeileninteraktionen mit dem Präfix ''vx'' für verschiedene Tools"],"pt":["Automatizar a instalação de ferramentas para projetos Node.js e Python","Otimizar os fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento com zero-configuração para Go e Rust","Simplificar as interações de linha de comando com o prefixo ''vx'' para várias ferramentas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать установку инструментов для проектов Node.js и Python","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы разработки с нулевой конфигурацией для Go и Rust","Упростить взаимодействие с командной строкой с помощью префикса ''vx'' для различных инструментов"],"ar":["توفير تثبيت أدوات أوتوماتيكي لمشاريع Node.js و Python","تبسيط سير عمل التطوير بدون تكوين ل Go و Rust","تبسيط التفاعل مع سطر الأوامر باستخدام البادئة ''vx'' لأدوات مختلفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust and Python for bindings","Limited to supported tools like Node.js, Python/uv, Go, and Rust"],"zh":["需要 Rust 和 Python 来绑定","仅限支持的工具，如 Node.js、Python/uv、Go 和 Rust"],"ja":["バインディングには Rust と Python が必要","サポートされているツールのみ、たとえば Node.js、Python/uv、Go、Rust に限定される"],"ko":["바인딩을 위해 Rust 및 Python이 필요","지원되는 도구에만 한정되며, 예를 들어 Node.js, Python/uv, Go, Rust"],"es":["Requiere Rust y Python para enlaces","Limitado a herramientas compatibles como Node.js, Python/uv, Go y Rust"],"fr":["Nécessite Rust et Python pour les liaisons","Limité à des outils pris en charge tels que Node.js, Python/uv, Go et Rust"],"de":["Benötigt Rust und Python für Bindings","Begrenzt auf unterstützte Tools wie Node.js, Python/uv, Go und Rust"],"pt":["Exige Rust e Python para ligações","Limitado a ferramentas compatíveis como Node.js, Python/uv, Go e Rust"],"ru":["Требует Rust и Python для привязок","Ограничен инструментами, поддерживающими Node.js, Python/uv, Go и Rust"],"ar":["يتطلب Rust و Python للربط","محدود بالأدوات المدعومة مثل Node.js و Python/uv و Go و Rust"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6a28a7a342bc78d3541f3ab79cab147b309815bac26d54ad53dee5408ae8c581","qualityScore":50}');
