os desarrolladores personalizar la configuración de molienda","Integra con aplicaciones de seguimiento de café","Ofrece recomendaciones de configuración de molienda","Es compatible con diferentes tipos de granos de café"],"fr":["Améliore l''expérience utilisateur dans les applications de café","Permet aux développeurs de personnaliser la configuration de broyage","Intègre avec les applications de suivi de café","Offre des recommandations de configuration de broyage","Est compatible avec différents types de grains de café"],"de":["Verbessert die Benutzererfahrung in Kaffee-Apps","Ermöglicht es Entwicklern, die Mahleinstellung zu personalisieren","Integriert mit Kaffee-Tracking-Apps","Bietet Empfehlungen für die Mahleinstellung","Ist kompatibel mit verschiedenen Kaffeebohnen-Typen"],"pt":["Melhoria da eficiência em projetos de desenvolvimento","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","Otimização de processos de desenvolvimento","Aumento da produtividade dos desenvolvedores","Suporte à CLI para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Повышение эффективности в проектах разработки","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","Оптимизация процессов разработки","Увеличение производительности разработчиков","Поддержка CLI для разработчиков"],"ar":["تحسين الكفاءة في مشاريع التطوير","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","تحسين عمليات التطوير","زيادة إنتاجية المطورين","دعم CLI للمطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用openspec-continue-change","什么是AI智能工具","openspec-continue-change替代品","openspec-continue-change vs 其他工具","openspec-continue-change安装","openspec-continue-change设置指南","AI智能工具开发","自动化任务工具"],"ja":["openspec-continue-changeの使用方法","AIエージェントとは","openspec-continue-changeの代替","openspec-continue-change vs 他のツール","openspec-continue-changeのインストール","openspec-continue-changeの設定ガイド","AIエージェントの開発","自動化タスクツール"],"ko":["openspec-continue-change 사용 방법","AI 에이전트란","openspec-continue-change 대체","openspec-continue-change vs 다른 도구","openspec-continue-change 설치","openspec-continue-change 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 개발","자동화 작업 도구"],"es":["cómo utilizar openspec-continue-change","qué es openspec-continue-change","alternativas a openspec-continue-change","openspec-continue-change vs otros agentes de AI","instalación de openspec-continue-change","guía de configuración de openspec-continue-change","desarrollo de aplicaciones de café con openspec-continue-change"],"fr":["comment utiliser openspec-continue-change","qu''est-ce que openspec-continue-change","alternatives à openspec-continue-change","openspec-continue-change vs d''autres outils d''IA","installation d''openspec-continue-change","guide de configuration d''openspec-continue-change","développement d''applications de café avec openspec-continue-change"],"de":["wie man openspec-continue-change verwendet","was ist openspec-continue-change","alternativen zu openspec-continue-change","openspec-continue-change vs andere KI-Tools","installation von openspec-continue-change","konfigurationshandbuch für openspec-continue-change","entwicklung von kaffee-apps mit openspec-continue-change"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","como usar openspec-continue-change","o que é openspec-continue-change","alternativas para openspec-continue-change","instalação do openspec-continue-change","guia de configuração do openspec-continue-change","desenvolvimento de aplicações com react e python","otimização de processos de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["инструменты ии для разработчиков","как использовать openspec-continue-change","что такое openspec-continue-change","альтернативы для openspec-continue-change","установка openspec-continue-change","руководство по настройке openspec-continue-change","разработка приложений с использованием react и python","оптимизация процессов разработки"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","كيفية استخدام openspec-continue-change","ما هي openspec-continue-change","بديلات لopenspec-continue-change","تثبيت openspec-continue-change","دليل إعداد openspec-continue-change","تطوير التطبيقات باستخدام react و python","تحسين عمليات التطوير"]}},"owner":"fkoschi","repo":"grind-it","repoPath":"fkoschi/grind-it","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:05:19Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-continue-change","description":"Continue working on an OpenSpec change by creating the next artifact. Use when the user wants to progress their change, create the next artifact, or continue their workflow.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-","body":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-4 most recently modified changes as options, showing:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema (from `schema` field if present, otherwise \"spec-driven\")\n   - Status (e.g., \"0/5 tasks\", \"complete\", \"no tasks\")\n   - How recently it was modified (from `lastModified` field)\n\n   Mark the most recently modified change as \"(Recommended)\" since it''s likely what the user wants to continue.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check current status**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand current state. The response includes:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow schema being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - `artifacts`: Array of artifacts with their status (\"done\", \"ready\", \"blocked\")\n   - `isComplete`: Boolean indicating if all artifacts are complete\n\n3. **Act based on status**:\n\n   ***\n\n   **If all artifacts are complete (`isComplete: true`)**:\n   - Congratulate the user\n   - Show final status including the schema used\n   - Suggest: \"All artifacts created! You can now implement this change or archive it.\"\n   - STOP\n\n   ***\n\n   **If artifacts are ready to create** (status shows artifacts with `status: \"ready\"`):\n   - Pick the FIRST artifact with `status: \"ready\"` from the status output\n   - Get its instructions:\n     ```bash\n     openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n     ```\n   - Parse the JSON. The key fields are:\n     - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n     - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance\n     - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n     - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n   - **Create the artifact file**:\n     - Read any completed dependency files for context\n     - Use `template` as the structure - fill in its sections\n     - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints when writing - but do NOT copy them into the file\n     - Write to the output path specified in instructions\n   - Show what was created and what''s now unlocked\n   - STOP after creating ONE artifact\n\n   ***\n\n   **If no artifacts are ready (all blocked)**:\n   - This shouldn''t happen with a valid schema\n   - Show status and suggest checking for issues\n\n4. **After creating an artifact, show progress**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter each invocation, show:\n\n- Which artifact was created\n- Schema workflow being used\n- Current progress (N/M complete)\n- What artifacts are now unlocked\n- Prompt: \"Want to continue? Just ask me to continue or tell me what to do next.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\nThe artifact types and their purpose depend on the schema. Use the `instruction` field from the instructions output to understand what to create.\n\nCommon artifact patterns:\n\n**spec-driven schema** (proposal → specs → design → tasks):\n\n- **proposal.md**: Ask user about the change if not clear. Fill in Why, What Changes, Capabilities, Impact.\n  - The Capabilities section is critical - each capability listed will need a spec file.\n- **specs/<capability>/spec.md**: Create one spec per capability listed in the proposal''s Capabilities section (use the capability name, not the change name).\n- **design.md**: Document technical decisions, architecture, and implementation approach.\n- **tasks.md**: Break down implementation into checkboxed tasks.\n\nFor other schemas, follow the `instruction` field from the CLI output.\n\n**Guardrails**\n\n- Create ONE artifact per invocation\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- Never skip artifacts or create out of order\n- If context is unclear, ask the user before creating\n- Verify the artifact file exists after writing before marking progress\n- Use the schema''s artifact sequence, don''t assume specific artifact names\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:40:54.032Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing to manage and track changes in projects with advanced version control capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要管理和跟踪项目更改的开发代理，尤其是具有高级版本控制功能的项目。","ja":"開発エージェントがプロジェクトの変更を管理および追跡する必要がある場合に最適で、高度なバージョン管理機能を備えたプロジェクトに適しています。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 프로젝트의 변경을 관리 및 추적할 필요가 있는 경우에 적합하며, 고급 버전 관리 기능을 갖춘 프로젝트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan gestionar y realizar un seguimiento de los cambios en proyectos con capacidades de control de versiones avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui doivent gérer et suivre les modifications dans des projets disposant de fonctionnalités de contrôle de version avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die Änderungen in Projekten mit erweiterten Versionskontrollfunktionen verwalten und nachverfolgen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam gerenciar e rastrear alterações em projetos com capacidades de controle de versão avançadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходимо управлять и отслеживать изменения в проектах с расширенными возможностями системы контроля версий.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الناشئين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة وتتبع التغييرات في المشاريع ذات قدرات التحكم في الإصدار المتقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently continue working on changes by creating the next artifact, utilizing the openspec list command and AskUserQuestion tool to handle change selection and prompting, all while integrating with JSON data formats and command-line interfaces.","zh":"使代理能够通过创建下一个工件、利用openspec list命令和AskUserQuestion工具来处理更改选择和提示来高效地继续处理更改，同时与JSON数据格式和命令行接口集成。","ja":"エージェントが次のアーティファクトを作成し、openspec listコマンドとAskUserQuestionツールを使用して変更の選択とプロンプティングを処理しながら、JSONデータ形式とコマンドラインインターフェイスと統合して、変更を効率的に続行できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 다음 아티팩트를 생성하고 openspec list 명령 및 AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용하여 변경 선택 및 프롬프트를 처리하면서 JSON 데이터 형식 및 명령줄 인터페이스와 통합하여 변경을 효율적으로 계속할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a continuar trabajando en los cambios de manera eficiente creando el próximo artefacto, utilizando el comando de lista openspec y la herramienta AskUserQuestion para manejar la selección y la solicitud de cambios, todo mientras se integra con formatos de datos JSON e interfaces de línea de comandos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de continuer à travailler sur les modifications de manière efficace en créant le prochain artefact, en utilisant la commande de liste openspec et l''outil AskUserQuestion pour gérer la sélection et la sollicitation des modifications, le tout tout en s''intégrant avec des formats de données JSON et des interfaces de ligne de commande.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Änderungen effizient fortzusetzen, indem sie das nächste Artefakt erstellen, das openspec-Listenkommando und das Tool AskUserQuestion zur Änderungsauswahl und -anfrage verwenden, während sie sich in JSON-Datiformate und Kommandozeilenoberflächen integrieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a continuar trabalhando nas alterações de forma eficiente, criando o próximo artifact, utilizando o comando openspec list e a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para lidar com a seleção e solicitação de alterações, integrando-se com formatos de dados JSON e interfaces de linha de comando.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно продолжать работать над изменениями, создавая следующий артефакт, используя команду openspec list и инструмент AskUserQuestion для обработки выбора и запроса изменений, интегрируясь с форматами данных JSON и интерфейсами командной строки.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الاستمرار في العمل على التغييرات بفعالية من خلال إنشاء الملف القادم، واستخدام أمر openspec list وأداة AskUserQuestion لمعالجة اختيار التغييرات والاستفسار عنها، مع التكامل مع تنسيقات بيانات JSON وواجهات سطر الأوامر."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating change tracking in collaborative projects","Generating lists of available changes for user selection","Prompting users for change selection when names are omitted or ambiguous"],"zh":["在协作项目中自动化更改跟踪","为用户选择生成可用更改列表","当更改名称省略或模糊时提示用户选择更改"],"ja":["コラボレーションプロジェクトでの変更追跡の自動化","ユーザー選択のために利用可能な変更の一覧を生成する","変更名が省略または曖昧な場合にユーザーに変更の選択を求める"],"ko":["협업 프로젝트에서 변경 추적 자동화","사용자 선택을 위해 사용 가능한 변경 목록 생성","변경 이름이 생략되거나 모호한 경우 사용자에게 변경 선택을 요구"],"es":["Automatización del seguimiento de cambios en proyectos colaborativos","Generación de listas de cambios disponibles para la selección del usuario","Solicitud de selección de cambios al usuario cuando los nombres son omitidos o ambiguos"],"fr":["Automatisation du suivi des modifications dans les projets collaboratifs","Génération de listes de modifications disponibles pour la sélection de l''utilisateur","Demande de sélection de modifications à l''utilisateur lorsque les noms sont omis ou ambigus"],"de":["Automatisierung der Änderungsverfolgung in kollaborativen Projekten","Erstellung von Listen verfügbarer Änderungen für die Benutzerauswahl","Aufforderung zur Änderungsauswahl durch den Benutzer, wenn Namen weggelassen oder mehrdeutig sind"],"pt":["Automatizar o rastreamento de alterações em projetos colaborativos","Gerar listas de alterações disponíveis para seleção do usuário","Solicitar ao usuário a seleção de alterações quando os nomes são omitidos ou ambíguos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать отслеживание изменений в совместных проектах","Генерировать списки доступных изменений для выбора пользователя","Запрашивать у пользователя выбор изменений, когда имена опущены или неоднозначны"],"ar":["تأتمتة تتبع التغييرات في المشاريع التعاونية","توليد قوائم التغييرات المتاحة لاختيار المستخدم","طالب المستخدم باختيار التغييرات عندما يتم تحذف الأسماء أو يكون لها أكثر من معنى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Dependent on conversation context for change name inference","Limited to top 3 changes for user selection"],"zh":["需要openspec安装和配置","依赖对话上下文进行更改名称推断","仅限于用户选择的前3个更改"],"ja":["openspecのインストールと設定が必要","会話のコンテキストに依存して変更名の推論を行う","ユーザー選択の変更は最大3つに限定される"],"ko":["openspec 설치 및 구성 필요","대화 문脈에 의존하여 변경 이름 추론","사용자 선택 변경은 최대 3개로 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de openspec","Depende del contexto de la conversación para la inferencia del nombre de la modificación","Limitado a los 3 primeros cambios para la selección del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration d''openspec","Dépend du contexte de la conversation pour l''inférence du nom de la modification","Limité aux 3 premières modifications pour la sélection de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation und Konfiguration von openspec","Hängt vom Gesprächskontext für die Ableitung des Änderungsnamens ab","Begrenzt auf die ersten 3 Änderungen für die Benutzerauswahl"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do openspec","Depende do contexto da conversa para inferência do nome da alteração","Limitado a 3 alterações principais para seleção do usuário"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации openspec","Зависит от контекста разговора для вывода имени изменения","Ограничен до 3 верхних изменений для выбора пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتهيئة openspec","يعتمد على سياق المحادثة لاستنتاج اسم التغيير","محدود بالتغييرات الثلاث الأولى لاختيار المستخدم"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d0fbc067936de6bea93e611b962d6fa0fd58bcd47b1fe8ee529fa0c97c1afd9d","qualityScore":50}');
